<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">MMK- Zul</book>
  <para style="h">ACT</para>
  <para style="toc3">MMK</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mbap kə mən Kartən kə Yesu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tǝlankur Mbap kə mən kartən kə Yesu</para>
  <para style="mt1">ACT</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Muntu kan rǝsh gwa na wokoci rǝshiyi:</char> Tǝlankur kǝno Luka ni rǝshi, kan arni wule kopi kaar kǝ Zo shirǝm kǝ Yesu kan tǝ rǝsh gwa. Luka kari ni bar mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Tiyopilus na shirǝm kǝ Yesu. Jen ba shin wule rǝsh ni tǝlankuri bar kǝ AD 63, jen ngapo wu shin rǝsh ni gip AD 70.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Argon tu gipi gwa:</char> Luka pa'i ni shirǝm gǝs den argon tu Yesu pi den kaar kǝ tlitǝn gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝm gwa. Tǝ pare ni tǝlankuri den mbap kǝ mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na totǝn kǝ Yesu yami. Kan ar ba shirǝm den kandatu mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na nami mǝn kopi ɓut gip Urushalima den bi la'itǝn kǝ argon tu Yesu wule ti bi wur gwa. Den gas Pentikos, muri kutl den kaar kǝ totǝn gǝs yamo, Ruhu kǝ Yam sur den wur kan ba laa'i wur na mani pi bari. Bar tu pǝn den gas tawo ar ni mǝn kopi Yesu pi ta womtitǝn bǝle-bǝle, argon tu nǝm gip bǝn kǝ Urushalima ar ba te Samariya na &lt;&lt;gip atl kundǝrǝndlip gwa.&gt;&gt; Sura 1.8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gip kǝti kǝ nǝm kǝ tǝlankuriwo, shirǝmi bǝtl ni gam den Bitǝrus nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na den domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi gip bǝn kǝ Urushalima. Argon tu nǝm sura kǝ 9 ar ba ri cinawo arni den ɓomi asǝm bisi myakan kǝ Bulus nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu gip atl kǝ Roma, na ɓomi asǝm gǝs kǝ sitǝn cina dǝ bom tloyi shirǝm kǝ bar gun kǝ Roma.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Argon tu arba yari gwa:</char> Tǝlankur kǝno ar yari ni kandatu domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi pare gwa na bar ju ar kop gipi gip nartǝn gǝsi, den ngashi gam kǝ mǝn kopi na kumi dli. Ar pa shirǝm den kandatu mbarǝm na womti den ta bi gam gǝzǝn kǝ dǝ Yesu dǝm gun gip mbatl gǝzǝni na ndǝrtǝn gip mbap kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam gip ga domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi na gip dǝmi kǝ kogonge mǝn kopi Yesu.</para>
  <para style="cl">MBAP KƏ MIR MƏN KARTƏN KƏ YESU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Totǝn kǝ Yesu yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mǝn nartǝn Tiyopilus, gip tǝlankur gǝn kǝ pari kan a rǝsho, a rǝsh ni den kup bar ju Yesu pare pi na kulci mbarǝm gwa, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />ar ba ri den pǝt tu kan pǝn tǝka to yamka gwa. Kapǝn tǝ ndarawo, tǝ yari mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kan tǝ zǝzari bar ju wi pi nan Ruhu kǝ Yam ba ne wur amra wu pi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Den kaar kǝ kumi dli na mǝshtǝn gǝso, tǝ ɗǝl kar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs ju den tǝp na womti nan ba mom'e tǝ ra na rai gwa. Tǝ ɗǝl kar wur gip muri hauya rop kan tǝ shirǝm nan wur den dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Den pǝti gon nan tǝ ɗǝl kar wur tǝ den ci fingal nan wuro, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ za ni Urushalimawu da'a, ama ɓutni dǝ Bǝba la'i in na Ruhu kǝ Yam kan tǝ wule ti bi ine, muntu kǝ kum a shirǝm dene gwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana pini mbarǝm batisma na male, ama gip muri njem cina ɗewo, baa pi in batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Nan wu mo gam kǝ ba lasi nǝmo, arni wu ngen momi kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kǝkǝn ni kǝ ri kǝ pali Isra'ila dǝmi na gun kǝ gam gǝsa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Momi pǝt na wokociwo gegin ni da'a, domici Bǝba ni gip mani pi bar gǝs ne gam gǝs momi muntu. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama ki zam mani pi bari, Ruhu kǝ Yam ni sur den kǝn wu gwa. Ki dǝm mǝn yari bar ju kǝ shin demǝn gip bǝn Urushalima, na atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda kup na Samariya, an ri gip atl kundǝrǝndlip.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo, kan Yam ba pǝn tika to gip dun yamka den ger gǝzǝni wu den shini ar bari wu'i mani shini gǝs da'a.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Wu gip zhiti ndekeke to yamka nan Yesu den totǝno, arni curut mbarǝm rop jen ni jǝn dlor markǝm dawur na ghol tutul dli. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Galili, unun kem kǝ dǝm den wi ger to yamkawu? Yesu tu kan pǝn tǝka kar kǝn ba te ti yamkawo, baa pal den nǝm tǝp tu kǝ shin pǝn tǝka to yamka gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zǝzar Matiyas den am kǝ Yahuda Iskaryoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kano mir mǝn kartǝni ba za Tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaitun wu pal su Urushalimaka, ɓomi asǝm bar kǝ tatli dlom kǝ mil nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Nan wu mbubar gip bǝn kǝ Urushalimawo, arni wu to gǝzǝn gip ɓiti kushi kǝ to yamika las tu kan wu dǝm gwa. Munju ra lasi gwani'e Bitǝrus, Yohana, Yakubu, Andǝrawus, Filibus na Toma, Bartilamawus na Matta. Yakubu nya Halfa, Simon mǝn ghuve den bǝn gǝsi, na Yahuda nya Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Kup gǝzǝn ci cina na me gam na shirǝm na Yam na mbatl nǝm, na mǝtliyi, na Maryamu mǝn gǝri kǝ Yesu na mir mǝn gǝpi gǝsi.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Gip muri jawo, Bitǝrus tlyam dlor gip mir ɓyar mǝn kopi Yesu (womtitǝn gǝzǝn ri hauya mukka) <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, ar nǝm dǝ Tǝlankur laa'i den shirǝm tu Ruhu kǝ Yam yari terka bi dǝ gun Dauda den Yahuda, muntu kan pii tǝp munju nǝm Yesu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Tǝ Yahuda ma nǝm gip mi ni, kan ra na am gip mbap gǝmi kǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Mbarǝm tu Yahuda wur ni las na wurpi tu tǝ zam den ɗasi tu gǝs gwa, las tu tǝ nda sur atl na dlom gam, tu gǝs ba mbutlka, kan wot gǝs kup ba ɗǝlka kari. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Mbarǝm kǝ Urushalima kup kum bar tu, kan wu labi lasi na bi gǝzǝn'e Akeldama, &lt;&lt;Las tu kan shot bǝran gwa ituwi.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Bitǝrus ci cina tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Untuni anra na rǝshi gip tǝlankur Zabura'e, &lt;Naa dǝ bom gǝs sa koni, ba dǝ zam murgon kan ba dǝm gipi gwa da'a.&gt; Eso, &lt;Naa dǝ gon nǝm mbap gǝsi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />&lt;&lt;Untuno, ar nǝm dǝ zǝzar nǝm gip mbarǝm ju nan ra nan mi kup wokoci tu mǝn den ritǝn na Babom gǝmi Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />pare den batisma gǝs kan Yohana pi ti, an ri gas tu pǝn tǝka kar mi gwa. Nǝm gip munju zǝzariwo, ti dǝm nan mi gip yari mbarǝm kandatu mǝ shin Yesu tli gip mǝshi mbarǝm gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Arni wu bi sun kǝ mbarǝm rop: Isubu mǝn sun Barsabas (kan mom ti na Yustus gwa) na Matiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kano wu shirǝm na Yam wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kini kǝ mom mbatl kǝ mbarǝm kup. Nune mi gonge ni kǝ zǝzari gip rop ju <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kan baa pǝn las mbap kǝ mir mǝn kartǝn gi kǝn, muntu Yahuda zaka tǝ ndara las gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kan wu zǝzar ti tǝp kǝ ba la'i guri'a, arni ar nda den Matiyas. Arni wu la ti gip wur tǝ dǝm nye mǝn kartǝn nǝm na kutl cet nǝmi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Surtǝn kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam den gas Pentikos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Nan gas nyel kan ba wul ti'e Pentikos ɗiro, arni kup mǝn kopi mo gam kǝba lasi nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Karap, se ba kum ghughughu sur yam wule hortǝn kǝ bar itǝri, kan arba laa'i kup bomi ka las tu wu dǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Arni wu shin argon wule bǝlǝm utu ɗǝl ba gǝzan den gam kǝ kogonge gip wuri. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kan ba laa'i kup gǝzǝn na Ruhu kǝ Yam kan wu nǝm shirǝm na bi jeni, kandatu Ruhu bi wur mani pi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Gip muri jawo mǝn Yahuda mǝn kopi kulci kǝ Musa asǝm na gǝs nan ɗǝl ɗir gip atl kundǝrǝndlip ra su Urushalimaka. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Nan wu kum bar larǝmtǝn tuwo, wu dom wur kǝba lasi nǝm ghiru-ghiru, domici kogonge gǝzǝn kum wur den shirǝm gip bi gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Na bar dlǝkǝntǝne arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kup mbarǝm mǝn shirǝm juwo mǝn Galili ni diya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ra imni fa kogonge gǝmi ba kum wur den shirǝm na bi gǝmiwu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Mǝn ni jin mǝn Partiya, na mǝn Midiya, mǝn Elama, mǝn dǝmi gip Mesopotamiya, mǝn Yahuda, mbarǝm kǝ Kapadokiya, na Pontus, na Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />mǝn Pirijiya, mǝn Pamfiliya, mbarǝm kǝ Masar, na kǝti jen gip Libǝya kosak na Sairin, mǝn dǝki kan ɗǝl tor Roma gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Gip miwo mǝn Yahuda ra na datemi gip kopi Yam kǝ mǝn Yahuda, mǝn Karita ra, na mbarǝm kǝ Arab. Kup gǝmi den kumi gǝzǝn den yari kiri bar ju Yam pi gwa gip bi gǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kan wu dlǝr gip nǝmi bi na am na damtǝne, wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu ba pi untuwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ama jen gip womti mbarǝmi mbur wurka kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Wu laa'i tu na zili mal wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazu kǝ Bitǝrus gas nyel Pentikos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Kan Bitǝrus ba tlyam dlor na nami mir mǝn kartǝn kutl-cet nǝmi, tǝ tli yar tǝ shirǝm na womti mbarǝmi tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar mǝn Yahuda na kup gin kan ba dǝm gip Urushalima gwa, na dǝ ceti in gamka. Neni kǝm gin ɗe kǝ kumni shirǝm gǝni. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Mbarǝm juwo wu tla ni zili mal kandatu kǝ pǝn gwa da'a. Gǝlla am ghanum ni'i kǝ cigǝni katl. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />O'o, muntu ni'e argon tu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Yowel yari gwa'e,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Yam wule, &lt;Gip muri kǝ pa'i baro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Aa shoti Ruhu gǝn den mbarǝm gǝn kup.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mimir gin moni na mǝtli ba shin ge shirǝm kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Ɗal mir moni gin ba shin ruya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Mir korsi gin ba tloni tlone.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Kup na zher gin moni na mǝtli ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Aa shoti wur Ruhu gǝn gip muri ja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kan wu yari shirǝm gǝni.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Aa pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn to gip dlom yamka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Na bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am sur den atli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Bǝran na utu na dun kunu.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Pǝt ba palka dǝmǝni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kan dǝ kyar palka bǝrani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kapǝn dǝ bar pǝt kǝ Babom Yam ɗiri.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kup murgon tu ba la bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">sun kǝ Babom kǝ zami ɗǝltǝno, ti zam ɗǝltǝne.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar mǝn Isra'ila, kum ni shirǝm tu. Yesu kǝ Nazarato mbarǝm ni kan Yam pi kiri bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn gip dlom gin tǝp kar ti, kandatu kǝn na gam gin mom gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Bi mbarǝm tuka gip am gin kandatu Yam ne terka den untun ba pi gwa, kan kǝn na ne amra kǝ mbarǝm mǝn ɗasi tu ba kem tǝ mǝsh tǝp kǝ ba ɓa'i gǝs den kini. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ama Yam tli tika gip mǝshi mbarǝme, ba ɗǝli tǝka gip dun mbatl kǝ mǝshtǝni, domici mǝshtǝn baa mani nǝmi gǝs da'a. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Gun Dauda yari den ti'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">&lt;A shin Babom Yam ra cina da'ǝm ko gǝgasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Domici tǝ ra namǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">a jǝrkǝtka da'a.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ra'untuwo, mbatl gǝn gholi kan bi gǝn ba pi shirǝm ɗǝɗa gǝsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Aa pa dǝm na la'i mbatli,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Domici ki za'ǝmka gip gambǝci'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ko kǝ za Zo'i gi kan kǝ ne markǝm gwa tǝ moka da'a.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kǝ kem a mom tǝp kopi dǝ zam rai wi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ki la im na ghol mbatl cina da'i.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, ami na bigul kǝ shirǝm nan kǝn den'e kori gǝmi Dauda mǝshka kan ba kap tǝka, gambǝci gǝs ra ɗe har sekǝni. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ama tǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni kan mom den Yam yari na ɓe am atl den'e ti ne nǝm gip gǝsgal gǝs tǝ dǝm den dandi gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Gip shini bar tu kan baa pi cina ɗewo, Dauda shirǝm den tlitǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝm kǝ Almasihu, den Yam za Almasihu gip gambǝci'e, ko tǝ za dli gǝs ar moka da'a. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yam tli Yesu tu gip mǝshi mbarǝme, mǝn ngapo mǝ shin muntu na ger gǝmi ar ni mǝ yari ine. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yam ɗǝɗa ti na ne gǝs den am shimli gǝsi, nan tǝ nǝm Ruhu kan Yam wule ti bi gwa, arni tǝ shoti den mi, muntu kǝ shin kan kǝ pa kum kǝkǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Yam pǝnni Dauda to yamka kandatu tǝ pi Yesu gwa da'a, ngapo tǝ wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;Babom wul Babom gǝn'e, Dǝm den am shimli gǝni,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Se amin a kem mǝn nge gi dǝm ba ne asǝm gi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Den untuwo, naa dǝ mǝn Isra'ila kup mom'e, Yam ni pali Yesu tu, muntu kan kǝ ɓa den kin gwa, tǝ dǝm ti ni'e Babomi na Almasihu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Nan womti mbarǝmi kum shirǝm tuwo, ar nǝm mbatl gǝzǝni kan wu wul Bitǝrus na nami mir mǝn kartǝni'e, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, ununu mi piwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Bitǝrus nǝmi wur'e, &lt;&lt;Cini atl gam kar Yam kan dǝ pi kogonge gin batisma gip sun kǝ Yesu Almasihu kǝ dǝ pǝn warwat pitǝn gin ka. Untuni Yam ba bi in Ruhu gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Domici argon tu Yam wule ti pi in kǝn na mimir gini, na kup munju kan bǝn gǝzǝn dlyam nar na kup munju Babom Yam gǝmi ba la wur bi gwani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Na shirǝm jen na womti arni Bitǝrus dǝli wur kǝme, kan tǝ lir wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ɗǝli ni gam ginka gip wani pitǝn kǝ zhan kǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Munju kan nǝm shirǝm tu Bitǝrus yariwo, arni pi wur batisma, bar kǝ mbarǝm zangu myakan ni mbǝl wur ra den womtitǝn kǝ mǝn kopi gas ta.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝmi kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ ba lasi nǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wu bi gam gǝzǝn gip zami kulci kar mir mǝn kartǝni, na me gami, na gip ci fingal gip bom kǝ ezǝn na shirǝm na Yami.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Bǝrti nǝm nami mbarǝmi naari, kan mir mǝn kartǝni ba pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am gip dlǝkǝntǝn na womti. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Kup mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu ra kǝ ba lasi nǝm na bi bar ezǝn kandatu bi kogonge gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Arni jen wur bar gǝzǝnka kan wu bi wurpiyi dǝ rabe gip dlom gǝzǝn den bi argon tu kogonge gip wur ba ndu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Den pǝt kupo wu ci cina na me gam gip dǝbom bom kǝ Yami. Wu ci fingal kǝ Babom gip bom kǝ ezǝn na ghol mbatli, na mbatl nǝm, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />wu den ɗǝɗa Yami na zami cirtǝn kar mbarǝm kup. Den kogonge pǝto Babom Yesu pi ta mbǝli ra den womtitǝn gǝzǝn na munju kan zam ɗǝltǝn gwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus pali kurki mbarǝm lau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Gasi gono, Bitǝrus na Yohana ra bǝdlabǝn Bom kǝ Yam wokoci kǝ shirǝm na Yam bar kǝ gǝlla am myakan kǝ pǝte. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Kurki mbarǝm gon ra kan gǝr ti untu muntu ba ne ti bǝdlabǝn Bom kǝ Yam kan ba wul ti'e Mbuni Bǝdlabǝni. Ba kur ne tǝ ni lasi den kogonge pǝt kǝ liri bar kar munju kan ba te gip Bom kǝ Yami gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nan tǝ shin Bitǝrus na Yohana den tetǝn gipiwo, arni tǝ lir wur wurpi. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Arni wu wi ti ger ndekeke, kan Bitǝrus ba wule, &lt;&lt;Shin mi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kan kurkuyi ba wi wur ger tǝ shin wule tǝ ri kǝ zami argon kar wur ituwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Wurpiyo ami nari da'a, ama argon tu aa mani pi'iwo ar ni'e, gip sun kǝ Yesu Almasihu kǝ Nazarat, tlyam kǝ desi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Kano Bitǝrus ba nǝm ti na am shimli, ba tli ti yami, lasi, arni yar asǝm gǝs na gamghurǝm kǝ mbarǝmi ndǝri. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kan tǝ ɓo tuma, tǝ nǝm desi. Kan tǝ te gip bǝdlabǝn bom kǝ Yam nan wur tǝ den desi na tumatǝn tǝ den ɗǝɗa Yami. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Nan mbarǝm kup shin ti den desi atl na ɗǝɗa Yamo, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />kan wu mom den ti ni'e muntu kan ba kur dǝm kǝ liri bar bi bǝdlabǝn Bom kǝ Yam kan ba la ti bi Mbuni Bǝdlabǝn gwa. Arni mbarǝm nǝm bi na am gip dlǝkǝntǝn den argon tu zam mbarǝmi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazu kǝ Bitǝrus gip Bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Nan mǝn liri bari ra dlakǝt na ga Bitǝrus na Yohanawo, arni kup mbarǝmi kan gip nǝmi bi na am ba kǝtǝr su las tu kan ba la ti bi'e ba shukutǝn kǝ Solomon gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Nan Bitǝrus shin untuwo, arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila, unu ni'e bar ki nǝmi bi na am den muntu wu? Kan unun kem kǝ wi mi ger untu wule na ndǝrtǝn ko ho pitǝn gǝmi ni mbarǝm kǝn mani desi esi? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Yam kǝ ga Ibǝrahim, Ishaku, na Yakubu, Yam kǝ ga kori gǝmi, tin tǝ ɗǝɗa zher gǝs Yesu. Kǝn ni kǝ kem dǝ ri ti eka na nge gǝs den'e mǝn wani pitǝn ni cina dǝ Bilatus, kup na Bilatus pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs den ti za ti tǝ ndara gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Kǝ nge Yesu muntu bi Yam gam gǝs kan ba pi dlat gwa. Kǝ ngen dǝ pǝtli in mǝn ri mbarǝm eka. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Kǝ ri muntu ba kop na mbarǝm wu zam rai kan ba pa dagwa eka, ama Yam tli tǝka gip mǝshi. Miwo mǝ yarini bar ju mǝ shin na ger gǝmi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ngǝshtǝn den Yam den argon tu sun kǝ Yesu ba pi gwani kem mbarǝm kǝn kan kǝ shin kǝ pa mom gwa kǝ ndǝrtǝni. Na ho bi, ngǝshtǝn den Yam gip sun kǝ Yesu ni bi mbarǝm kǝn paltǝn lau, kandatu kǝ shin gwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno, mir ɓyari, a mom'e kǝn na kiri kǝ bǝn gin pini untu gip dǝmǝn gam momi'e Yesu ni'e Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ama na untuni Yam laa'i argon tu tǝ yari terka tǝp bi dǝ kup mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, den'e Almasihu gǝs ba kum dli. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Cini atl gam kǝkǝni, kǝ palni kar Yami, kǝ dǝ tǝ pash kǝnka den warwat pitǝn gini. Na untuni wokoci ba ɗir kan ti ndǝri in bigul hoyi, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />kan dǝ Yam kari in bar na Almasihu, muntu kan tǝ zǝzari in terka den tǝ dǝm gun gip mbatl gin gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ar nǝm tǝ dǝm to yamka an ri wokoci tu Yam ba pali bar kup peli kandatu tǝ yari terka bi dǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ju tǝ zǝzari kǝ dǝ wu yari mbarǝm mbatl gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kum ni argon tu Musa yari gwa, &lt;Babom Yam gin ba tli in mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon wule ami gip ya'ǝni. Ar nǝm kǝn kǝ kop ni kup argon tu tǝ yari in gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Kup murgon tu nge kopi gǝso ba ɗǝli tika gip mbarǝm kǝ Yami.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Untuni, kup nami mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam pare den Sama'ila shirǝm den argon tu den pitǝn gip muri jin gwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Kǝn nan mi ni'e munju kan Yam kari wur bar na Almasihu kandatu mǝn shirǝm na Yam wule ti pi, gip gudlum shirǝm tu kan Yam pi ga kori gǝmi kan nan mi ma. Yam yari Ibǝrahim den Almasihu'e, &lt;Aa ɗǝɗa mbarǝm kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip den argon tu gǝsgal gi ba pi gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nan Yam tli zher gǝso, kan tǝ pare kari gǝs kar kǝn kǝ dǝ tǝ ne am kogonge gip kǝn kan za pitǝn kǝ ɗasi tu den bi pi argon tu baa gholi Yam mbatl gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus na Yohana cina dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na bari kǝ mǝn ɓuti Bom kǝ Yam na mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Sadukiya ɗir nan Bitǝrus na Yohana ra gip shirǝm na mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Lo ci wur nar den ga Bitǝrus na Yohana den kulci mbarǝm na wazu den'e Yesu tli gip mǝshi mbarǝme. Untu ni ba gode'e mǝshi mbarǝm ba tli na rai esi. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kan wu nǝm ga Bitǝrus na Yohana, ama domici sit piwo, kan wu la wur gip bom kǝ moni wu mur lasi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ama na womti gip mbarǝmi kan kum wazu gǝzǝn ngǝsh wur den Yesu, kan womtitǝn gǝzǝn ba ri mbarǝm zangu nantam (5,000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Bar tlowo arni kiri kǝ bǝni, mir korsi na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa mo gam su Urushalima ka. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Hanana bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa ra lasi, na Kayafa, na Yohana, na Alekzanda na kup mbarǝm kǝ bom kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kan wu ɗǝli Bitǝrus na Yohana ter dlom da wur kan wu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Imni kǝ mani pi muntuwu? Na sun kǝ woni kǝ pi bar tuwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Bitǝrus laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yami, arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn bǝn na kiri kǝ bǝni! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Sekǝno, kin den ngeni momi kar mi den ho bar tu pi kurki tu kan tǝ pal lau gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Mǝ ndu kǝn na nami mǝn Isra'ila kup mom'e sun kǝ Yesu Almasihu kǝ Nazarat ni pǝni ti kumi dli gǝska kan tǝ mani dlǝri cina da'ine. Kǝn ni kǝ kem dǝ ri ti eka tǝp kǝ ba ɓa'i gǝs den kini, ama Yam tli ti na rai lasi. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu ni shirǝm den ti gip Tǝlankur'e, &lt;Tat tu kan kǝn mǝn tu'i bin nge, muntu kan pal bar ho tat gip tati kup gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Zami ɗǝltǝno tǝp kar Yesu ni nan gǝsi. Sun gon ra es den kaar bar atl kǝn kundǝrǝndlip kan bi mbarǝm kǝ zami ɗǝltǝn gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Nan mǝn domtǝn kǝ tloyi shirǝmi shin ɓa'i mbatl dlom gam kǝ Bitǝrus na Yohana kǝ shirǝm bat na bǝrtiwo ar kem wur kǝ nǝmi bi na ame. Wu mom'e wu pi kushi rǝshi gip Shirǝm kǝ Yam da'a, mbarǝm ni kan pǝn wur den argon ni dawo, arni wu mom'e wu zamni dǝmi na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ama nan wu shin mbarǝm tu kan pǝni ti kumi dliyika dlor nan wuro, wu'i mbu yari argon mǝgǝni da'a. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Arni wu ɗǝli wurka kǝ ba domtǝni, kan wu bali gip dlom gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Imni mi pi na mbarǝm juwe? Artu kup muntu kan ba dǝm gip Urushalima mom'e mbarǝm ju pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am kan mi mani nge mǝ wule larni gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ama kǝ dǝ kem ba dǝ mbarǝm kup kum shirǝm tu dawo, mi dǝli wur kǝme ba wu'i shirǝm na murgon gip sun tu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Kan wu la wur bi ter gipi es kan wu wul wur'e ba wu'i shirǝm ko kulci mbarǝm gip sun kǝ Yesu da'a. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ama Bitǝrus na Yohana nǝmi wur'e, &lt;&lt;Tloni shirǝm tu kǝn na gam gini, in dlat ni anra cina dǝ Yam mǝ kop shirǝm gin man kǝ Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Mǝn ngapo mi za shirǝm den argon tu mǝn na gam gǝmi shin kan mǝ pa kum gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nan wu dǝli wur kǝm rawo, arni mǝn tloyi shirǝmi za wur wu ndara domici mbarǝm kup den ta ɗǝɗa Yam den argon tu kan pi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mbarǝm tu kan bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am tu pi den ti kǝ pali gǝs lauwo, sheti ghon gǝs man hauya rop na gǝri wi.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yam gip Yesu shirǝm na Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Nan za ga Bitǝrus na Yohana wu ndarawo, kan wu pal rǝn kar mbarǝm gǝzǝnka. Arni wu yari wur kup argon tu kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri kǝ bǝn yari wur gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nan wu kum argon tu piwo, arni wu tli yar yam na bi nǝm gip shirǝm na Yam wu wule, &lt;&lt;Bar Gun Babomi, ki ni kǝ pi yam na atli, na bar ɓula na kup bar ju ra gipi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Kǝ shirǝm gip Ruhu kǝ Yam tǝp bi dǝ zher gi, ba gǝmi Dauda, kan tǝ wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;Unun kem munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a ba kum lo na Yamwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Unun kem mbarǝm gip kǝdlǝm pitǝn ba dlǝr kǝ dlan na Yamwu?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Gun kǝ atl kup ne bi den bar nǝm wi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">kan mǝn bǝn mo gam wi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">den gapa na Babom Yam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na Almasihu gǝsi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />&lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni ga Buntus Bilatus na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, na Hiridus na mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila dom wur gip bǝn kǝn kan wu ɓal bika gip gapa na Yesu, zher gi mǝn tsarki, muntu kan kǝ zǝzari Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ama kup bar ju wu piwo kǝ tare kǝ ne wi gip pi bar na ndu'i gi den untuni ba pi. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Kǝkǝno, Babomi, kum argon tu wu pi mi gwa, kǝ ɓa'i mi bigul mǝn ga zher gi kǝ dǝ mǝ mani yari Shirǝm gi bat na bǝrti. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ta am gi gip mani pi bar gi kǝ pǝni mbarǝm kumi dlika na pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn gip sun kǝ Yesu Zher gi kan ba pi argon tu kǝ ndu gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Nan wu pa'i shirǝm na Yamo, arni las tu wu dom wur gwa jiti ti. Kan ba laa'i wur kup na Ruhu kǝ Yami, arni wu nǝm yari shirǝm kǝ Yam bat na bǝrti.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi bar gip mǝn kopi gǝsi nǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Kup mǝn kopi kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu dǝm nǝm gip mbatl na ruhu. Ko nǝm gon ba le gerka den bar ju tǝra nari gwa da'a, ama wu tatl ni ko unu kan wu ra nari gwa gip dlom gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Mir mǝn kartǝni pi wazu tlitǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝm kǝ Babom Yesu na ndǝrtǝn tu Yam bi wur gwa. Mbarǝm mom'e Yam den ta ɗǝɗa gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Murgon ra gip wur kan hol argon gwa da'a. Munju kan na kǝn ko bomo wu kur wurka, wu ɗiri wurpi kǝ bar ju wu wurka gwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Kan wu ne cina dǝ mir mǝn kartǝni. Mir mǝn kartǝni ba bi ni mbarǝm den bi argon tu kogonge gip wur ba ndu gwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Mbarǝm wule ga Isubu. Tǝ mǝn bom kǝ Lawi kan gip atl kǝ Saipǝros ni. Muntu mir mǝn kartǝniyi ba la ti bi'e Barnaba (muntu gǝs kǝ sunyi'e, Nye mǝn ɓa'i bigule). <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Tǝ wur kǝn gǝska, kan tǝ ɗir na wurpiyi tǝ ne kar asǝm kǝ mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesuyi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hukunte Hananiya na Sapiratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Mbarǝm gon ra mǝn sun Hananiya, tǝ na nagǝr gǝs Sapiratu wur nye pili atl gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Na momi kǝ nagǝr gǝsi, arni tǝ ne nami wurpiyika markǝme ama tǝ ɗiri nami tǝ ne cina dǝ mir mǝn kartǝni.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Kan Bitǝrus ba wule, &lt;&lt;Hananiya, imni Shetan laa'i mbatl gika kan kǝ ceni lar Ruhu kǝ Yam na ne gamgi nami wurpi tu kǝ zam den wuri atl gi kagwa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kapǝn kǝ wurkawo, ge ni diya? Nan kan kǝ wurka eso, wurpiyi ra gip am gi diya? Unun kem kǝ la muntu tor gip mbatl gi kǝ pi untuwu? Mbarǝm ni kǝ ceni wur lar da a, ama Yam ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Nan Hananiya kum shirǝm tuwo, arni tǝ nda atl tǝ mǝshka. Bǝrti nǝm kup munju kum argon tu pigwa na naari. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Kan mir moni ba ter gipi, wu ghumtǝka, wu ɗǝli ti te karika kan wu kap tǝka.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Bar kǝ awa myakan den kaar kǝ untuwo, kan nagǝr gǝs Sapiratu ba ter gipi, ama tǝ mom argon tu kan ndo na bakos gǝs gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Bitǝrus ngen momi kar ti na wuli gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, untuni wurpi tu nan ki na Hananiya wur pili atl ginka raya?&gt;&gt; Arni tǝ nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aan wurpiyi ituwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kan Bitǝrus ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl gin kǝ ceni lar Ruhu kǝ Yam den argon ba zam kǝn da'a? Ɓashini! Kum desi asǝm kǝ mir moni ju kan kap bakos gi gwa bǝdlabǝni, wi pǝn ki te karika pa'e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bartu cina da wur arni tǝ nda atl tǝ mǝshka. Kan mir moniyi ter gipi wu zam ti ɓom mǝshiwo, kan wu te ti kari wu kap ti markǝm dǝ bakos gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Bǝrti nǝm domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopiyi na naari na kup munju kan kum bar ju pi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn kartǝn ɗǝli kumi dli mbarǝm na womti ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Mir mǝn kartǝn bar kǝ Yesuyi pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn na womti gip mbarǝme. Kup mǝn kopi Yesu ba kur mo gam gip las tu ba la ti bi'e ba shukutǝn kǝ Solomon gwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ko nǝm murgon ra gip nami mbarǝm kan ngǝsh wur den Yesuwu da'a kan zam ɓa'i bigul kǝ me gam nan wur gwa. Kup na untu, mbarǝm kup ba shin nartǝn gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Kup na untuwo, mǝtli na moni na womti ngǝsh wur den Babom Yesu kan me gam kǝ mǝn kopiyi ba nar ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Den bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn ju kan mir mǝn kartǝni ba piwo, mbarǝm pi ta ɗiri mǝn kumi dli bi guntǝpe, ɓom den bamuri gǝzǝni. Wu pini untu kǝ dǝ pǝni jen kumi dli gǝzǝnka in shishidǝr kǝ Bitǝrus kop den wur tin tǝ kop lasi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Kan mbarǝm na womti ba pi ta ɗǝltǝn ɗir gip mir bǝn kan kosak na Urushalima gwa, wu ɗiri mǝn kumi dli na munju dun itǝr ba ghun wur gwa, kan kup ba pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nge mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Arni bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kup ga berǝm mbap gǝs kan gip me gam kǝ mǝn Sadukiya nǝm na ghuve. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Arni wu nǝm mir mǝn kartǝni kan wu la wur gip bom kǝ moni kǝ gip bǝni. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ama gip dlom gaso nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ɓul bǝdlabǝn bom kǝ moniyika kup kan tǝ ɗǝli wur ter kari. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mbǝrni kǝ ri dlǝrni gip Bom kǝ Yam kǝ yari ni mbarǝm kup shirǝm kǝ pel rai kǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bar tlowo arni wu te gip Bom kǝ Yam kandatu yari wur gwa, wu nǝm kulci mbarǝme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Nan bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na ezǝn mbirawo, wu la bi domtǝn kǝ Mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda muntu kan haɗe na kup kiri kǝ atl kǝ Isra'ila gwa. Arni wu kar bar rǝn bom kǝ moniyika den dǝ ter na mir mǝn kartǝni. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama nan mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ Yami mbubar bom kǝ moniyiwo, wu zam wur te gipika da'a. Arni wu pal rin kar domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmika wu yari wur'e, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ ri zam bom kǝ moniyi dlep na le, na mir mǝn ɓuti bomi dlor ter kari bi kup bǝdlabǝni, ama nan mǝ ɓulo, mǝ zam murgon gipi da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Nan wu kum argon tu yari wuro, arni bari kǝ mǝn ɓuti Bom kǝ Yami, na kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam dam wur den argon tu muntu baa gǝri wur gwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Gon kan kum kulci kǝ mir mǝn kartǝni ter gipi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shinni! Mbarǝm ju kan kǝ la wur gip bom kǝ moni gwan ja dlor te gip Bom kǝ Yamka wu den kulci mbarǝme.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Den muntuwo, arni bari kǝ mǝn ɓuti Bom kǝ Yam na ezǝn ri nǝm mir mǝn kartǝni ɗiri. Wu getl mir mǝn kartǝni da'a, domici wu kum bǝrti den mbarǝm baa la wur na tate.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nan ɗir na mir mǝn kartǝniwo, anni dlǝri wur cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayi kǝ dǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam tambe wuri. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ dǝli in kǝm hoyi den ba kǝ'i kulci ni mbarǝm gip sun kǝ mbarǝm tu da'a. Kup na untu, kǝ nga Urushalima kup wi na kulci gini, kan kǝn den ndu'i mǝ dǝm na am gip shoti bǝran kǝ mbarǝm tu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ama Bitǝrus nǝmi wur den am kǝ nami mir mǝn kartǝni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar nǝm mi te yarka mǝ kop shirǝm kǝ Yam na mǝ kop shirǝm kǝ mbarǝm gwa! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Yam kǝ ga bǝba gǝmi tli Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme, muntu kan kǝ ri ti eka tǝp kǝ ba ɓa'i gǝs den kini. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Yam ɗǝɗa Yesu nar na ne gǝs den am shimli gǝsi. Tǝ ne tǝni tǝ dǝm ti ni'e mǝn ɗǝli gǝmi na gun gip dǝmi gǝmi. Yam pini muntu kǝ dǝ mǝn mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ilawo tǝ ɓuli mi guntǝp kan mi bali kaar warwat dǝmi gǝmi kǝ dǝ tǝ pǝni mi warwat pitǝn gǝmika. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Mǝn ni'e munju shin bar ju kan pi gwa na ger gǝmi, untuni es Ruhu kǝ Yami, muntu kan Yam bi kup munju kan ba kop shirǝm gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Nan wu kum shirǝm tuwo, arni lo ci wur nar kan wu ndu wu ri wur eka. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama Ba mǝn Parise gon mǝn sun Gamaliyel, mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa kan mbarǝm kup ba shin nartǝn gǝs gwa tlyam tlor cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi. Tǝ wule dǝ kur ɗǝli mir mǝn kartǝniyi kari kakani. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Isra'ila, ne ni ger ndin kǝ zhit ni argon tu kǝ ndu pi mbarǝm ju gwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Wokoci gon ter kawo, mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Tudas cwati, tǝ pǝn gam gǝs ti murgon ni bari har tǝ zam mǝn kopi gǝs bar kǝ mbarǝm hauya kǝba lasi hauya nǝm (400). Ama ri ti eka, ndoltǝn kǝ muntu ituwi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Den kaar gǝso, Yahuda mǝn Galili cwat gip muri kǝ dlǝmi mbarǝme kan tǝ dǝl mbarǝm na womti kaar dati gip bǝtli asǝmka gip bari. Tiyi ma ri ti eka, kan kup mir mǝn kopi gǝs ba gǝzanka. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ra'untuwo, den mǝnkǝn tuwo na yari ine, za ni mbarǝm ju! Za wur ni wu ndara! In argon tu wu ndu piwo kǝ gam gǝzǝn ni katlo, arba ri kǝtǝgon da'a. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ama in kar Yam ni ar ɗǝlo, ki mani kemi mbarǝm ju kǝ za'i da'a, arba dǝm'e ki zam gam gin den dlan na Yam ituwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nami kop kaar kǝ shirǝm gǝsi. Kan wu la bi mir mǝn kartǝni ter gipi, wu kem ba ɓo wuri. Kan wu dǝli wur kǝm den ba wu'i shirǝm gip sun kǝ Yesu da'a, kan wu za wur wu ndara.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Mir mǝn kartǝniyi za Domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayi wu den ghol mbatl den'e la wur gip munju kan tla sham den bi kǝ sun kǝ Yesu wi. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Den pǝt kupo wu te gip Bom kǝ Yamka, na kopi bom kǝ ezǝni, wu za kulci mbarǝm na yari Zo Shirǝm den Yesu ni'e Almasihu da'a.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Zǝzar mbarǝm nyingi kǝ ne ger den bi fingali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Gip muri jawo mǝn kopi Yesu pi ta womtitǝni. Arni mǝn Yahuda kan ba shirǝm na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas kan gip wur ba ngwar den mǝn Yahuda kan ba shirǝm na bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa. Mǝn Yahuda kan ba shirǝm na bi kǝ mǝn Hellasi ngwar den'e ba bi mǝtli gǝzǝn kan guri gwa fingal kan ba bi den pǝt kup nǝm na ezǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Arni mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu kutl cet ropi la bi domi gam kǝ kup mǝn kopi, kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ba ndari mǝ za mbap yari shirǝm kǝ Yamka mǝ dǝm den shirǝm kǝ fingal na bi bar mbarǝm da'a. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Mir ɓyari, untuno zǝzarni mbarǝm nyingi gip kǝne, munju kan mom wura laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yam na bopya gwa. Mi ne wur gam mbapi muntu <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />kan mǝ bi gam gǝmi gip shirǝm na Yam na mbap kǝ kulci na yari mbarǝm zo shirǝm den Yesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Argon tu mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesuyi yari tǝmi bi kup nami mǝn kopi. Arni wu zǝzar Istipanus. Ti mbarǝm mǝn ndǝri ngǝshtǝn den Yesu kan Ruhu kǝ Yam ba kop nan ti gwa ni. Wu pa zǝzar Filibus, Pǝrokoras, Nikano, Timon, Paminas, na Nikolas, mbarǝm kǝ Antakiya. Nikolas faro datemi gip ngǝshtǝn den Yam kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni kan pal mǝn kopi Yesu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Arni wu ri na mbarǝm nyingi ju cina dǝ mir mǝn kartǝni. Kan wu shirǝm na Yam den wur na ne am gǝzǝn den gam kǝ kogonge gip wur kǝ dǝ wu pi mbap tu.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mir mǝn kopiyi pita yari mbarǝm na womti Shirǝm kǝ Yami. Womtitǝn kǝ mǝn kopi gip Urushalima nar bǝle-bǝle. Mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na womti ma ngǝsh wur den Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝm Istipanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Yam bi Istipanus mani pi bar na womti tǝp kǝ ba mani pi bar kǝ Yami. Tǝ pi kiri bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn na womti gip mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ama ngetǝn ɗir nan mbarǝm jen kǝ domi gam kǝ zher ju kan zam gam gǝzǝn (kandatu ba la wur bi gwa) mǝn Yahuda kǝ Sairin na kǝ Alekzandǝriya, na kǝ gip atl kǝ Kilikiya na Asiya. Mbarǝm ju pare tli yar yam na Istipanus, <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />ama wu mani wu tabbate ti'e argon tu tǝ yariwo untuni anra da'i da'a, nan Ruhu kǝ Yam bi ti mani shirǝm na bopya gwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Arni wu kop jen shep shep, wu co wur kǝ dǝ wu cen lar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ kum Istipanus den pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den Musa na Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Arni wu tli mbarǝm mbatl na kiri kǝ bǝn, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa. Kan wu nǝm Istipanus wu ri nan ti cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda.<verse eid="ACT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wu ɗiri mǝn ceni lari, munju kan wule, &lt;&lt;Erǝm kǝn za yari mǝgǝn shirǝm den bom kǝ Yam kǝn na kulci kǝ Musa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Mǝ kum ti den wultǝn'e, Yesu kǝ Nazarat tu baa yas las kǝn ka kan tǝ zhimbǝl bar ju kan Musa bi mi mǝ kop gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Kup munju kan njon gip ba domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi wii ger Istipanus ndǝr, kan wu shin bager gǝs ba cirka wule bager kǝ mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam goni.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Shirǝm kǝ Istipanus cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Arni bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ngen momi kar Istipanus'e, &lt;&lt;Bar ju wu yari den kiwo unjun anra ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Den muntuwo arni Istipanus bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar na ga ba gǝmi, kumǝn ni! Yam mǝn nartǝn ɗǝl kar ba gǝmi Ibǝrahim nan tǝ'i gip Mesopotamiya gwa, kapǝn tǝ dǝm gip Haran.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesopotamiya faro arni gip atl tu kan sǝkǝn ba la ti bi'e Iraki gwa. Haran faro bar bǝn ni gip atl tu sǝkǝn ba la ti bi'e Siriya gwa.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Yam wul ti'e, &lt;Za atl gǝri gi na mbarǝm ginka, kǝ ri gip atl tu a ta'i'i am dene gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Arni tǝ za atl kǝ mǝn Kaldiya ka, kan tǝ dǝm gip Haran. Den kaar mǝshtǝn kǝ baso, arni Yam kar ti ɗe gip atl kǝn kan kǝ dǝm sekǝn gwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />&lt;&lt;Yam bi ti atl ko ma ba ne asǝm gip atli da'a. Ama Yam yari ti den'e ti bi ti atli, nan ti na gǝsgal gǝs kaar dati ar dǝm gwazini, kup na Ibǝrahim ra na nyawi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Yam yari ti'e, &lt;Gǝsgal gi baa dǝm mǝndǝki gip atl tu kan gwazin ni dagwa, las tu baa pali wurka zheri, wu pi bota kǝ sheti ghon hauya kǝba lasi hauya nǝm (400) gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Yam wule, &lt;Ama aa hukunte atl tu kan wu pi ti botayi gwa. Den kaar kǝ untuwo, wi ɗǝl ter gip atl ta wu botem gip las kǝni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kano Yam ba yari Ibǝrahim'e tǝ sǝr kogonge moni kan gip bom gǝs gwa. Muntu ba gode'e wi kop gudlum shirǝm tu kan Yam pi nan wur gwa ituwi. Nan Ibǝrahim dǝm basi Ishakuwo arni tǝ sǝr tika den pǝt kǝ wuzupse na gǝri. Denkariwo Ishaku sǝr nya gǝs Yakubu, kan Yakubu ba sǝr mimir gǝs ga kori gǝmi kutl-cet ropi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Nan ga kori gǝmi na ghuve den erǝm gǝzǝn Isubuwo, arni wu wur tika tǝ dǝm zher gip Masar. Ama Yam ra nan ti <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kan tǝ ɗǝli ti gip kup damtǝn gǝsi. Tǝ bi Isubu bopya na ghol bǝran kar Fir'auna gun kǝ Masar. Kan Fir'auna ba ne ti den gam atl kǝ Masar na bom gǝs kup.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Kano guzǝm ba nda gip atl kǝ Masar na atl kǝ Kan'ana kan ba ɗiri bar kumi dli, arni ga ba gǝmi hol fingali. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Nan Yakubu kum'e o ra Masaro, tǝ kar ga ba gǝmi barta, tetǝn kǝ nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Den tetǝn gǝzǝn kǝ ropo, arni Isubu yari mir ezǝn ko ti woni, kan Fir'auna ba mom mbarǝm kǝ shu bom kǝ ga Isubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, Isubu kari bar bas Yakubu na kup mbarǝm kǝ shu bom gǝsi, wu mbarǝm hauya myakan na kutl cet nantam. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Kan Yakubu ba su Masar, las tu ti na ga ba gǝmi mǝshka gwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Kan ba pal na gul gǝzǝn Shekem ba kap gip gambǝci tu kan Ibǝrahim wur den bi wurpi jen kar mimir kǝ Hamor gip Shekem gwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ama nan wokoci ɗir kosak kan Yam ba pi argon tu tǝ wule ti pi Ibǝrahimo, arni mbarǝm gǝmi gip Masar womti na naari. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kano gun gon muntu kan mom argon den Isubu da'a ba dǝm gun kǝ Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Tǝ pali mbarǝm gǝmi ka zhere. Tǝ kem ga kori gǝmi kǝ pi banyi mbapi tǝp kǝ ba kemi gǝzǝn wu byal pel gǝri mimir gǝzǝnka kǝ dǝ wu mǝshi.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Wokoci ta ni gǝr Musa, mbuni nya ni den ger kǝ Yami. Ket ti kǝ kyar myakan gip bom dǝ base. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Nan byal ti kawo, nya Fir'auna, nye gǝr pǝn ti tǝ ket ti tǝ dǝm nya gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Untuni kulci Musa bopya momi bar kǝ mǝn Masar kup, kan tǝ dǝm bar mbarǝm gip shirǝm na argon tu tǝ pi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Nan Musa ri sheti ghon hauya rop na gǝriwo, tǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs tǝ ri shin mir ezǝni, mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kan tǝ shin mǝn Masar gon den ɓe mǝn Isra'ila goni, arni Musa ri ne ti am tǝ rame mbarǝmi, kan tǝ ɓo mǝn Masari tǝ ri tǝ eka. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa ba wule mbarǝm gǝzǝn baa mom'e Yam ni den kopi nan ti kǝ dǝ tǝ ɗǝli wuri, ama wu mom da'a. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Bar tlowo Musa pa ri kar wuri, arni tǝ zam mǝn Isra'ila mbarǝm rop den dlanye. Tǝ ndu wu za ka, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir mbarǝme, kǝn ɓyar ni ca, unun kem kǝ dlan kǝn na ya'ǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ama muntu kan den ɓe esǝyi ture Musa ka markǝme, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Woni ne'i gami da mi na mǝn tloyi shirǝm gip dlom gǝmiwe? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Kǝ ndu ni'e kǝ rim eka kandatu kǝ ri ba mǝn Masar tu eka ghur gwaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Nan Musa kum muntuwo, arni tǝ kǝtǝr gǝs atl kǝ Midiyan, las tu tǝ dǝm mǝndǝki gwa. Bartani tǝ gudlumi kan tǝ gǝr mir moni rop.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Den kaar kǝ sheti ghon hauya ropo Yam ɗǝl kar Musa wule mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam goni. Yam shirǝm nan ti tǝp kar mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami. Tǝ ɗǝli tini gip bǝlǝm utu gip lǝp kan kosak na tlǝndǝr kǝ Sinai gwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Nan tǝ shin untuwo, ar ni tǝ nǝm bi na ame. Nan tǝ te kosak kǝ zhitiwo, arni tǝ kum yar kǝ Babom Yam ba wul ti'e, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;&lt;Ami ni'e Yam kǝ ga ba gi, Yam kǝ ga Ibǝrahim, Ishaku na Yakubu.&gt;&gt; Arni Musa nǝm dǝdartǝn gip bǝrti, tǝ'i zam ɓa'i bigul kǝ shini da'a.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Kan Babom ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tus kaptǝlan gi ka domici las tu kira dloro gwan ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Na hobi, a shin kandatu mbarǝm gǝn ba kum dli gip Masar wu gwa. A kum ngwartǝn gǝzǝn wi, arni a sur kǝ ɗǝli gǝzǝni. Kǝkǝno ɗiri, aa kar ki su Masar ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Muntu ni'e nǝm Musa tu wu nge ti na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Woni ne'i gami da mi na mǝn tloyi shirǝm gip dlom gǝmiwe?&gt;&gt; Ti ni Yam kar ti tǝ dǝmi wur mǝn cina na mǝn ɗǝli gǝzǝn, tǝp kar mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam tu kan ɗǝl kar ti gip lǝp gwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Tǝ ɗǝli wur gip Masar na pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn na nǝmi bi na am gip Masar. Nan wu mbubar bar Zili Ɓula'i, na gip lǝp kǝ sheti ghon hauya rop gwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa tu ni yari mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila'e, &lt;&lt;Yam baa kari in bar na mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon wule ami gip mbarǝm gini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Musa ni'e mbarǝm tu kan dom mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila gip lǝp gwa. Tǝ ra na ga ba gǝmi na mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam tu kan shirǝm nan ti den Tlǝndǝr Sinai gwa. Tini es tǝ nǝm shirǝm kar Yam muntu kan yari kandatu mi dǝm baa patǝn tu tǝ bi mi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ama ga ba gǝmi nge kopi shirǝm kǝ Musa ka. Nan wu pi untuwo, arni wu nge ti kan mbatl gǝzǝn ba pal su Masarka. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Arni wu wul Haruna'e, &lt;&lt;Pi mi mir yam jen kan ba nde mi cina gwa. Musa tu kan ɗǝli mi ter Masaro, mǝ mom unun zam ti da'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Wokoci ta ni wu pi argon tu wi bote ti gwa wule nye tla. Wu ɗiri dabba wu mboshi ti na ghol mbatl gip bota den argon tu kan wu pi na am gǝzǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ama Yam bali wur kaari, kan tǝ za wur wu bote ga zǝnges kǝ to yamka. Muntu ɗir nǝm na argon tu ra na rǝshi gip tǝlankur kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn Isra'ila, nan kǝ mbosh ga dabba gin kan kǝ ta'im gip bota kǝ sheti ghon hauya rop ju kan kǝn gip lǝpo, kǝ mom'e ami ni da'a kǝ ta'ima?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Kǝn mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila, ami ni kǝ botem da'a. Ama Molek ni kǝ bote ti, na zǝnges kǝ yam gin Refan, na bar ju kǝ pǝn kǝ dǝ kǝ bote wur gwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ra'untuwo, aa kem dǝ ndara nan kǝn kǝ ba bota na dlyami, cina na Babila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Nan ga ba gǝmi ra gip lǝpo, wu bote ni Yam gip tenti kan ba gode'e Yam ra nan wur gwa. Pi tǝni kandatu Yam wul Musa'e tǝ pi gwa, kandatu tǝ shin anra gwani tǝ pi. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Sheti ghon na womti den kariwo, nami ga ba gǝmi pǝn tentiyi nan wur nan Joshuwa den kopi nan wur gwa. Wu ter gip atl kǝn nari nan wu dǝm mǝn atl ju kan Yam kar wur ka cina da wur gwa. Ar dǝm gip atli ba ri wokoci kǝ Dauda. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Tǝ pi bar ju kem kan Yam pi ti mbuni gwa. Arni tǝ liri kǝ dǝ tǝ tu'i Yam bom dǝmi. Gip bom tu ni mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila baa bote ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama Solomon nya Dauda ni Yam pi tǝ tu'i ti bomi.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Rawo, mǝ mom'e Yam nar man ko-unu, kano tǝ dǝm gip bom ju kan mbarǝm pi gwa da'a. Kandatu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam yari'e Babom Yam wule,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt;To yamka ni'e las tu a dǝm kǝ pi mulki gwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Atl ni'e ba ne asǝm gǝni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Imni bom tu ki tu im gwa ba ni rawu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ako ni ba mani kǝmi gǝn ar dǝm'e bom gǝn we?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Kǝ shina, ami ni'e muntu kan pi bar ju kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn mbarǝm mǝn lati gami, mǝn mbatl kǝ tat na kǝm mǝn nge kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami! Kǝn ni wule ga ba gini. Kǝn den ta nge Ruhu kǝ Yami! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon ni ra kan ga ba gin kumi ti dli dagwaya? Wu ri mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kan yari shirǝm den surtǝn kǝ mǝn pi argon tu Yam ba ndu gwa eka. Antu kǝ bali ti kaar kan kǝ ri ti eka! <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Kǝ nǝm kulciyi. Yam ni bi ga ba gǝmi kulci tu tǝp kar mǝn kartǝn bar gǝsi. Ama kǝ nge kopi ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laa Istipanus na tate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Nan wu kum muntuwo, arni lo ci wur den ti, kan wu ngas kur bi kǝ gǝsi wu tli den ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama Istipanus laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yam wi ger to yamka kan tǝ shin cirtǝn kǝ Yami, na Yesu dlor den am shimli kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shinni, a shin yam ɓuli na Nya Mbarǝm dlor den am shimli kǝ Yami!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Den muntuwo arni wu kesh kǝm gǝzǝnka kan wu wom bar na la'i yare, wu tli den ti, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />wu dǝl ti su kaar bǝnika, kan wu nǝm la'i gǝs na tate. Mǝn ri gǝs cinayi tus tutul dli gǝzǝnka wu ne kar asǝm kǝ nye mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Nan wu den la'i gǝs na tato arni Istipanus shirǝm na Yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babom Yesu nǝm ruhu gǝni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kano tǝ ngus den gam ghurǝm gǝsi, tǝ la yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babom Yesu, ba kǝ hukunte wur den warwat pitǝn tu da'a.&gt;&gt; Tǝ yari untuwo, kan tǝ mǝshka.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Shawulu ra lasi gip kopi kaar kǝ ri Istipanus eka.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Kumi dli mǝn kopi kan wu gǝzanka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Gas ta ni tli domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ gip Urushalima gami, arni kup mǝn kopi Babom Yesu gǝzanka ko-ako gip atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda na Samariya, mir mǝn kartǝni ni katl za wur gip Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Mǝn bǝrti Yam kap Istipanuska na pi dun mbatl na naari den mǝshtǝn gǝsi.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama Shawulu pi ta kumi dli domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi. Tǝ kop bom-bom kǝ dǝli mǝtli na moni tǝ den la'i gǝzǝn gip bom kǝ moni.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazu kǝ Filibus gip Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Munju kan gǝzan wurka pi wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Yesu kup las ju wu rigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibus te gip bar bǝn kǝ Samariya kan tǝ pi shirǝm den Almasihu lasi. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Nan womti mbarǝmi kum shirǝm kǝ Filibus na shini bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju tǝ piwo, arni kup gǝzǝn ne kǝm hoyi den argon tu tǝ yari gwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Na la'i yare arni dun itǝr ɗǝlka gip mbarǝm na womti, na munju itǝr tle wur dlika na kurki na womti ra kan pǝni wur kumi dli kagwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Bar tu ɗiri ghol mbatl na naari gip bǝni.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simon mǝn ware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Mbarǝm gon ra gip bǝni mǝn sun Simon, mǝn war ni kan ɓom muri den dlǝkǝn mǝn Samariya gwa. Tǝ ɓo ngetl den tǝ murgon ni bari. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Mbarǝm kup, bari na heli, ba kum shirǝm gǝs na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝn Simon ba pini kiri bar domici Yam ni kem tǝ dǝm Mǝn Nartǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wu kop ti domici tǝ ɓom muri nar wi den pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn tǝp kǝ ba war gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Mbarǝm kǝ bǝni ngǝsh wur den Yesu na pi wazu kǝ Filibus den dǝmi kǝ Yam Gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝm na den'e Yesu ni'e Almasihu. Arni tǝ pi wur batisma, mǝtli na moni kup. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon na gam gǝs ma tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu kan ba pi ti batisma. Arni tǝ kop Filibus kup las tu tǝ ri gwa. Nan tǝ shin bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju den piwo arni tǝ nǝm bi na ame.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Nan mir mǝn kartǝni kan su Urushalimaka kum'e mǝn Samariya nǝm shirǝm kǝ Yamwo, arni wu kari wur bar na Bitǝrus na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nan wu mbubaro, wu shirǝm na Yam den am gǝzǝn den dǝ pel mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu ju nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Wokoci tawo Ruhu kǝ Yam sur den ko nǝm gǝzǝnwi da'a, batisma ni katl pi wur gip sun kǝ Babom Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Arni Bitǝrus na Yohana ne am den wuri, kan wu nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yami.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Nan Simon shin'e bini Ruhu na ne am kǝ mir mǝn kartǝni den mbarǝmo, arni tǝ bi wur wurpi. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ma bim ni mani pi bar tu, kǝ dǝ kup muntu a ne am den tiwo tǝ nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Arni Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Naa dǝ wurpi gi nan ki liika, domici kǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl gi den ki mani wuri bar tu Yam ba bi gwa na wurpi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ki na argon kǝ pi gip mbap kǝn da'a, domici mbatl gi ra dlat cina dǝ Yam da'a. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ci atl gam kar Babom Yam den ɗasi tu gi tu kan kǝ shirǝm na Babomi. Ti mani'i pǝni warwat pitǝn gika den argon tu kan kǝ ɓal tor gip mbatl gi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />A ne ger den ki ndinwo a shin ki ra laa'i na ɗasi tu'e, kano warwat pitǝn ɓal ki kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Kan Simon ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shirǝm na Babom Yam den am gǝni den ba dǝ ko nǝm gip argon tu kǝ yari zamǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Nan wu pi wazu shirǝm kǝ Babomo, arni Bitǝrus na Yohana pal su Urushalimaka. Wu kop gip mir bǝn kǝ Samariya na womti na pi wazu kǝ Zo Shirǝmi.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus na Ba mǝn Habasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Babom Yam gon wul Filibus'e, &lt;&lt;Su tǝp kudu, tǝp gip lǝpe, kan tli sur Urushalima ba su Gaza gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Arni tǝ tlyam tǝ ndara. Nan tǝ den tǝpo arni tǝ mo na bar mbarǝm gon mǝn ne wurpi kǝ Kandakatu, gǝr mǝtli gun kǝ mǝn Habasha. Mbarǝm tu su ni Urushalima kǝ bote Yami. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Ti den tǝp gǝs kǝ paltǝn bom, njon den karusa gǝs tǝ den zhiti tǝlankur kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Arni Ruhu kǝ Yam wul Filibus'e, &lt;&lt;Ri kar karusa tu kǝ dlǝr kosak nari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Arni Filibus kǝtǝr tǝ ri kar karusayi kan tǝ kum mbarǝmi den zhiti gip tǝlankur kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya. Filibus ngen momi kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mani momi argon tu kǝ den zhiti gwaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Mbarǝmi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imni fa a mani momi murgon nǝra kan baa cetim gamka dagwawu?&gt;&gt; Arni tǝ lir Filibus den tǝ to dǝm kar ti den karusayi.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Las tu mbarǝmi den zhiti gip Shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa ikǝni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;La ti cina koɗak wule tǝm kan ba ri kǝ mboshi gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Wule tǝm tu pili ti taka ra shot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Cina dǝ mǝn njetǝl gǝsi, ama tǝ ɓul bi da'a.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Gip mburi gǝso tloyi ti shirǝm kan kor den tǝp gwa da'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Woni ba mani shirǝm den gǝsgal gǝswe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Domici dǝmi gǝs den kaar bar atl pawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Arni mbarǝmi ngen momi kar Filibus'e, &lt;&lt;Kustu, yari mi, woni mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tu ba shirǝm den tiwe, den gam gǝs na ko den murgon ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Arni Filibus pǝni ti yari shirǝm kǝ Yam den muntu na jen es na womti, kan tǝ yari ti Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Nan wu den ritǝno wu ri zam male, arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa shini, mal kǝn ɗe! Unun ba hane dǝ pim batismawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />(Arni Filibus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kini kǝ ngǝsh ki den Yam gip Yesu na kup mbatl giwo ba pi'i.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A ngǝshǝm den Yam wi den Yesu Nya Yam ni.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Kan mbarǝmi ba kem dǝ dlǝri karusayi. Arni kup gǝzǝn ropi su gip mali, kan Filibus ba pi ti batisma. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nan wu ɗǝl tor gip maliwo, bartu, arni Ruhu kǝ Babom pǝn Filibuska. Mbarǝmi'i shin ti da'a, ama tǝ laa'i na ghol mbatl nan ti den tǝp gǝsgwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filibus ngapo, arni tǝ ɗǝl gip bǝn kǝ Azotus tǝ den kopi las na pi wazu kǝ Zo Shirǝmi gip bǝn ju kup kan den tǝp gǝs gwa har tǝ mbubar gip bǝn Kaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu dǝm mǝn kopi Yesuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ama Shawulu den ta kumi dli mǝn kopi Babom Yesu. Arni tǝ ri kar bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Tǝ ngen den tǝ bi ti rǝshi tǝlankur kan ti si kiri kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda kan gip Dimashka gwa. Tin tǝ zam kup mǝtli na moni mǝn kopi tǝp kǝ Yesuwo tǝ nǝm wur tǝ si wur Urushalima na ɓali.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Nan tǝ mbi kosak na Dimashka den ɓomi asǝm gǝso, arni pǝlǝt cirtǝn gon ɗǝl sur yam ba cir kar ti. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Arni tǝ nda atlka kan tǝ kum yar gon ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, unun kem kǝ kumim dli rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e wowe, Babomi?&gt;&gt; Arni yari nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e Yesu. Ami ni kǝ kumim dli nan kǝ kumi dli mǝn kopi gǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Kǝkǝno, tlyam kǝ te gip bǝni, lasini ba yari'i argon tu nǝm ki te yarka kǝ pi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Mbarǝm ju nan den ɓomi asǝm nan ti kum bǝrti, arni wu dlǝr lasi shot wu mani shirǝm da'a. Wu den kumi yari ama wu shin murgon da'a. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Kan Shawulu ba tli tor atli, ama nan tǝ ɓul gero tǝ mani shini argon da'a. Arni munju kan ra nan ti nǝmi ti am wu te ti gip bǝn Dimashka. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Tǝ mani shini argon da'a kǝ muri myakan, eso tǝ ci ko tǝ tla argon da'a.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Gip Dimashkawo, mǝn kopi gon ra mǝn sun'e Hananiya. Babom la ti bi gip ruya tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Hananiya!&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Amin kǝni, Babomi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Arni Babom wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ kop rǝn bom dǝ Yahudaka den tǝp tu kan ba wul ti'e Sat Tǝp gwa. Kini kǝ mbu baro, ngen momi gǝs kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Tarsus gon mǝn sun Shawulu. Tǝ ra den shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Gip ruyawo tǝ shin mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Hananiya ter kar ti kan tǝ ne am den ti kǝ dǝ tǝ pali ti mani shini bar gǝsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Arni Hananiya bali shirǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, a kum ni shirǝm na womti den mbarǝm tu wi den kandatu tǝ kumi dli mbarǝm gi kan su Urushalima kagwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Kǝkǝno tǝ terni ɗe na bi kǝ kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, kǝ nǝmi kup mǝn la'i bi sun gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ama Babom Yesu wul Hananiyayi'e, &lt;&lt;Mbǝri! Shawulu dǝm zǝzar bar kǝ mbap gǝn kǝ pi wazu shirǝm gǝn dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a na ga gun gǝzǝni, na cina dǝ mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila wi. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Aa gode ti kandatu ti kum dli naar den bi sun gǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Kan Hananiya ba ri bomi tǝ te gipi. Tǝ ne am gǝs den Shawulu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Erǝm Shawulu, Babom Yesu, muntu kan ɗǝl kar ki den tǝp nan kǝ ter ɗe gwani karǝm kar ki kǝ dǝ kǝ zam mani shini bar gi esi na dǝ kǝ pa laa na Ruhu kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />An ri kǝtǝgon da'a, arni argon wule kǝr kos ɗǝl ter ger dǝ Shawulu, kan tǝ mani shini bar esi. Tǝ tlyami kan ba pi ti batisma. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Nan tǝ ci fingalo, arni bigul pali ti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu gip Dimashka na Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu ɓom muri na mǝn kopi kǝ gip Dimashka. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Arni tǝ nǝm pi wazu gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda den'e Yesu nya Yam ni.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Kup munju kum ti nǝm bi na ame, kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ti ni'e mbarǝm tu kan kem kumi dli mǝn la'i bi den sun kǝ Yesu kan gip Urushalima gwa diya? Annya tǝ ter ni ɗe kǝ nǝmi gǝmi tǝ pali mi mir mǝn bom kǝ moni kǝ kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ra'untuwo, ci cina na ndǝrtǝn kǝ Shawulu gip shirǝm den'e Yesu ni'e Almasihu kem mǝn Yahuda ju kan gip Dimashka gwa mani zami argon tu wi bali ti gwa da'a.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Den kaar kǝ muri na womtiwo, arni mǝn Yahuda jen gudlumi den wu ri ti eka, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />ama Shawulu zam kumi argon tu wu gudlumi kagwa. Arni wu ne ger gǝs pǝt na gas su bǝdlabǝn kǝ bǝni ka, kǝ dǝ wu ri ti eka. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ama mir mǝn kopi gǝs ne ti gip bar shar gip gasi kan wu shu ti sur atl tǝp kǝ ba tuli shu gon den panye.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Nan Shawulu mbubar Urushalimawo, tǝ ndu me gam na mǝn kopi, ama kup wu kum bǝrti gǝsi. Wu nǝm den'e tǝ dǝm ho mǝn kopi wi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ama Barnaba ɗir nan ti kar mir mǝn kartǝni, kan tǝ yari wur kandatu Shawulu shin Babom Yesu den tǝp gǝs kǝ tetǝn Dimashka na kandatu Babom shirǝm nan ti gwa. Tǝ pa yari wur kandatu Shawulu pi wazu gip Dimashka gip sun kǝ Yesu bat na bǝrti gwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Shawulu dǝm na mir mǝn kartǝni tǝ den kopi gǝzǝn gip bǝn Urushalima na pi wazu gip sun kǝ Babom Yesu bat na bǝrti. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Shirǝm gadlǝri wurka, ti na mǝn Yahuda jen mǝn shirǝm na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas, arni wu ndu ri gǝs eka. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Nan mir ɓyar zam na momi kawo, arni wu su nan ti Kaisariya kan wu la ti tǝp tǝ ndara bǝn gǝs Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Arni domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi Yesu ko ako gip atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda, na Galili na Samariya zam dǝmi zhǝlili. Wu zam ndǝrtǝni, na ɓa'i bigul kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yami. Mǝn kopi Yesu pi ta womtitǝn na dǝmi gip bǝrti kǝ Babomi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iniyasu na Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Ar dǝm'e nan Bitǝrus den ɓomi asǝm na kopi laso, kan tǝ ri kar mǝn kopi kan gip bǝn kǝ Lidda gwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Barta ni tǝ zam mbarǝm gon mǝn sun'e Iniyasu, muntu kan pi sheti ghon wuzupse tǝ mani tlitǝn yam da'a. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Iniyasu, Yesu Almasihu pǝni'i kumi dli gika kǝkǝnwi. Tlyam kǝ kucǝm bamuri gika.&gt;&gt; Kenja arni Iniyasu tlyam dlor. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Kup mbarǝm ju kan ba dǝm gip Lidda na Sarona nan wu shin Iniyasuwo kan wu dǝm mǝn kopi Babom Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Gip Yapawo nagǝr mǝn kopi gon ra mǝn sun'e Tabita (muntu kan na bi kǝ mǝn Hellaso ar ni'e Dokas gwa). Tǝ pi ta pi mbarǝm ho bar na ne am munju am ri wur kaar dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Wokoci ta ni tǝ mur atl tǝ kum tǝmi kǝ dli gǝs da'a kan tǝ mǝshka. Mir mǝn kopi Yesu ho dli gǝska, ba ne to gip ɓiti kushi kǝ to yamika. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lidda dlyam na Yapa da'a, arni nan mǝn kopi kum'e Bitǝrus ra gip Liddawo, wu kar mbarǝm rop kǝ dǝ wu lir ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kustu, ɗir nan mi ba kǝ dǝm gi da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Arni Bitǝrus ri nan wuri. Nan tǝ mbubaro arni wu te ti kushi kǝ to yami ka. Kup mǝtli kan guri gwa la ti dlomi, wu den kulu na ta'i am den tlyari lulur na tutul dli jen kan Dokas pi nan tǝ'i ra nan wur gwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ama Bitǝrus wul wur'e wu za kushiyi. Tǝ ngus den gam ghurǝm tǝ shirǝm na Yami. Tǝ bal ti rin kar dli kǝ Tabitaka, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tabita, tlyami!&gt;&gt; Arni tǝ ɓul gere, nan tǝ shin Bitǝruso, kan tǝ dǝm njon atli. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Bitǝrus ta'i ti am gǝs kan tǝ tli ti yami. Kan tǝ la bi mǝn kopiyi na guri ju kan tǝ bi wur Tabita na rai. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Kum shirǝm tu ko ako gip bǝn Yapa, kan mbarǝm na womti ba ngǝsh wur den Babom Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Arni Bitǝrus dǝm gip Yapa kǝ muri jen gip bom kǝ mǝn luti kur gon mǝn sun Simon.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Karniliyus kar bar dǝ la bi Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Gip Kaisariyawo mbarǝm gon ra mǝn sun'e Karniliyus. Ti ni'e mǝn kopi na mǝn bi-utu zangu kutl kǝ Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ti na kup mbarǝm kǝ bom gǝso mǝn bota na bǝrti Yam ni. Tǝ bi bar kǝ am gǝs munju am ri wur kaar da'a, kan ti mǝn meti shirǝm na Yam ni ko gigasi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Gasi gon bar kǝ gǝlla am myakan kǝ pǝto, tǝ shin ruya. Tǝ shin mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ɗir kar ti kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Karniliyus.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Arni gip bǝrti Karniliyus wi ti gere. Kan tǝ ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ununu Babomi?&gt;&gt; Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Shirǝm na Yam gi ju na bi bar kǝ am gi dǝ munju am ri wur kaar da'a ju dǝm bar kǝ tune cina dǝ Yam wi. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Kǝkǝno kar mbarǝm te Yapaka wu ter na mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Simon muntu ba la ti bi'e Bitǝrus gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Tǝ ra bom dǝ Simon mǝn luti kuri, muntu kan bom gǝs ra bi ɓula gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Nan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami kan shirǝm nan ti ndarawo, arni Karniliyus la bi rop gip zher gǝsi, na mǝn bi-utu gon mǝn bote Yami, nǝm gip munju ba pi ti mbap gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Arni tǝ yari wur kup argon tu pigwa, kan tǝ kar wur te Yapa ka.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus shin Ruya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Bar tlo kǝ dlom pǝte, nan ɓomi asǝm gǝzǝn mbi kosak na gip bǝn Yapawo, Bitǝrus to gǝs den rupi gam bom kǝ shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kan guzǝm ba nǝm ti, tǝ den ndu'i tǝ zam argon tǝ ci. Ama nan tǝ den ɓuti dǝ pa'i pi fingalo arni tǝ shin ruya. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Tǝ shin dlom yam ɓuli na argon wule bar bamuri kan la sur atl mǝn bi wupse gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Den bamuriyiwo kup ga dabba ni kǝ mǝn asǝm wupse na badǝr ici na ga lǝgandi na yatl kǝ to yamka. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kan yar gon ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Bitǝrus, tlyam kǝ mbosh kǝ ci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ama Bitǝrus nǝm'e, &lt;&lt;O'o Babomi, a taɓe ci argon tu kan den kulci gǝmi kǝ mǝn Yahudawo ar dlǝran da'a ko wani ni gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Yari pa wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ la bi argon'e dlǝran ni anra da'i da'a muntu kan Yam paliwi hoyi kǝ ci gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Muntu pi kǝ bisi myakan, kan wule gip njibkǝr gere ba pǝn bamuriyi to yam ka ra lasi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Nan Bitǝrus gip damtǝn den ununu ruya tu ba pi nupiwo, arni mbarǝm ju kan Karniliyus kar wur ba mbubar bom dǝ Simon wu dlǝr bǝdlabǝni. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Wu ngen momi ko Simon muntu kan mom ti na Bitǝrus ra lasi.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Nan Bitǝrus ra gip damtǝn den ruya tuwo, arni Ruhu kǝ Yam yari ti'e, &lt;&lt;Simon, mbarǝm myakan cwat den ngeni gi. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Tlyam kǝ ɗǝl suka. Ba kǝ ndu kǝ nge ritǝn nan wur da'a, domici ami ni a kar wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Kan Bitǝrus ba ɗǝl sur tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e mbarǝm tu kan kǝn den ngeni gwa. Ununu ɗir kǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Arni wu nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Karniliyus, bar mǝn bi-utu gon ni kar mi. Mbarǝm mǝn pitǝn dlat na bǝrti Yam ni. Kup mǝn Yahuda ba shin nartǝn gǝsi. Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ni yari ti'e tǝ la ki bi rǝn bom da tika, kǝ dǝ tǝ kum argon tu ki yari gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Arni tǝ ter na mǝn dǝkiyi gip bom gǝs wu mur lasi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Bitǝrus gip bom dǝ Karniliyus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Bar tlowo, kan Bitǝrus ba ri nan wuri, na ezǝn mǝn kopi jen kan ɗǝl ter Yapa gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Zut bar tlowo kan tǝ mbubar gip Kaisariya. Nan Karniliyus den ɓuti cwattǝn gǝzǝno arni tǝ dom mǝn gǝs na ga berǝm gǝs kan kosak nan ti gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Nan tǝ te gip bomiwo, arni Karniliyus mbor ti tǝ nda atl cina da ti gip bi tǝ nartǝni. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ama Bitǝrus tli ti yamka kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyami, ami ma mbarǝm ni katl.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Bitǝrus shirǝm nan ti kan tǝ te gip bomi kan tǝ zam mbarǝm na womti dom wur wi. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom'e den kulci gǝmiwo mǝn Yahuda ba ngash gam ko tǝ ri bom kǝ muntu kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'i da'a. Ama Yam ɓul ger gǝn a shin wi den ba a la bi murgon'e Yam baa nǝm ti da'a ko tǝ wan nar kǝ dǝ mǝn Yahuda me gam nan ti gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Arni kem nan karim baro, ko njem a dǝl shirǝm den ɗirtǝni da'a. Yari mi, unun kem kǝ karim bar rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Karniliyus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muri wupse karo, ami gip bom gǝn den shirǝm na Yam bar nan kǝni, bar kǝ gǝlla am myakan kǝ pǝte. An ri kǝtǝgon da'a se mbarǝm gon kǝn gip tutul dli mǝn cirtǝn dlor cina da'ǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Tǝ wule, &lt;Karniliyus, Yam kum shirǝm na Yam gi, tǝ pa shin bi bar kǝ am gi dǝ munju am ri wur kaar dagwa wi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Kar bar Yapa den Simon muntu ba la ti bi'e Bitǝrus gwa. Mǝn dǝki kǝ Simon mǝn luti kur ni, muntu bom gǝs ra bi bar ɓula gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Arni a dǝm da'a kan a kar bar den ki, ar mbun kan kǝ ter gwa. Kǝkǝno mǝn ni jin kup ɗe cina dǝ Yam kǝ dǝ mǝ kum kup argon tu Babom wul ki'e kǝ yari mi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munju mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kum Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yam wi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Kan Bitǝrus ba nǝm shirǝm na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno a momwi den'e na ho bi Yam ba ndu murgon man gon da'a <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ama tǝ nǝm kup munju kan ba bǝrti ti na pi argon tu kan dlat gwa na kup atl ju wu ra gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Kǝ mom shirǝm tu Yam kari bar mǝn Isra'ila kǝ pi wazu Zo Shirǝm kǝ zami dǝmi zhǝlili na Yam tǝp kar Yesu Almasihu. Mbarǝm tu Yesuwo Babom kǝ mǝn Israˈila ni katl da'a ama Babom kǝ mbarǝm kup ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Kǝ mom na argon tu kan pi gip atl kǝ Yahuda kup, argon tu nǝm gip Galili nan kop kaar kǝ wazu pi batisma kǝ Yohana gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Kǝ mom kandatu Yam bi Ruhu gǝs Yesu kǝ Nazarat gwa. Tǝ pa bi ti mani pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na ame. Kǝ mom kandatu tǝ kop las ko ako tǝ den pi mbarǝm ho bar na pǝni kumi dli kup munju kan gǝs dǝ Shetan gun dun itǝr gwa. Ti pini muntu kup domici Yam ra nan ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Mǝn ngapo mǝ shin kup bar ju tǝ pi gip atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda na gip bǝn Urushalima ma. Kup na untu, kiri mǝn bǝn kǝ Urushalima ri tǝ eka tǝp kǝ ba ɓa'i gǝs den kini. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ama Yam tli tǝka gip mǝshi mbarǝm den pǝt kǝ myakan, kan tǝ kem ba shin ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ba'e kup mbarǝm ni shin ti da'a, ama Yam zǝzar mi mǝ shin ti, arni kǝkǝno mǝ yari jen shirǝm den ti. Mǝn kan mǝ ci mǝ pal mǝ tla nan ti den kaar kǝ tlitǝn gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kan tǝ bi mi bi kǝ dǝ mǝ pi wazu mbarǝm kan mǝ dǝli wur kǝm kǝ dǝ wu mom'e Yesu ni'e muntu kan Yam zǝzari tǝ dǝm mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mbarǝm munju ra den kaar atl gwa na mǝshi kup. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kup shirǝm den ti den'e kup muntu kan ngǝsh den Yesu ba zam dǝ pǝni ti warwat pitǝn gǝska gip sun gǝsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yamwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Nan Bitǝrus ra gip shirǝmo, arni Ruhu kǝ Yam sur den kup munju kan kum shirǝm gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Mǝn Yahuda ju kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu kan kop Bitǝrus kaaro wu nǝm bi na ame den bi Ruhu kǝ Yam munju ma kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kumi gǝzǝn den shirǝm gip bi jen na ɗǝɗa Yam ni kem wu mom muntu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Arni Bitǝrus wule, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Woni ba hane dǝ pi mbarǝm ju batisma na male? Wu nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yamwi kandatu mǝn ma mǝ nǝm gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Kan wu bi wur bi den dǝ pi wur batisma gip sun kǝ Yesu Almasihu. Arni wu lir Bitǝrus kǝ dǝ tǝ ɓom muri nan wuri.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus yari nami mir mǝn kartǝni argon tu tǝ pi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na nami mǝn kopi kan gip atl kǝ Yahuda kum den'e munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da ma wu nǝm shirǝm kǝ Yam den Yesu wi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nan Bitǝrus mbubar Urushalimawo, arni mǝn Yahuda kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu gwa ngwar den ti. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ri bom kǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, kǝ pal kǝ ci fingal nan wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Arni Bitǝrus yari wur kup argon tu pigwa ter den gǝsi, tǝ wule, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Ami ra gip bǝn kǝ Yapa den shirǝm na Yami, arni a shin ruya. A shin argon wule bar bamuri kan la sur yam na bi wupse, kan ba sur atl las tu ami ra gwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nan a zhit gipiwo, arni a shin ga dabba kǝ gip lǝp, mǝn asǝm wupse, badǝr kǝ ga ici na ga lǝgandi, na yatl kǝ to yamka. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kan a kum yar ba wulǝm'e, &lt;Bitǝrus, tlyami. Mbosh kǝ ci.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Ama a nǝmi ti'e, &lt;O'o Babomi, a taɓe ci argon tu kan den kulci gǝmi kǝ mǝn Yahudawo ar dlǝran da'a ko wani ni gwa da'a.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Yari pa wul sur yam'e, &lt;Ba kǝ la bi argon'e dlǝran ni anra da'i da'a muntu kan Yam paliwi hoyi kǝ ci gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Muntu pi bisi myakan, kan ba dǝlka to yamka esi.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Lasi, se mbarǝm myakan kan kar wur karǝm ter Kaisariya gwa ni jin bom tu kan a dǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Arni Ruhu kǝ Yam yarim den a ri nan wur bat na dǝli shirǝm den ritǝni. Mir ɓyar mukka ju ma wu kopǝn kan mǝ te gip bom kǝ Karniliyus nan wuri. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Tǝ yari mi kandatu tǝ shin mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon dlor gip bom gǝsi, kan wul ti'e, &lt;Kar bar Yapa dǝ Simon muntu ba la ti bi'e Bitǝrus gwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Ti yari'i na kup munju kan gip bom gi kandatu Yam ba ɗǝli ine kan ti hukunte in den warwat pitǝn gin dagwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />&lt;&lt;Nan a pare shirǝmo arni Ruhu kǝ Yam sur den wur kandatu ar sur den mi na ne gǝs kǝ pi bar gwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Kan a dam argon tu Babom yari gwa'e, &lt;Yohana pini mbarǝm batisma na male, ama gip muri njem cina ɗewo, baa pi in batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yami.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ra'untuwo, nan wu ngǝsh wur den Yesu Almasihuwo kan Yam ba bi wur nǝm bar tu tǝ bi mi kan ngǝsh den Yesu Almasihu gwa, wo ni'e ami kan a pi gapa na Yam gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Nan wu kum untuwo, arni wu za ngwartǝn gǝzǝn den Bitǝrus kan wu ɗǝɗa Yam wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Rawo, Yam ni bi munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a tǝp kan wu ci atl gam wu zam rai kan ba pa da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn kopi kǝ Antakiya gip Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Munju kan gǝzanka den bi kumi dli pare den ri Istipanus eka ɓom asǝm na dlyami ba ri atl kǝ Finiks, na Saipǝros, na Antakiya gip Siriya. Wu pi wazu shirǝm kǝ Yam dǝ mǝn Yahuda katl. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Jen gip wuro mǝn Saipǝros na Sairin ni. Wu te gip bǝn kǝ Antakiya wu den pi wazu dǝ mǝn Yahuda na munju mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa, wu den yari wur Zo Shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Am kǝ Babom Yam ra den wuri, kan mbarǝm na womti ba nǝm shirǝm gǝzǝn wu ngǝsh wur den Babom Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Shirǝm kǝ bar tu kan piwo ar nda kǝm dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ gip Urushalima, arni wu kar Barnaba bǝn kǝ Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Nan tǝ mbubar tǝ shin argon tu Yam pi mbarǝm juwo, ar gholi ti mbatli kan tǝ ɓa'i wur bi-gul kǝ dǝ kup gǝzǝn dǝm mǝn kopi shirǝm kǝ Babom na mbatl gǝzǝn kup. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnabawo ho mbarǝm ni kan ra laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yam na ngǝshtǝn den Yesu gwa. Den argon tu tǝ pi gwawo arni mbarǝm na womti pal mǝn kopi Babom Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kan Barnaba ba ne gam Tarsus kǝ ngeni Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Nan tǝ zam tiwo, tǝ te nan ti Antakiya. Arni Barnaba na Shawulu dǝm nan wur kǝ sheti ghon nǝm den metǝn na domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi na kulci mbarǝm na womti. Gip Antakiya ni pare la'i bi mǝn kopi Yesu'e Kǝrista.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Gip wokoci ta ni mǝn mani yari bar ju baa pi cina ɗegwa jen za Urushalima kan wu ndara Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Nǝm gip wur mǝn sun Agabus tlyam dlor, gip Ruhu kǝ Yami arni tǝ shirǝm den bar guzǝm kan ba nda ɗir den atl kundǝrǝndlip gwa. (Muntu ɗir pini wokoci tu Kǝlaudiya ra bar Gun kǝ Roma gwa). <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Arni mǝn kopi kan gip Antakiya gwa pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝzǝn den kogonge gip wuri, den bi argon tu tǝ mani pi gwa, baa ne am ɓyari kan ba dǝm gip atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Wu pi muntu, kan wu kar bar na bar ju wu dom gwa dǝ si kiri kǝ mǝn kopiyi tǝp am dǝ Barnaba na Shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Tǝp tu kan Bitǝrus zam ɗǝltǝn gip bom kǝ moni gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Wokoci ta ni Gun Hiridus Agǝripa nǝm jen gip mir mǝn kopi, tǝ den ndu'i tǝ kumi wur dli. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Tǝ ri Yakubu, yas kǝ Yohana eka na bar sǝɓǝri. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nan tǝ shin'e mǝn Yahuda kum tǝmi kǝ bar tu tǝ piwo, arni tǝ pa nǝm Bitǝrus. Muntu pini wokoci kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Den kaar kǝ nǝmi gǝso, arni tǝ la ti gip bom kǝ moni, ba la ti am dǝ me gam kǝ mǝn bi-utu gudǝli wupse. Hiridus pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs den tǝ ɗǝli Bitǝrus kǝ tloyi ti shirǝm cina dǝ mbarǝm den kaar kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Nan Bitǝrus ra na le gip bom kǝ moniyiwo, arni mǝn kopi kur gǝs gip shirǝm na Yam domici gǝsi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kǝ gasi, ba wule gǝni Hiridus ba ɗǝli ti dǝ tloyi ti shirǝmo, Bitǝrus den nde umur gip dlom kǝ mǝn bi-utu rop. Ɓal tǝka na sarsari rop, kan na mǝn ne ger den ti dlor bǝdlabǝn bom kǝ moniyi. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bat na momi, arni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ɗǝl kar Bitǝrus, kan gip bom kǝ moniyi ba cirka. Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ɓo Bitǝrus den bǝbyala tǝ putu tǝka. Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zho'i kǝ tlyami!&gt;&gt; Arni sarsariyi pǝtl ter am dǝ Bitǝrus ka.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kem tutul dli na kaptǝlan gi.&gt;&gt; Nan Bitǝrus pi untuwo, arni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Dlǝmat bar lulur gika kǝ kopǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Kan Bitǝrus ba kop ti wu ɗǝl ter kari, ama tǝ mom dyatlǝm argon tu mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ba pi gwa da'a, tǝ wule ko ruya ni tǝ shini. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Kan wu bi kaar mǝn ɓuti bǝdlabǝn kǝ nǝm na kǝ ropi, wu mbubar kar bǝdlabǝn kǝ gǝlla kan ba kop dǝ su gip bǝn gwa. Arni bǝdlabǝni ɓuli wur na gam gǝsi, kan wu ɗǝl kaari. Nan wu kop tlyartǝn kǝ tǝpewo, wule gip njibkǝr gere, arni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami za ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Nan gam ceti Bitǝruso arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno a mom wi'e Babom Yam ni kar mǝn kartǝn bar gǝs kan tǝ ɗǝlim am dǝ Hiridus na kup argon tu mǝn Yahuda ba ndu pim gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Nan Bitǝrus mom untuwo, arni tǝ ri bom dǝ Maryamu nasi Yohana, muntu ba la ti bi'e Markus gwa, las tu mbarǝm dom wur wu den shirǝm na Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Bitǝrus ɓo bǝdlabǝn tetǝn gip bomi, kan zher nye gǝr gon mǝn sun'e Roda ba ɗǝl ter kǝ ɓuli bǝdlabǝni. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nan tǝ kum yar kǝ Bitǝrusno, tǝ laa na ghol mbatl naari, arni ma tǝ'i ɓul bǝdlabǝni da'a kan tǝ pal na kǝtǝr te gipi ka, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bitǝrus ni dlor te kaari ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Arni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Gam pǝtli ika wi!&gt;&gt; Ama nan tǝ kǝrceka den untuno, arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ba ni'e mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam kan ra nan ti gwa ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ama Bitǝrus pi ta ɓe bǝdlabǝni. Nan wu ɓul bǝdlabǝn wu shin tǝwo, arni wu nǝm bi na ame. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Bitǝrus pi wur am kǝ dǝ wu yoni, arni tǝ yari wur kandatu Babom ɗǝli ti gip bom kǝ moniyi gwa. Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Yarini Yakubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakubuyi muntuwo erǝm kǝ Yesu ni muntu wu nǝna nǝm nan ti gwa.</char></note> na nami mir ɓyar argon tu pi gwa.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ za lasi tǝ ndara kǝtǝgoni.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Kǝ cigǝniwo, bǝrti na ghuntǝn nda gip dlom kǝ mǝn bi-utuyi naari, den argon tu nan ndo na Bitǝrus gwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Hiridus Agǝripa kem ba kop las kup kǝ ngeni Bitǝrus ama wu zam ti da'a, arni tǝ ngen momi kar mǝn ɓutiyi kan tǝ tloyi wur shirǝm den dǝ ri wur eka.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 12:19">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Hiridus Agǝripa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Arni Hiridus za atl kǝ Yahudaka tǝ ndara Kaisariya, tǝ nye dǝm lasi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Hiridus na mbarǝm kǝ Taya na mǝn Sidon den ta tli yar yami, arni wu mo gam kan wu ngen dǝmi nan ti. Nan wu zam Bǝlastus, bar zher kǝ gunyi nde wur kaaro, arni wu ngen dǝmi zhǝlili, domici atl kǝ Hiridus ni ba zami atl gǝzǝn fingali. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Den pǝt tu kan newo, arni Hiridus la bar lulur gǝs kǝ Gunye, tǝ dǝm den badǝmi gǝsi kan tǝ shirǝm na mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Arni wu la yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yar kǝ yam gon utu, kǝ mbarǝm ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />An ri kǝtǝgon da'a, nan Hiridus bi nartǝn Yam dawo, arni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Babom Yam gon ɓo ti atli, zhimbǝr ba ci dli gǝska kan tǝ mǝshka.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ama mir mǝn kopi Yesu ci cina na yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ko-ako kan mbarǝm na womti ba ngǝsh wur den Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Gip wokoci tu nan Barnaba na Shawulu pa'i argon tu si wur Urushalimawo arni wu pal gǝzǝn to Antakiyaka, kan wu pǝn Yohana nan wuri, muntu kan ba pa la ti bi'e Markus gwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ne am kaar ga Barnaba na Shawulu kǝ pi mbapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ Antakiyawo mǝn yari Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yam na mir mǝn kulci mbarǝm ra. Wi ni'e ga Barnaba, na Simon kan ba la ti bi'e Dun Mbarǝm gwa. Na ga Lukiyas mbarǝm kǝ Sairin, Manayan (muntu kan nar na Hiridus Antipas gwa) na Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Nan wu den bote Babom na guzum malo, arni Ruhu kǝ Yam wule, &lt;&lt;Nem ni Barnaba na Shawulu markǝme kǝ pi mbap tu kan a la wur bi ragwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Nan wu pa'i guzum maliwo, kan wu shirǝm na Yami, arni wu ne wur am den gami kan wu za wur wu ndara.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ritǝn kǝ wazu kǝ Bulus kǝ nǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Wi rop juwo Ruhu kǝ Yam ni kar wuri, kan wu su Salukiya wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu te den atl kǝ Saipǝros. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Nan wu mbubar gip bǝn Salamiso, arni wu pi wazu shirǝm kǝ Yam te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudaka. Yohana Markus mǝn ne wur am ra nan wuri.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Kan wu kop gip bǝni kan te dlom bar ɓula kagwa wu mbubar bǝn kǝ Pafos. Barta ni wu mo na mbarǝm kǝ Yahuda mǝn war goni, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ lar gon mǝn sun'e Bar-Yeshu'a. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Tǝ ngash gam gǝs na gobna Sarjiyas Bulus. Gobnayi mom bar naari, arni tǝ kar bar den ga Barnaba na Shawulu domici tǝ ndu tǝ kum shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ama Elimas mǝn wari (domici untun sun gǝs ra na bi kǝ mǝn Hellas) nge wuri. Tǝ pi ta ngeni tǝp den ba dǝ gobnayi ngǝsh ti den Yesu den argon tu Barnaba na Shawulu kulci mbarǝm gwa da'a.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Arni Shawulu muntu ba pa la ti bi'e Bulus gwa, laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yam wi ger mǝn wari kan tǝ wule, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Kiwo wule Shetan ni kira, mǝn gapa na kup argon tu kan dlat gwa! Kǝ laa'i wi na kup tǝp kǝ ɗasi tu na setǝne. Ki za ndu'i zhimbǝl bar kǝ Yam kan untun anra na yari argon den Yam kan untun anra gwa da'aya? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Kǝkǝno am kǝ Babom Yam kǝ hukuntetǝn baa sur den ki. Ki te tabi ka. Ki hol mani shini pǝt kǝ wokoci goni.&gt;&gt; An ri kǝtǝgon da'a, arni argon wule ɓondi na dǝmǝn nǝmi tǝ gerka. Tǝ nǝm kari ame, tǝ den ngeni muntu ba nǝmi ti am gwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Nan gobnayi shin argon tu kan piwo, arni tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu, domici kulci den Yesuyi dlǝkǝn ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazu kǝ Bulus gip Antakiya kǝ Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Nan Bulus na ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝs za Pafosa gip kungǝlǝn jikat malo, arni wu ndara bǝn kǝ Paga kan gip atl kǝ Pamfiliya gwa. Lasi ni Yohana Markus za wur kan tǝ pal gǝs su Urushalimaka. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Nan wu za bǝn kǝ Pagawo, arni wu ndara bǝn kǝ Antakiya gip atl kǝ Pisidiya. Den pǝt Asabaro wu te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda wu dǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Den kaar zhiti gip Kulci kǝ Musa na gip rǝshi tǝlankur kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yamo, arni kiri kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi kar gon tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, kǝn nǝra na shirǝm kǝ ɓa'i mbarǝm bigulo, mǝ lir kǝn kǝ yarini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Arni Bulus tlyami, tǝ pi am kǝ dǝ wu yoni, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila nan kǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba bote Yam gwa, kumǝn ni! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Yam kǝ mbarǝm gǝmi mǝn Isra'ila zǝzar ga ba gǝmi. Tǝ kem wur kǝ womtitǝn wokoci dǝmi gǝzǝn gip Masar, kan na bar ndǝrtǝn kǝ yar am tǝ ɗǝli wur ter gip atl ta. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kup na wu pi ta nge kopi shirǝm gǝska, tǝ pi ta ne ger den wur gip lǝp tu kan murgon ba dǝm da'a bar kǝ sheti ghon hauya-rop. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, tǝ piika na atl nyingi kǝ gip Kan'ana. Tǝ bi atl gǝzǝn mbarǝm gǝs kǝ dǝ ar dǝm gwazini. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Kup munju pi ni gip sheti ghon hauya kǝba lasi hauya nǝm na rop na kutl (450).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">&lt;&lt;Den kaar kǝ untuwo, Yam bi wur mǝn tloyi shirǝm kan baa nde wur cina gwa ar ba ri wokoci kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Sama'ila. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Kan wu liri den dǝ bi wur gunye, arni Yam bi wur Saul nya Kish. Tǝ kǝ gip gǝsgal kǝ Bilyaminu ni, kan tǝ dǝm gun gǝzǝn kǝ sheti ghon hauya rop. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Den kar kǝ shu'i Saul den dǝmi gun kawo, tǝ pali Dauda tǝ dǝm gun gǝzǝni. Yam yari den ti'e, &lt;A zam Dauda nya Jesse wi. Ti badǝr mbarǝm mǝn mbatl tu a ndu gwani. Ti pi kup argon tu a ndu tǝ pi gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />&lt;&lt;Tǝp kar gǝsgal kǝ mbarǝm tu ni Yam ɗiri Isra'ila Yesu Mǝn Ɗǝli Mbarǝme, kandatu tǝ wule ti pi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kapǝn ɗirtǝn kǝ Yesuwo, Yohana pi kup mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila wazu kǝ ci atl gam kar Yam wi kan tǝ pi wur batisma. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Nan Yohana mbi kosak na pa'i mbap gǝso, tǝ wule, &lt;Kǝ wulem'e ami woni? Ami ni'e Almasihu da'a. O'o, ama tǝ den ɗirtǝn den kaar gǝn njem. A kǝm pǝtli zap kaptǝlan gǝs ter asǝm da tika da'a.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim, na kup gin kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba bǝrti Yam gwa, mǝn ni kari mi bar na shirǝm kǝ zami ɗǝltǝne. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kup na wu kur zhit argon tu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam rǝsh kup wokoci tu wu dom wur kǝ ba bota gwa ama wu mani momi argon tu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ju yari gwa da'a. Arni kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda ju wule dǝ ri ti eka. Na untuni wu kem argon tu ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami yari'e ba pi gwa laa'i. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Kup na wu mani zami argon tu baa kem dǝ ri ti eka gwa da'a, ama wu lir Bilatus den wu ndu dǝ ri ti eka.<verse eid="ACT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />&lt;&lt;Nan wu pa'i pi kup bar ju shirǝm kǝ Yam yari den tiwo, wu shu ti sur den rati kini kan ɓa ti dene gwa, kan wu la ti gip gambǝci'e. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ama Yam tli tika gip mǝshi mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Kǝ muri na womti munju ɓom asǝm nan ti, argon tu pǝn gip atl kǝ Galili ba su Urushalima gwa shin ti. Kǝkǝno wi ni'e mǝn yari mbarǝm gǝmi bar ju wu shin na ger gǝzǝn gwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ yari in ni Zo Shirǝmi. Argon tu Yam wule ti pii ga ba gǝmi wo <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />tǝ pi mi wi, mǝn mimir gǝzǝni, tǝp kǝ ba tli Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme. Kandatu anra na rǝshi gip Zabura kǝ rop'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;Ki nya gǝn ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Sekǝn ni a dǝmi'i Bǝba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Yam tli Almasihu gip mǝshi mbarǝme, ti'i mǝsh da'a. Den kǝn ni ar ba shirǝm'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;Na ho bi, aa ne in am ra kandatu a wul Dauda'e aa pi ti gwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Tǝ pa yari den Almasihu gip Zabura gon'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;Ki za Zo'i gi kan kǝ ne markǝm gwa tǝ moka gip gambǝci da'a.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />&lt;&lt;Nan Dauda pi argon tu Yam ndu tǝ pi gip zhan gǝso, kan tǝ mǝshka. Tǝ es wule ga base, kap tǝka kan dli gǝs ba moka. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ama muntu kan Yam tli ti gip mǝshiyiwo tǝ moka da'a.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt;Ra'untuwo, mir ɓyari, kum ni! Gip mbarǝm tu Yesu ni pǝni warwat pitǝn ginka ra. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kup muntu kan ngǝsh den tiwo wi zam ɗǝltǝn gip kup bar ju Kulci kǝ Musa hol ɗǝli gin gipi gwawi. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ngup kǝnni, ba dǝ argon tu ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam yari laa'i den kǝn da'a. Domici wu wule,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;Kum ni, kǝn kan kǝ mburǝmka gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nǝm ni bi na am gip dlǝkǝntǝne kǝ mǝsh nika!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ari kǝ pi argon gip muri gini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Ki nǝm den aa pi da'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ko murgon ni yari in gwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />&lt;&lt;Nan Bulus na Barnaba den za'i bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayiwo, arni mbarǝm lir wur den wu ɗir den zut Asabar wu shirǝm ra den bar ju. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Nan mbarǝm ju dom wur gwa ba za lasiwo, arni na womti kǝ mǝn Yahuda na munju ba bote Yam kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kop Bulus na Barnaba. Arni wu shirǝm nan wur kan wu ɓa'i wur bigul den wu ci cina na ngǝshtǝn den zo mbatl kǝ Yam kup na wu ndari dǝ Yam pi wur untu dagwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus pal gǝs kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />&lt;&lt;Den zut pǝt Asabaro, njem ni dǝ wule kup bǝni dom wur kǝ kumi shirǝm den Babom Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nan mǝn Yahuda shin womtitǝn kǝ mbarǝmo, arni ghuve nǝm wuri kan wu pi zhe'e shirǝm den argon tu Bulus ba yari gwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />&lt;&lt;Kano Bulus na Barnaba ba nǝmi wur bat na bǝrti wu wule, &lt;Ar nǝm den kǝn ni mi pare yari in shirǝm kǝ Yami. Ama kǝn den nge shirǝm kǝ Yami. Na pi untuwo kǝ gode'e kǝ ndari zami rai kan ba pa da'i da gwa. Mǝ za kǝn mǝ pal kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwawi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Domici argon tu Babom wule mǝ pi gwa ni'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;&lt;Aa pali in kǝ dǝm cirtǝn kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kǝ dǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip zam ɗǝltǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Nan kup munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kum shirǝm tuwo, wu pi ghol mbatli. Wu ɗǝɗa shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu, na kup munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan Yam ne wur kǝ zami rai kan ba pa dagwa ngǝsh wur den Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Shirǝm kǝ Babom ri ko ako gip kǝti atliyi.<verse eid="ACT 13:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ama mǝn Yahudayi tli mbatl mǝtli mǝn bǝrti Yam kan ba kum nan wur gwa na kiri kǝ bǝni. Wu tli ga Bulus na Barnaba gami, kan wu ɗǝli wur gip atl gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Arni wu bat kushka kǝ den asǝm gǝzǝnka gip seda den nge wur wi, kan wu ndara Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Kup mǝn kopi Yesu laa'i na ghol mbatl na Ruhu kǝ Yami.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulus na Barnaba gip Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Bulus na Barnaba ra gip Ikoniyawo arni wu te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda kandatu wu kur pi gwa. Kan wu pi wazu hoyi kan kem mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a na womti pal mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ama mǝn Yahuda ju kan nge ngǝshtǝn den Yesu tli mbatl yam munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa, zam wu shin mir ɓyari na dun gere. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ra'untuwo arni Bulus na Barnaba dǝm lasi kǝ muri na womti, wu den shirǝm bat na bǝrti den Babom Yesu muntu kop kar kǝ wazu kǝ zo mbatl gǝs tǝp kǝ ba bi wur mani pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Arni mbarǝm kǝ bǝni tatlka bomi rop, jen den kopi kaar kǝ argon tu mǝn Yahudayi yari gwa, jen ngapo wu den kopi kar kǝ argon tu mir mǝn kartǝni yari gwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Arni jen gip mǝn Yahuda na jen munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, na kǝ cina gǝzǝn ba gudlumi kǝ dǝ wu pi zhe'e mbap mir mǝn kartǝni kan wu la wur na tate. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ama mir mǝn kartǝni zam na momika kan wu kǝtǝr gǝzǝn gip bǝn kǝ Listǝra na kǝ Darba gip Likoniya na bi lǝp gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Lasi ni wu ci cina na pi wazu kǝ Zo Shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus na Barnaba gip Listǝra na Darba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Gip Listǝrawo, kurki gon ra ba kur dǝm muntu ra untu na gǝri gǝs gwa tǝ mani desi atl da'a. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Tǝ kum Bulus nan ti den shirǝm gwa. Arni Bulus wi ti gere kan tǝ shin mbarǝmi na ngǝshtǝn den Yesu kan baa mani pǝni ti kumi dli gǝska gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Kan Bulus ba tli yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ dlǝr den asǝm gi!&gt;&gt; Warkǝca arni mbarǝmi tlyam tǝ nǝm desi atli.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Nan womti mbarǝmi shin argon tu Bulus piwo, arni wu tli yar yam gip bi gǝzǝn kǝ mǝn Likoniya wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ga yam sur kar miwi na dli kǝ mbarǝme!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Kan wu la bi Barnaba Zeyus, Bulus ngapo wu la ti bi Hames, domici ti ni'e gun shirǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Arni lǝɓa kǝ yam Zeyus, muntu kan bom kǝ bote ti ra kaar bǝni, ba ɗiri ga tla na ga buzǝn kin bǝdlabǝn bǝni, domici ti na kup womti mbarǝmi ni den ndu'i wi mbosh dabba gip bote mir mǝn kartǝni.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ama nan Barnaba na Bulus mir mǝn kartǝni kum untuwo, arni wu tlyati tutul dli gǝzǝnka. Wu kop gip dlom womti mbarǝmi na kǝtǝre wu den la'i yar na wultǝn'e, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ pi untuwu? Mǝn ma mbarǝm ni katl, mǝn dli wule kǝne. Mǝ ɗiri in ni Zo Shirǝmi, mǝ yari in den kǝ bali ni kar bar ju kan argon ni da'a kǝ pal ni kar Yam mǝn rai. Ti ni'e muntu kan pi yam na atl na bar ɓula, na kup bar ju gip wurgwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Terkawo, tǝ za mbarǝm kan den kar bar atl kup wu kop tǝp tu kan wu shin mbuni wur gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ama kup na untu tǝ za gam gǝs bat na seda tu kan baa mom'e tǝra gwa da'a. Tǝ gode mbarǝm zo mbatl gǝs tǝp kǝ ba bi in ghon sur yami na bar kǝ gip kǝn den wokoci gǝzǝni. Ti ni tǝ bi in fingal ar kǝm kǝn kan tǝ laa'i in na ghol mbatli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kup na shirǝm juwo, njem ni arsa dǝ womti mbarǝmi mboshi wur dabba gip bote wuri.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Kan mǝn Yahuda jen ba tli tor Antakiya na Ikoniya gip atl kǝ Pisidiya kan wu zam gam kǝ womti mbarǝmi. Wu la Bulus na tat wu dǝl ti kaar bǝni, wu pǝn'e tǝ mǝsh kawi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama nan mǝn kopi dom wur wu la ti dlomo, arni tǝ tlyam tǝ pal te gip bǝnika. Bar tlowo arni wu ndara Darba nan ti na Barnaba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus na Barnaba pal Antakiyaka gip atl kǝ Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Wu pi wazu Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yesu gip Darba kan wu zam mir mǝn kulci kar wur na womti. Arni wu pal gip bǝn Listǝra na Ikoniya na Antakiyaka gip atl kǝ Pisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wu pi ta ndǝri na ɓa'i wur bigul gip ngǝshtǝn den Yam gǝzǝni. Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar nǝm mi mǝ kop gip kumi dli na womti kan mǝ mani zami tetǝn gip las tu Yam baa dǝm gun gǝmi baa patǝn gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bulus na Barnaba ne wur kiri mǝn kopi nan wur gip kogonge ba domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi. Na shirǝm na Yam na guzum male, arni wu la wur am dǝ ne ger kǝ Babom Yesu, muntu wu ngǝsh wur den ti gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Den kar kǝ kopi gip atl kǝ Pisidiyawo, arni wu mbubar Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Nan wu pi wazu shirǝmi gip bǝn Pagawo, kan wu ndara Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Nan wu za Pagawo kan wu pal na kar su Antakiyaka gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, las tu wu la wur gip zo mbatl kǝ Yam den mbap tu kan wu'i pa'i gwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Nan wu mbubar gip bǝn Antakiyawo, arni wu dom mǝn kopi kǝ ba lasi nǝm. Wu yari wur kup bar ju Yam pi tǝp kar wur gwa, na kandatu Yam ɓuli bǝdlabǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yam munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Kan wu dǝm lasi na mǝn kopi Yesu kǝ muri na womti.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Me gam su Urushalimaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wokoci tu Bulus na Barnaba ra gip bǝn kǝ Antakiya gip atl kǝ Siriyawo, arni mǝn Yahuda jen kan ba kop Yesu ba tli tor Yahuda wu su Antakiya kan wu nǝmi kulci mir ɓyar'e, &lt;&lt;In sǝr kini den kandatu Kulci kǝ Musa yari gwa dawo, ki zam ɗǝltǝn gip warwat pitǝn kar Yam da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Muntu ɗiri Bulus na Barnaba musu nar na bali shirǝm nan wuri. Arni mir mǝn kopi ne bi den dǝ Bulus na Barnaba, na mǝn kopi jen gip Antakiya su Urushalima wu shin mir mǝn kartǝni na kiri mǝn cina kǝ mǝn kopi den shirǝm tu. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi la wur tǝpe, arni den tǝp gǝzǝno wu kop gip bǝn Finiks na Samariya, kan wu yari wur kandatu munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a pal kar Yamwu gwa. Shirǝm tu gholi mbatl mir ɓyar kup kǝ mir bǝn ju.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Nan wu mbubar gip Urushalimawo, arni mir mǝn kopi na mir mǝn kartǝni na kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi pi ɗem nan wuri. Wu yari wur bar ju kup Yam pi tǝp kar wur gip munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ama jen gip mǝn kopi Yesu kan gip me gam kǝ mǝn Parise tlyam dlor kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Munju mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ngǝsh wur den Yesuwo, ar nǝm wur te yarka dǝ sǝr wuri kan wu kop Kulci kǝ Musa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Arni mir mǝn kartǝni na kiri mǝn cina kǝ mǝn kopi mo gam den bi zhiti shirǝm tu. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Den kar kǝ tlyari bali shirǝmo, kan Bitǝrus ba tlyam tǝ shirǝm nan wur nan kǝni, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, kǝ mom'e wokoci gon terkawo Yam zǝzarǝm gip kǝn kǝ dǝ a pi wazu kǝ Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yesu dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa, kǝ dǝ wu ngǝsh wur den tira. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Yam kan mom mbatl kǝ mbarǝm gwa gode'e tǝ nǝm munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a tǝp kǝ ba bi wur Ruhu gǝsi, kandatu tǝ bi mi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Tǝ pali mbatl gǝzǝn dlǝran tǝp kǝ ba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu wi. Na untun tǝ gode'e bom ni mǝn ra nan wur da'a. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Kǝkǝno, unun kem kǝ ndu kǝ kem Yam kǝ pi lo'e, tǝp kǝ ba ne mǝn kopiyi gosgam muntu kan min na ga ba gǝmi mani pǝni dagwawu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />O'o! Mǝ mom'e Yam ɗǝli ni kup gǝmi tǝp kar zo mbatl kǝ Babom gǝmi Yesu. Nǝm untuni Yam ɗǝli munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kup munju ra lasi sa shot wu den damtǝn den argon tu Bitǝrus yari gwa. Den kariwo kan Barnaba na Bulus ba yari bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na dlǝkǝntǝn ju kup kan Yam pi tǝp am da wur dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nan wu pa'i shirǝmo, arni Yakubu shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, kumǝn ni! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simon Bitǝrus yari mi kandatu Yam gode'e tǝ ra na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a su mbatlka tǝp kǝ ba yemi gip wur den wu dǝm mbarǝm gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Shirǝm kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kop kaar kǝ mǝnkǝni, kandatu anra na rǝshi gwa'e,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt;Den kaar kǝ muntuwo aa pali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">kan a tli bom kǝ Dauda kan ndaka gwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Aa pa tu nami dli bini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Aa tli ti peli esi,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Kǝ dǝ nami mbarǝm kan sa gwa ngen Babomi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">na kup munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba la wur bi na sun gǝn gwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Babom ni yari,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Muntu kan kem ba mom bar ju terka gwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />&lt;&lt;Gi shini gǝno, ba mǝ kem ar dǝm banyi bar kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan den paltǝn kar Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Mǝn de mǝ rǝshi wur ni tǝlankuri. Gip tǝlankuriwo mǝ yari wur den ba wu ci fingal tu kan ta'i tat war gwa da'a. Ba wu la gam gǝzǝn gip muri na mǝtli ko moni kari da'a. Ba wu ci tlu kǝ dabba tu kan ceni ti yarka gwa da'a, na ci tlu na bǝrani. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />A yari ni untu domici den pi wazu kǝ kulci kǝ Musa gip kogonge bǝn terka kan ba zhit gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda den pǝt Asabar kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝlankur tu kan rǝshi munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Kano mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi na kup mir mǝn kopi ba kop kar kǝ argon tu Yakubu yari gwa. Kan wu pǝn gip mbatl gǝzǝn den wu zǝzar mbarǝm rop kan wu kar wur gip bǝn Antakiya gip atl kǝ Siriya na ga Bulus na Barnaba. Munju wu zǝzari gwa ni'e Yahuda (kan ba la ti bi'e Barsaba gwa) na Sila, rop gip kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopiyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Kan wu kar wur na tǝlankur kǝni.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">Mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu na kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi, mir ya'ǝni,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">Dǝ si munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu kan gip Antakiya, Siriya na Kilikiya gwa.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">Mǝ shirmi inka.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Mǝ kum den'e jen ra kan ɗǝl gip mi ba'e na bi gǝmi ni da'a kan wu ghun kǝne. Wu tli in mbatl na argon tu wu yari gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Arni kem mǝ me bi den mǝ zǝzar mbarǝm jen kan mǝ kar wur kar kǝne na ga berǝm gǝmi Barnaba na Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />mbarǝm ju kan wur mbatl gǝzǝnka den bi kǝ Babom gǝmi Yesu Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ra'untuwo, arni mǝ kari in bar na Yahuda na Sila kǝ dǝ wu kop kari na yari in argon tu mǝ rǝsh gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ruhu kǝ Yam kop nan mi den ba dǝ mǝ ne in argon gam bom na mǝnjin kan ba ndu kar kǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Dǝm ni bat na ci fingal tu kan ta'i tat war gwa, na ci tlu na mbǝrani. Ba kǝ cini tlu kǝ dabba tu kan ceni ti yarka gwa da'a. Ba kǝ la ni gam gin gip muri na mǝtli na moni ko moni na mǝtli kari da'a. Arba mbuni ine kǝn ni kǝ pi munju gwa. Dǝ ar mbuni ine.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kan ba la munju kan kar wuri gwa tǝpe wu ndara Antakiya, las tu mir mǝn kopiyi dom wur gwa kan wu bi wur rǝshi tǝlankuri. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Wu zhit gipiwo ar gholi wur mbatl na shirǝm ɓa'i bigul tu kan ra gipi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Arni Yahuda na Sila, munju kan mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni, pi tlyari shirǝmi, den bi ɓa'i wur bigul na ndǝrtǝn kǝ mir ɓyar gip ngǝshtǝn gǝzǝn den Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nan wu ɓom dǝmi nan wur lasiwo, arni mir ɓyari la wur tǝp na ghol mbatl kǝ dǝmi zhǝlili kan wu pal rin kar munju kan kar wur gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />(Ama Sila shin ar mbun tǝ dǝm lasi)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tǝlankuri jen ra na shirǝm tu gipi da'a</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ama Bulus na Barnaba dǝm gip bǝn Antakiya, las tu wi na jen na womti kulci mbarǝm na pi wazu shirǝm kǝ Babom gwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi nde Bulus na Barnaba nǝm da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Den kaar kǝ wokoci gono Bulus wul Barnaba'e, &lt;&lt;Naa mǝ kop kaar kǝ mir ɓyar gip bǝn ju kup mǝ pi wazu shirǝm kǝ Babom gwa, mǝ shin ci cina kǝ ngǝshtǝn den Yesu gǝzǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba ndu wu pǝn Yohana, kan ba pa la ti bi'e Markus gwa, nan wuri. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ama Bulus shino ar mbun dǝ ri nan ti da'a, domici tǝ ndara tǝ za wur ka gip Pamfiliya, tǝ mani ci cina gip mbap nan wur da'a. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Wu tli yar yam naar den shirǝm tu, kan kogonge ba pǝn tǝp gǝsi. Barnaba pǝn Markus kan wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu ndara Saipǝros. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Bulus ngapo tǝ pǝn Sila kan wu ndara, nan mir ɓyar la wur gip am na ne ger kǝ zo mbatl kǝ Babom gwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Tǝ kop gip atl kǝ Siriya na Kilikiya tǝ den ndǝri dlǝri kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ritǝn kǝ mbap kǝ Bulus kǝ rop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bulus mbubar Darba kan tǝ ndara Listǝra, las tu mǝn kopi gon ra mǝn sun'e Timoti. Naso mǝn Yahuda ni, mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu, ama baso mǝn Hellas ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Mir ɓyar kan gip bǝn Listǝra na Ikoniya pi shirǝm kǝ ho bar den ti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus ndu tǝ ri na Timoti gip ɓomi asǝm gǝsi, arni tǝ sǝr tǝka den bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda kan ba dǝm lasi gwa, domici kup gǝzǝn mom den'e baso mǝn Hellas ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Nan wu den kopi bǝn bǝno, arni wu yari mbarǝm argon tu mir mǝn kartǝni na kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ Urushalima mo bi dene kan wi kop gwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Muntu ɗiri domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi ndǝrtǝn gip ngǝshtǝn gǝzǝn den Yesu na womtitǝn den pǝt kup.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus shin ruya kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Makidoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus na ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝs kop gip atl kǝ Pirijiya na atl kǝ Galatiya, nan Ruhu kǝ Yam za wur wu pi wazu gip atl kǝ Asiya dagwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Nan wu mbubar den bi atl kǝ Misiyawo, wu ndu wu bǝtl gam Arewa gip atl kǝ Bitiniya, ama Ruhu kǝ Yesu za wur da'a. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Arni wu kop gip Misiya kan wu ndara Tǝrowasa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Gip dlom gaso arni Bulus shin ruya kǝ Ba mǝn Makidoniya gon dlor den liri gǝs ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ter ɗe Makidoniya kǝ ne mi am ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Nan Bulus shin ruya tuwo, tǝ pǝn'e Yam ni ba la mi bi kǝ pi wazu Zo Shirǝm kǝ Yesu gip Makidoniya, arni mǝ dǝm daˈa kan mǝ ndara.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya gip Filibi nǝm Yesu wi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Mǝ za Tǝrowasa gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan kor mǝ ndara Samotǝras. Bar tlowo kan mǝ mbubar Niyapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Mǝ za barta kan mǝ mbubar Filibbi, bar bǝn gip atl kǝ Makidoniya. Mǝn Roma ni ba dǝm lasi. Kan mǝ mur na womti gip bǝni.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Den pǝt Asabaro mǝ ɗǝl gip bǝni mǝ ri bi ɓula'i, las tu mǝ pǝn'e mi zam ba shirǝm na Yam gwa. Mǝ dǝm atl kan mǝ shirǝm na mǝtli jen kan dom wur lasi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Nǝm gip mǝtliyi kan kum miwo sun gǝs ni'e Lidiya. Mǝn Tiyatira ni kan ba wur tutul dli mǝn bar wurpi kagwa, mǝn bote Yami. Babom ɓul mbatl gǝs kǝ nǝmi shirǝm tu Bulus yari gwa kan tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Nan pi ti batisma na mbarǝm kǝ bom gǝso, arni tǝ la mi bi rin bom da tika na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom a ngǝshim den Babom Yesuwi, a lir kǝn kǝ ɗir dǝm ni gip bom gǝni.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ meti mi se nan mǝ nǝmi ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus na Sila gip bom kǝ moni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Gasi gon nan mǝn den ritǝn kǝ ba shirǝm na Yamo, mǝ mo na zher nye gǝr gon kan na dun itǝr kan ba kem tǝ mani yari argon tu ba pi cina ɗegwa. Tǝ zami babom gǝs wurpi nar tǝp kǝ ba yari bar ju ba pi cina ɗegwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Nye gǝr tu kop Bulus na nami gǝmi tǝ den la'i yar na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm jǝno zher kǝ Yam tu kan nar man kup nami yam gwani. Wu yari in ni tǝp kǝ zami ɗǝltǝn gip warwat pitǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Tǝ pi ta pi untu kǝ muri na womti. Ar pi untu har ba ghun Bulus kan tǝ bal ti rǝn den tika, tǝ wul dun itǝri kan gip ti'e, &lt;&lt;Gip sun kǝ Yesu Almasihu ni a wul ki'e kǝ ɗǝl ter gip ti!&gt;&gt; Lasi, arni dun itǝri za ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ama nan mǝn nye gǝr zheriyi shin'e tǝp zami wurpi gǝzǝn i'dawo, arni wu nǝm Bulus na Sila kan wu dǝl wur rin bi bar pǝtka, cina dǝ mǝn bǝni. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wu ri wur cina dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm jǝn pali bǝn gǝmi ka ghiruwi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wi mǝn Yahuda ni kan ba kulci den mǝ pi bar ju kan ndari da'a den kulci gǝmi kǝ mǝn Roma kan mǝ nǝm ko mǝ pi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Arni womti mbarǝmi tli den Bulus na Sila wu nǝm ɓe gǝzǝni. Mǝn tloyi shirǝmi kem dǝ tus tutul dli gǝzǝnka dǝ ɓo wuri. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Den kaar kǝ ɓe gǝzǝn hoyiwo, kan ba la wur gip bom kǝ moni, na yari mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi den tǝ ne ger den wur hoyi, ba wu mani ɗǝltǝn da'a. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Nan yari untuwo, arni mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi la wur gip kushi kan te gipi kagwa, kan tǝ tlat asǝm gǝzǝnka gip dlom giɓǝr basi nyash rop.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Gip dlom gaso, Bulus na Sila den shirǝm na Yam na tli yar wuli kon ɗǝɗa Yami, nami mir mǝn bom kǝ moniyi den kumi gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bat na momi, arni atl jirkǝt ti hoyi, kan ba kem gatl bin bom kǝ moniyi ba jiti ti. Biyi nǝm arni kup bǝdlabǝn bom kǝ moniyi ɓulka, kano sarsari ju ɓal kogonge nari ba pǝtlka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Nan mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi putu tǝ shin kup bǝdlabǝn bom kǝ moniyi na ɓuliwo, arni tǝ dlii bar sǝɓǝr gǝs tǝ ri kǝ ri gam gǝs eka. Tǝ ndu ni pi untu domici tǝ pǝn'e mir mǝn bom kǝ moniyi kǝtǝr gǝzǝn wi. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ama Bulus tli yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kumi dli gi da'a! Mǝn ra kup ɗe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Kan mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi ba wule dǝ teri ti utu, tǝ kǝtǝr te gipika kan tǝ nda atl cina dǝ Bulus na Sila tǝ den dǝdartǝni. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kan tǝ ɗǝli wur ter kari tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kiri mbarǝme, unun a pi kan a zam ɗǝltǝn bi dǝ mǝshtǝn gwawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Wu nǝmi tǝ'e, &lt;&lt;Ngǝsh ki den Babom Yesu, ki zam ɗǝltǝne, ki na kup munju gip bom da'i gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Kan wu pi ti wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu na kup mbarǝm ju kan gip bom gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Gip gasi arni mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi yem wur tǝ ho'i wur usu gǝzǝnka. Bartu anni pi ti batisma na mbarǝm kǝ bom gǝs kup. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Tǝ laa'i na ghol mbatli domici tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yesu wi, ti na mǝn bom gǝs kup. Kan tǝ yem ga Bulus na Sila tǝ te wur gip bom gǝs tǝ bi wur fingal wu ci.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Nan bar tlowo, arni mǝn bom tloyi shirǝmi kar mǝn ɓaltǝn kǝ dlom gǝzǝn kar mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi na shirǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Za mbarǝm ju wu ndara!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moniyi wul Bulus'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn bom tloyi shirǝmi wule nan ki na Silawo dǝ za kǝn kǝ ndara. Kǝkǝno ki mani ndaratǝni. Mbǝrni zhǝlili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ama Bulus bali mǝn ɓaltǝn kǝ dlomi'e, &lt;&lt;Wu ɓo mi gip dlom mbarǝme kup na wu kum kǝ bi gǝmi da'a, kup na mǝn mir mǝn atl kǝ Roma ni, kan wu la mi gip bom kǝ moni. Kǝkǝno wu ndu wu za mi mǝ ndara muri ituwa? Ba pi untu da'a! Se wini wu ɗir na gamgǝzǝni, wu la mi tǝp mǝ ndara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Kan mir mǝn ɓaltǝn kǝ dlomi ba ri mǝn bom tloyi shirǝmi na shirǝm tu. Nan wu kum'e Bulus na Sila mǝn atl kǝ Romano, bǝrti nǝm wur naari. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Arni wu ri bi wur bi, wu ɗǝli wur ter gip bom kǝ moniyi kan wu lir wur den wu za bǝni. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Den kar kǝ ɗǝltǝn kǝ Bulus na Sila gip bom kǝ moniyiwo, arni wu pal rin bom dǝ Lidiyaka las tu wu zam mir ɓyari, wu ɓa'i wur bigule. Kan wu nde ndaratǝni.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Bulus pi wazu gip Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Nan Bulus na Sila kop gip bǝn kǝ Amfibolis na Apoloniyawo, arni wu mbubar Tasalonika, las tu bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gon ra gwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Kandatu Bulus ba kur pigwa, tǝ te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, den pǝt Asabar myakan tǝ den bali shirǝm nan wur gip shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Tǝ ceti wur gamka na yari wur tetla-tetla den ar nǝm Almasihu te yarka tǝ kum dli tǝ mǝshi, kan tǝ tli gip mǝshi mbarǝme. Bulus wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Yesu tu kan a pi in shirǝm den ti tu ni'e Almasihu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Jen gip mǝn Yahudayiwo shirǝmi nǝm wuri kan wu nde Bulus na Sila kari. Untu ni es jen na womti kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba bǝrti Yam gwa, na mǝtli jen kan mom wur nar gip bǝni gwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ama mǝn Yahudayi nǝm na ghuve, kan wu dom bes mbarǝm kǝ ba bar pǝte, wu dǝm mǝn me gam kǝ gǝzan bar na tli bǝn mbatli. Kan wu nde bom kǝ Yason gami wu den ngeni dǝ ɗǝli Bulus na Sila ter kari kar mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama nan wu zam wur dawo, arni wu dǝl Yason na mir ɓyar jen wu ri wur cina dǝ mǝn tloyi mbarǝm shirǝm kǝ bǝni. Wu tli yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm jin kan tli mbatl mbarǝm ko-ako gip atl kundǝrǝndlip ni jin kǝkǝn mbubar ɗewi, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />kan Yason ba shu wur gip bom gǝsi. Wi ni den nge kopi kulci kǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma, wu den wultǝn'e gun gon ra esi, muntu ba la ti bi'e Yesu gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Nan wu kum muntuwo, arni womti mbarǝmi na kiri kǝ bǝni palka ghiru-ghiru. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Kan wu kem Yason na nami kǝ ɓatli wurpi gon kǝ dǝ za wur wu ndara ra, kan wu za wur wu ndara.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus na Sila gip Biriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Nan gas ndawo, arni mir ɓyari kar Bulus na Sila su Biriyaka. Nan wu mbubaro, arni wu te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Mbarǝm kǝ Biriya ra na ɓuli mbatl man mbarǝm kǝ Tasalonika, domici wu nǝm shirǝm tu Bulus yari den Yesu gwa na ghol mbatl naari. Arni wu zhit gip Shirǝm kǝ Yam den kogonge pǝte, kǝ dǝ wu shin ko argon tu Bulus yari wuro untuni anra. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Mǝn Yahuda na womti ngǝsh wur den Yesu na kiri mǝtli jen kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan mom wur nar gwa na moni jen kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a na womti.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Nan mǝn Yahuda kan gip Tasalonika kum'e Bulus den pi wazu kǝ shirǝm kǝ Yesu gip Biriyawo, arni wu ma wu ndara barta. Wu co womti mbarǝmi kan wu tli bǝn mbatli. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Arni mir ɓyar tli dene bǝle-bǝle, kan wu la Bulus tǝp wu si ti bi bar ɓula'i, ama Sila na Timoti sa kaar gip Biriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Mbarǝm ju kan la Bulus tǝp te nan ti gip Atina kan wu nde paltǝn Biriya. Wu pal na shirǝm tu kan Bulus kari bar Sila na Timoti gwa den'e wu zho wur wu zam ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus pi wazu gip Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Nan Bulus ra gip bǝn Atina den ɓuti cwattǝn kǝ Sila na Timotiwo, ar ghun ti nar nan tǝ shin tat war ju mǝn Atina ba bote wur ko tǝp ako gip bǝni gwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kan tǝ bali shirǝm gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na mǝn Yahuda na mǝn bǝrti Yam kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. Tǝ pa bali shirǝm na mbarǝm gip bar pǝt se na gǝni na munju kan ra lasi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Me gam kǝ mǝn kulci kǝ Ipikuriya na mǝn kulci kǝ Sǝtokiya jen pare bali shirǝm nan ti. Jen gip wur ngen momi na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Unun mbarǝm mǝn ndu'i shirǝm den argon tu tǝ mom da'a tu den ndu'i yariwe?&gt;&gt; Jen ngapo wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ kum wule ti ni den shirǝm den mǝn dǝki yam jeni.&gt;&gt; Wu yari ni untu domici Bulus ni den pi wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Yesu na tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kan wu pǝn Bulus wu su nan ti kǝ ba me gam kǝ Aropagus, las tu wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mi mani momi unun kulci tu kǝ ɗiri mi ba yari gwaya? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Pel bar ni kǝ ɗiri mi, mǝ ndu mǝ mom unun ar ba kulci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Kup mbarǝm kǝ Atina na mǝn dǝki kan ba dǝm barta ba pa'ini wokoci gǝzǝn den pi argon da'a bom na yari ko kumi shirǝm den pel bari.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Bulus dlǝr cina dǝ me gam kǝ Aropagus tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Atina! A shin ko tǝp ako'e kǝn mbarǝm ni mǝn pǝni adini hoyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nan a kop gip bǝn gino a zhit tat war ju kǝ bote wur gwa. Den nǝm gip las juwo a zam rǝsh'e, KƏ YAM TU KAN MOM TI DAGWA. Kǝkǝno argon tu kǝ bote ti bat na momi gǝs gwa ni a shirǝm den ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Yam muntu kan pi atl kundǝrǝndlip na kup bar ju gipi gwa ni'e Babom kǝ yam na atli. Eso tǝ dǝm gip bom kǝ yam ju kan mbarǝm tu na am gǝzǝn gwa dak. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Tǝ pa ngen argon kan mi mani pi na am gǝmi, mǝ pi ti argon tu tǝ hol gwa dak, domici ti na gam gǝs ni ba bi mbarǝm kup rai na dli'i shukutǝni na ko unu esi. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Tǝp kar mbarǝm nǝm kan tǝ pi gwa ni tǝ pi mbarǝm kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip. Tǝ tlowi kan tǝ'i nde pi gǝzǝn den ko gigasi ni na ko ako ni wi dǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Yam pi ni untu kǝ dǝ mbarǝm ngen ti den ko wi zam ti wi ni wu kar am gwa, kup na tǝ dlyam na kogonge gip mi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;Domici gip mani pi bar gǝs ni mǝ dǝmi, mǝ mani pi bari, kan mǝ zam gǝs kǝ dǝmi ra.&gt; Kandatu mǝn kon gin jen wule, &lt;Mǝn mimir gǝs ni.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />&lt;&lt;Tun nan mǝn mimir kǝ Yamno, ba mǝ pǝn ni'e ti nǝra wule argon tu pi na zǝnariya ko azurpa ko tate, kan mbarǝm gip mani pi bar gǝs pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Terkawo, Yam bali gerka den holi momi bar ju, ama kǝkǝno tǝ kem dǝ mbarǝm kup ko-ako ci atl gam kar ti den warwat pitǝn gǝzǝn wu pal kar ti. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />A yari in ni muntu domici tǝ ne pǝt gon kan ti tloyi atl kundǝrǝndlip shirǝm kan ra dlat tǝp kar mbarǝm tu tǝ zǝzari gwa. Tǝ kem dǝ mbarǝm kup mom muntu tǝp kǝ ba tli mbarǝmi gip mǝshi mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Nan wu kum shirǝm den tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmo, arni jen pali ka bar kǝ gyatl gip nge, ama jen wule, &lt;&lt;Mi ndu mǝ kum ki ra den bar ju gas jen esi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Na yari untuwo, arni Bulus za ba me gami. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Mbarǝm jen pal mir mǝn kopi Bulus kan wu ngǝsh wur den Yesu. Gip wuro Diyonisiyus ra, nǝm gip ba me gam kǝ Aropagus, na nagǝr gon es mǝn sun Damaris, na mbarǝm jen esi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bulus mo na Bǝriskila na Akila gip Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Den kar kǝ muntuwo, arni Bulus za Atina tǝ ndara Korinti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Barta ni tǝ mo na mǝn Yahuda gon mǝn sun Akila, mǝn Pontus goni, muntu kan iza ni Italiya na nagǝr gǝs Bǝriskila gwa. Wu za ni Italiyaka nan Kaisar Kǝlaudiya kem den dǝ mbarǝm kǝ Yahuda kup za atl kǝ Roma gwa. Bulus ri kǝ shini gǝzǝni, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />domici tǝ mǝn pi tenti ni wule wi, arni tǝ dǝm tǝ pi mbap nan wuri. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Den kup pǝt Asabaro, Bulus ba bali shirǝm na mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, kǝ dǝ wu nǝm den'e Yesu ni'e Almasihu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Nan Sila na Timoti tli sur Makidoniyawo, arni Bulus bi wokoci gǝs kup den pi wazu, tǝ den yari mǝn Yahuda den Yesu ni'e Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ama nan mǝn Yahudayi nge shirǝm kǝ Bulus na yari ti mǝgǝn shirǝmo, arni tǝ bat kushka kǝ den tutul dli gǝska kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na dǝ bǝran gin sa den gam gini! Amo a ho gam gǝn wi. Pare'e kǝkǝni, aa pi ni wazu munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Kan Bulus ba za bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi tǝ ndara bom kǝ Titiyus Yustus, muntu mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba bote Yam gwa. Bom gǝs ni kosak na bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kǝrisbus, bari kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi, na kup munju kan gip bom gǝs ngǝsh wur den Babom Yesu. Mǝn Korinti na womti kan kum Buluso wu ngǝsh wur den Yesu, kan ba pi wur batisma.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Den pǝt gon gip gaso, Babom shirǝm na Bulus gip ruya, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, ci cina na shirǝmi, ba kǝ yon gi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Ami ra nan ki. Ko nǝm murgon ba mani ɗirtǝn tǝ pi dlan nan ki tǝ kumi'i dli da'a. Mbarǝm ra na womti gip bǝn kǝn kan baa pal mbarǝm gǝn gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Arni Bulus dǝm lasi kǝ sheti ghon nǝm na kyar mukka, tǝ den kulci wur shirǝm kǝ Yam den Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ama nan Galiyo dǝm gobna kǝ Akayawo, arni mǝn Yahuda mo gam wu nǝm Bulus kan wu ri ti bom tloyi shirǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝn den ndu'i tǝ kem mbarǝm gǝmi wu bote Yam bom na den tǝp tu kulci gǝmi yari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ama nan Bulus ba ri kǝ shirǝmo arni Galiyo wul mǝn Yahudayi'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn Yahuda, dǝ wule shirǝm gin tuwo den wani bar gon ni tǝ pi ko ceni doka kawo, da aa zam bar kǝ nǝmi gip shirǝm gin tu, a kum kǝne. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ama nan shirǝm ni den ga kalma na sunye na den kulci gino, pa'ini shirǝm tu kǝn na gam gini. Aa dǝm mǝn tloyi shirǝm den bar ju da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Arni tǝ kar wurka ter gip bom tloyi shirǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Arni kup wu bal wur den Sostanisu, bari kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudayi kan wu ɓo ti te bǝdlabǝn bom tloyi shirǝmika. Ama Galiyo pi wule tǝ shin ni da'a.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝriskila, Akila na Apolos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bulus dǝm gip Korinti kǝ wokoci goni. Kan tǝ za mir ɓyari tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ ndara gip atl kǝ Siriya, nan ti na Bǝriskila na Akila. Kapǝn tǝ ndarawo, tǝ fili gamka gip bǝn kǝ Kankǝriya, den kandatu mǝn Yahuda ba pigwa, kǝ nune pa'i pi argon tu tǝ wule ti pi gwa ituwi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wu mbubar gip bǝn kǝ Afisa, las tu Bulus za ga Bǝriskila na Akila gwa. Tǝ te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda kǝ bali shirǝm na mǝn Yahudayi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Nan wu lir ti kǝ dǝ tǝ dǝm ra nan wuro arni tǝ nge gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ama tǝ ndarawo tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Aa pal ra ɗir gas jen esi, Yam ni ndu gwa.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ za bǝn kǝ Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Nan tǝ mbubar Kaisariyawo, arni tǝ su Urushalima tǝ shirmi domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kan tǝ su gip bǝn Antakiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Nan tǝ ɓom dǝmi gip bǝn Antakiyawo, arni Bulus ndara kan tǝ pi ta kopi las gip atl kǝ Galatiya na kǝ Pirijiya, tǝ den ndǝri la'i mbatl kǝ mir mǝn kopi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Wokoci tawo mǝn Yahuda gon ra mǝn sun Apolos, mǝn Alekzandǝriya, tǝ ɗir Afisa. Mbarǝm ni kan kulci bar nar gwa, na momi shirǝm kǝ Yam hoyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Tǝ zam kulci den tǝp kǝ Babom Yesu, kan tǝ kulci mbarǝm hoyi den Yesu kandatu muntu kan mom'e argon tu tǝ yariwo hoyi ni gwa. Ama batisma kǝ Yohana ni katl tǝ momi. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Tǝ pare shirǝm bat na bǝrti gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Ama nan Bǝriskila na Akila kum tiwo, wu la ti bi rin bom da wurka kan wu yari tǝ ra hoyi den tǝp kǝ Yami.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Nan Apolos pǝn ti te gip atl kǝ Akayawo, arni mir ɓyar gip Afisa ɓa'i ti bigul den tǝ ndara, kan wu rǝshi mir mǝn kopi kan gip Akaya gwa tǝlankuri, na liri gǝzǝn den wu nǝm ti na am rop-rop. Nan tǝ mbubaro, tǝ pi bar ju baa gode wur'e ti bar mǝn ne am ra ni kar munju kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu gwa tǝp kǝ ba zo mbatl kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Tǝ bali shirǝm nar na mǝn Yahuda cina dǝ mbarǝme, na yari wur dyatlǝm gip shirǝm kǝ Yam den Yesu ni'e Almasihu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bulus gip Afisa den ritǝn kǝ wazu gǝs kǝ myakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Nan Apolos ra gip Korintiwo, arni Bulus kop gip dlom atli tǝ mbubar Afisa. Barta ni tǝ zam mǝn kopi jeni, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />kan tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ nǝm Ruhu kǝ Yam wokoci tu kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Yesu gwaya?&gt;&gt; Arni wu nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;O'o, mǝ taɓe kumi den'e Ruhu kǝ Yam gon ra da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Kan Bulus ba ngen momi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Untuno, unu batisma ni pi ine?&gt;&gt; Kan wu bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Batisma kǝ Yohana ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bulus wule, &lt;&lt;Batisma kǝ Yohanawo kǝ munju kan bali kar warwat pitǝn gǝzǝn gwani. Tǝ yari mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila den wu ngǝsh wur den Yesu kan ba ɗir den kar gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Nan wu kum muntuwo, arni pi wur batisma gip sun kǝ Babom Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bulus ne am den wuro, arni Ruhu kǝ Yam sur den wuri, kan wu shirǝm na dǝki bi jeni, wu den yari shirǝm tu kan Yam bi wur kǝ dǝ wu yari gwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bar kǝ mbarǝm kutl-cet rop ni kup gǝzǝni.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kano Bulus ba te gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda tǝ pi wazu bat na bǝrti kǝ kyar myakan. Tǝ bali shirǝm nan wur den dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝme na ndu'i tǝ dǝl wuri. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ama jen gip wur na lati gami kan wu nge ngǝshtǝn den Yesu ka. Cina dǝ mbarǝm kup arni wu yari mǝgǝn shirǝm den tǝp kǝ Yesu. Arni Bulus za wuri. Tǝ ndara na mǝn kopiyi kan tǝ pi ta bali shirǝm nan wur den kogonge pǝt gip bar kushi kan Tiranus ba kulci mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Untuni tǝ ci cina nari kǝ sheti ghon rop, ar ba kem kup mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba dǝm gip atl kǝ Asiya gwa ba kum shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mimir mir moni kǝ Siva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Yam pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am bom na munju kan ba kur shin gwa tǝp kar Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Ba kur yem tutul sari bangani na ga lulur la'i kǝ pi mbap gǝs dǝ ri mǝn kumi dli, kan dǝ kumi dli gǝzǝn pa'i. Dun itǝr ma wu ɗǝl gip mbarǝm ka.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wokoci tawo mǝn Yahuda jen ra kan ba kop las na ɗǝli dun itǝr ter gip mbarǝm ka ra. Wu ndu wu pi ta nǝmi sun kǝ Yesu kǝ ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme, arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Gip sun kǝ Babom Yesu, muntu Bulus ba pi wazu gǝs gwa, a wul ki'e kǝ ɗǝl teri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Gip wuro mir moni jen nyingi kǝ Siva, bari kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa kǝ mǝn Yahuda, den pi untu. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Gasi gono wu ndu wu pi untu, arni dun itǝri nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom Yesu, kan a pal a mom Bulus, ama kǝn ga woni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Arni mbarǝm mǝn dun itǝri zop wur, tǝ tli nan wuri. Tǝ bi wur ish na ɓe kan wu yem na asǝm wu za gip bomi gǝs koni na bǝran bǝtǝ-bǝtǝ.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Nan mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ba dǝm gip Afisa kum shirǝm tuwo, bǝrti nǝm wur naari. Kan sun kǝ Babom Yesu ba zam ɗǝɗatǝn hoyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Na womti gip munju kan ngǝsh wur den Yesu ɗir gip dlom mbarǝme, kan wu yari warwat pitǝn gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Na womti kǝ munju kan pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn far ɗiri tǝlankur gǝzǝn kǝ ba lasi nǝm kan wu kerika den ger kǝ mbarǝm kup. Nan wu dom wurpi kǝ kup tǝlankuriwo, an ri zangu hauya rop na tatli (50,000) kǝ azurpa. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Tǝp untuni shirǝm kǝ Babom Yesu ri na dlyami kan ba nar gip ndǝrtǝn gǝsi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Den kaar kǝ pitǝn tuwo, Bulus pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs den tǝ su Urushalima, tǝ kop gip Makidoniya na Akaya. Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Den kaar kǝ sutǝn bartawo aa pa te Roma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kan tǝ kar mir mǝn ne ti am ra mbarǝm rop, Timoti na Erastus Makidoniya, ama ti ngapo kan tǝ mur na womti gip atl kǝ Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tli mbatl gip Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Wokoci tani bar tli mbatl ra gip Afisa gip nge Tǝp kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Mǝn desi gǝlla azurpa gon mǝn sun Dimitǝris des mir bom kǝ mutli-yam Artimis na azurpa kandatu bariyi ra gip bom gǝs gwa. Muntu ba ɗiri ti na nami mǝn pi mbapi wurpi na naari. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Tǝ dom wur kǝ ba las nǝm, na jen es munju ba pi mbap kan wule gwazin gwa. Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir moni, kǝ mom'e mǝ zam wurpi nar den mbap kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Kǝn den shini na kumi kandatu mbarǝm tu Bulus tla gam kan tǝ jili mbarǝm na womti ɗe gip Afisa na ko-ako gip atl kǝ Asiya gwa. Tǝ wule yam ju kan mbarǝm pi na amo yam ni da'a ko njem. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Bar kǝ tli mbatliwo ar ni'e ba'e tǝp kǝ zami wurpi gǝmi ni katl baa zam wani sun da'a, ama bom kǝ naari mutli-yam Artimis ma baa dǝm den bi argon ni da'a. Mutli-yami na gam gǝsi, muntu kan kup mbarǝm kǝ Asiya ba bote ti na atl kundǝrǝndlip, ba hol zami nartǝn den ger kǝ mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Nan wu kum shirǝm tuwo, lo ci wuri kan wu nǝm la'i yar na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Naari ni Artimis kǝ Afisa ra!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />An ri kǝtǝgon da'a, arni bǝni palka ghiru-ghiru. Mbarǝm kǝ bǝni nǝm Gayus na Aristarkus, berǝm ɓomi asǝm kǝ Bulus kan tli tor Makidoniya gwa, kan wu zho wur biyi nǝm wu ne gam las tu mbarǝm kǝ bǝni ba dom wur gwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus ndu tǝ ri cina dǝ womti mbarǝmi, ama mǝn kopi za ti da'a. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Jen gip mǝn bǝni ma, mir berǝm kǝ Bulus, kari ti bar na shirǝm wu den liri gǝs den ba dǝ tǝ te las tu mbarǝm dom wuri gwa da'a.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Domtǝni pika ghiru-ghiru, jen den la'i yar na yari mǝnkǝni, kan jen ngapo mǝnta. Na womti gǝzǝn ma wu mom utun dom wur lasi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Mǝn Yahudayi dǝl Alekzanda te cinaka, kan jen gip womti mbarǝmi ba la yar den argon tu tǝ pi gwa. Tǝ pi am den dǝ yoni, kan tǝ pare shirǝm ho'i gam gǝs cina dǝ mbarǝme. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ama nan wu momka'e ti mǝn Yahudano, arni wu wom bar biyi nǝm kǝ bar kǝ awa rop wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Naari ni Artimis kǝ Afisa ra!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Mǝn yari argon tu kan baa pi gip bǝni tla gam kǝ womti mbarǝmi kan wu yoni. Arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ Afisa, mbarǝm kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip mom'e bǝn kǝ Afisa ni'e mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ Artimis mǝn nartǝni, na tat mǝn nartǝn gǝsi, muntu kan nda sur yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ra'untuwo, tun nan murgon baa mani nge munju dawo, te ni mbatl kaarka, ba kǝ pǝni bar na zhotǝn da'a. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Kǝ ɗiri mbarǝm jǝn ɗe, kup na wu pini mur kǝ bar mǝn tsarki jen gip bom kǝ yam ko yari mǝgǝn shirǝm den mutli-yam gǝmi da'a.<verse eid="ACT 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />&lt;&lt;Dimitǝris na mǝn pi mbap kan nǝm na gwas ni ra na shirǝm den murgono, bom tloyi shirǝm ju na mǝn tloyi shirǝm lasi. Wi mani ri shirǝm gǝzǝn barta. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Argon ni ra es kan kǝ ndu ɗiriwo, baa mani pa'i shirǝmi gip me gam kǝ mir mǝn atl kan yerda na doka gwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kandatu ar rawo, mǝn ra gip tli mbatl kǝ dǝ nǝm mi den mǝ tli mbatl bǝn den argon tu pi sekǝn gwa. Den muntuwo mi mani yari argon tu kan pi gwa da'a, tun nan gǝs kǝ pitǝn gǝs ra dagwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo, arni tǝ wul mbarǝm kan dom wur gwa'e wu ndara.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bulus gip Makidoniya na Hellas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Nan mbatl murwo, kan Bulus ba kar bar den mǝn kopi, den kaar kǝ pi wur shirǝm ɓa'i bigule. Arni tǝ pali wur bi tǝ ndara Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Tǝ kop gip atli tǝ den ta yari shirǝm ɓa'i bigul mǝn kopi, har tǝ mbubar Akaya gip atl kǝ Hellas, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />las tu tǝ dǝm kǝ kyar myakan gwa. Mǝn Yahuda gudlumi wu pi ti mǝgǝn pitǝn nan tǝ den bi totǝn gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ ndara Siriya gwa, arni tǝ pǝn gip mbatl gǝs tǝ kop tǝp gip Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Munju kan den ɓomi asǝm nan ti gwa ni'e ga Supataras nya Pirus mǝn Biriya, na Aristarkus, na Sikundus mǝn Tasalonika, Gayus mǝn Darba, na Timoti, na Tikikus na Tǝrofimus mǝn atl kǝ Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Mbarǝm ju ci cina kan wu ɓut mi gip Tǝrowasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ama mǝ za Filibbi mǝ jikat mal den kar kǝ Nyel Jikat Bǝdlabǝni, arni muri nantam den kariwo kan mǝ zam wur gip Tǝrowasa, las tu mǝ dǝm kǝ muri nyingi gwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tli Yutikus gip mǝshi mbarǝm gip bǝn Tǝrowasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Den pǝt Asabar kǝ sito mǝ dom mi las nǝm kǝ dǝ mǝ ci fingal na fingal kǝ Babomi. Bulus shirǝm na mbarǝme, domici tǝ ndu ndaratǝn bar ni tlo gwa, tǝ pi ta shirǝm ar bari dlom gasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Utu pitila ra na womti den ci gip kushi kǝ to yami ka, las tu mǝ dom mi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Njon den tagawo nye mbarǝm gon ra mǝn sun Yutikus, ger umur nǝm ti kan umur ba pǝn tika nan Bulus den ta shirǝm gwa. Nan tǝ den umur to den ɓiti kushi kǝ myakan to yami kawo, arni tǝ nda sur atl kan ba pǝn ti mǝshi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Bulus ɗǝl sur atl tǝ ngus kar nyayi, tǝ la am den ti, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba dǝ ar ghun kǝn ni da'a. Tǝ ra na rai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kan tǝ pal to kushi kǝ yamiyi ka tǝ njetǝl bǝrǝdi tǝ bi mbarǝm wu ci. Den kar kǝ tlyari shirǝm kǝ Bulus bari tlotǝn kǝ baro, arni tǝ ndara. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Mbarǝm kan lasi gwa pǝn nye mbarǝmi wu ri ti bom na rai, kan kup wu shem dene hoyi.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus pali bi kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn Kopi kǝ Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Mǝ nda cina mǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male kan mǝ ndara bǝn kǝ Asos, las tu mǝ ri kǝ pǝni Bulus gwa. Untu ni tǝ wule mǝ pi domici ti ndara ni den asǝme. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Nan tǝ zam mi gip Asoswo, arni mǝ pǝn ti gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali mǝ ndara gip bǝn kǝ Mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Bar tlowo arni mǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan mǝ ne gam den bishidi bǝn kǝ Kiyos. Zut bar tlowo, arni mǝ ndara kan mǝ te den bishidi bǝn kǝ Samos. Den zut pǝto kan mǝ mbubar gip bǝn kǝ Militus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bulus pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs kǝ dǝ tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ bi kaar bǝn kǝ Afisa den tǝ ndu tǝ dǝm gip atl kǝ Asiya da'a. Ti ni den zhotǝn tǝ mbubar Urushalima, arni ba piwo, tǝ mbubar wokoci kǝ nyel Pentikos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Nan Bulus ra gip Milituso, arni tǝ kar bar den dǝ kiri mǝn cina kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi kǝ gip bǝn Afisa zam ti. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Nan wu mbubar kar tiwo, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom kandatu a pi dǝmi gǝn nan ami ra nan kǝne, pare den gas tu kan a cwat ɗe gip atl kǝ Asiya gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />A bote Babom na pali gam gǝn ami argon ni da'a na lune, kup na a tla godetǝn nar den bar ju mǝn Yahuda gudlumi den wi pim gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Kǝ mom'e a za argon kaar gip wazu gǝn kan baa ne in am ra gwa da'a ama a kulci in gip dlom mbarǝme na kopi bom bomi. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />A yari kup mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a den ar nǝm wur te yarka wu pal kar Yam gip ci atl gami, dǝ wu ngǝsh wur den Babom gǝmi Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Artu kǝkǝno, na kopi kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yami, a su ni Urushalima. A mom unun ba zamǝn suka da'a. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Argon tu a momwo ar ni'e, gip kogonge bǝno Ruhu kǝ Yam dǝlim kǝm den ɓaltǝn gip bom kǝ moni na kumi dli den ɓuti gǝni. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Kup na untu, amo a pǝn dǝmi gǝn na rai den bi argon ni karǝm da'a, kan ri kǝ dǝ a pa'i totǝn kǝ zami bar kǝ dǝ a pa'i mbap tu kan Babom Yesu bim gwa. Mbap yari Zo Shirǝm den zo mbatl kǝ Yami.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno a mom'e ko nǝm ra gip kǝn kan a kop na pi wazu den dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝm kan baa'i shin ger gǝn es gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ra'untuwo, a yari in sekǝn den a ɗǝlka gip bǝran kǝ mbarǝm kup wi. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Na ho bi, a hol yari in kup bar ju kan Yam ba ndu kǝ mom gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ra untuwo, neni ger den pitǝn gini na mbarǝm ju kan Ruhu kǝ Yam bi in kǝ ne ger den wur gwa. Dǝm ni mǝn ne ger den domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi Yami, muntu kan tǝ pali gwas tǝp kar bǝran kǝ nya gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />A mom'e ami ni a ndarawo, mǝn kulci kǝ lar wule mamal ba ɗir gip dlom gini, kano wi za mǝn kopiyi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Jen gip kǝn ma ba tlyam na ceni lar kǝ zhimbǝl argon tu kan untun anra gwa kǝ dǝ wu dom mir mǝn kulci kar wuri. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Untuwo, dǝm ni gǝɗin! Mom ni'e a za dǝli kǝm kogonge gip kǝn da'a kǝ sheti ghon myakan, na kumi dli nar gip pi in wazu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno a taa kǝn am dǝ Yami na shirǝm kǝ zo mbatl gǝsi. Shirǝm tu kan baa kem kǝn kǝ nartǝn kan tǝ bi in ho bar tu kan gegin ni, kan Yam ba bi mbarǝm gǝs kup gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />A ndu dǝ azurpa ko zǝnariya ko tutul dli kǝ ko nǝm gin ar dǝm gwan da'a. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kǝn na gam gin mom den a pi mbap na am gǝn kǝn kǝ zami kup bar ju ami na ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝn ba ndu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Gip kup argon tu a piwo, a nune in wi den na pi mbap hoyiwo ar nǝm mi te yarka mi ne am munju kan ndǝr dagwa. Mǝ tune ni shirǝm tu Babom Yesu na gam gǝs yari gwa'e, &lt;Mbarǝm ba zam nartǝn wokoci tu tǝ bi bar mbarǝm gwa ar man wokoci tu tǝ nǝm kar murgon gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo arni tǝ ngus den gam ghurǝm na kup gǝzǝni kan tǝ shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Kup gǝzǝn kul nan wu den nǝmi gǝs ɗir gip dlom kǝ pali ti bi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Argon tu ɗiri wur dun mbatl naaro ar ni'e shirǝm tu tǝ yari gwa den'e wi'i shin ti da'a. Kan wu la ti tǝp su kar kungǝlǝn jikat mali ka.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Sitǝn kǝ Bulus Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Nan mǝ pali wur biwo, arni mǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal mǝ bǝtl gam atl kǝ Kos kan te dlom malka gwa. Bar tlowo kan mǝ ndara bǝn kǝ Rodusa kan mǝ za barta mǝ ne gam bǝn kǝ Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Mǝ zam kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan ba ri kǝ jikat mal nari dǝ te atl kǝ Finiks gwa, arni mǝ to gipi mǝ ndara. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nan mǝ mbubar las gon kan mǝ mani shini Saipǝroso, kan mǝ ne gam kudu na bǝni mǝ ndara Siriya. Mǝ te den bishidi kǝ Taya mǝ dlǝri, las tu ba ri kǝ shu'i gosgam kǝ gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal gǝmi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Mǝ zam mǝn kopi kǝ lasi kan mǝ dǝm nan wur kǝ muri nyingi. Tǝp kar Ruhu kǝ Yamo arni wu lir Bulus den ba dǝ tǝ su Urushalima da'a. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ama nan muri ju mǝ yem den mi pi lasi pawo, arni mǝ za wur kan mǝ ci cina na ɓomi asǝm gǝmi. Kup mir mǝn kopiyi, mǝtli gǝzǝn na mimir gǝzǝn la mi tǝp wu ɗǝli mi gip bǝn wu si mi bi ɓula'i. Arni mǝ ngus den gam ghurǝm gǝmi mǝ shirǝm na Yam kan mǝ pali bi ɓyari. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Den kar kǝ pali bi na ɓyaro, arni mǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, wu ngapo kan wu pal gǝzǝn bomi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Mǝ ci cina na ɓomi asǝm gǝmi, mǝ za Taya mǝ mbubar Tolimayis, las tu mǝ shirmi mir ɓyar kan mǝ dǝm nan wur kǝ nde pǝt nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Bar tlowo arni mǝ ndara, mǝ mbubar Kaisariya kan mǝ dǝm gip bom kǝ Filibus mǝn pi wazu kǝ Zo Shirǝmi, nǝm ni gip mbarǝm nyingi ja.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nǝm gip nyingi ju kan zǝzari kǝ ne ger den bi fingal gip Urushalima gwa. Shin gip Tǝlankur Mbap kǝ Mir Mǝn Kartǝne 6.1-6.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Tǝ ra na mimir mir mǝtli wupse kan gudlumi wu dagwa. Kogonge gip wur ba mani yari argon tu Ruhu kǝ Yam ɓuli wur ger wu shin gwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Nan mǝn ra barta kǝ muri na womtiwo, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gon mǝn sun Agabus tli sur Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Tǝ sur kar miwo, arni tǝ pǝtl zap ɓali tutul tli kǝ Bulus kan tǝ ɓal asǝm na am gǝs nari. Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ruhu kǝ Yam wule, &lt;Untuni mǝn Yahuda kǝ gip Urushalima ba ɓal mǝn zap ɓali tutul tli kǝni kan wu la ti am dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Nan mǝ kum muntuwo, arni min na mbarǝm kan lasi gwa lir Bulus den ba dǝ tǝ to Urushalima da'a. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kan Bulus ba nǝmi mi'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ kuli, kǝ dǝ kǝ cenim mbatl kaya? A ɓa mbatl dlom gamwi ba'e dǝ ɓalǝm katl da'a, ama kǝ dǝ a mǝsh gip Urushalima den bi sun kǝ Babom Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nan mǝ mani tle gam gǝs dawo, arni mǝ za ti kan mǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na dǝ ndu'i kǝ Babom ndol untuyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Den kar kǝ muntuwo, arni mǝ dlǝri mbatl kǝ ndaratǝn Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Jen gip mǝn kopi kan tli ter Kaisariya kop mi kari, kan ba ri mi bom kǝ mbarǝm gon mǝn sun'e Mǝnason, las tu mǝ dǝm gwa. Tǝ mbarǝm kǝ Saipǝros kan nǝm gip mǝn kopi kǝ parko gwani.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Mbubar Urushalima wi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nan mǝ mbubar gip Urushalimawo, mir ɓyar nǝm mi na am rop-rop. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Bar tlowo arni Bulus na nami gǝmi ri kǝ shini Yakubu, kup kiri mǝn cina kǝ mǝn kopi ra lasi. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bulus shirmi wur kan tǝ yari wur ndekes bar ju kan Yam pi munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a gip mbap gǝs gwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Nan wu pa'i kumi gǝso, arni wu ɗǝɗa Yami. Kan wu wul Bulus'e, &lt;&lt;Erǝmi, ɓa shin kandatu mǝn Yahuda na womti ngǝsh wur den Yesu gwa, kup gǝzǝn ngapo mǝn bi gam gip kopi kulci kǝ Musa ni. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Yari wur wi den'e kǝ kulci kup mǝn Yahuda kan ba dǝm gip munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a den wu za kopi kulci kǝ Musa ka, na yari wur den ba dǝ wu sǝr mimir gǝzǝn ko wu kop bar ju mǝn kan mǝn Yahuda ni ba kop gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Unun mi piwe? Wi kum den'e kǝ mbǝra wi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ra untuwo pi argon tu mi yari'i gwa. Mbarǝm wupse ra ɗe nan mi kan pǝni gam gǝzǝn den argon tu wi pi Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ri na mbarǝm ju. Mo gam nan wur gip pi bar ju kan ba pi kǝ pali mbarǝm dlǝran cina dǝ Yam gwa. Ɓatl kup argon tu ar nǝm gwa kǝ dǝ fili wur gamka. Na untuni mbarǝm kup ba mom'e bar ju ba yari den kiwo larni, ama den ki na gamgi den dǝmi na kopi kulci kǝ Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Den bi kǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan ngǝsh wur den Yamo, mǝ rǝshi wur tǝlankur wi den argon tu mǝ ne bi dene gwa'e ba wu ci argon tu ta'i tat ware, ko tlu na mbǝrani gipi, ko tlu kǝ dabba tu kan ceni tini yarka gwa, na dǝ ba wu la gam gǝzǝn gip muri na mǝtli na moni kari da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Bar tlowo arni Bulus yem mbarǝm ju kan ba pi wur bar ju kan ba pi kǝ pali mbarǝm dlǝran cina dǝ Yam gwa kup nan ti. Kano tǝ te gip bom kǝ Yami kǝ dǝ yari gip mbarǝm den muri ju ba pǝn kǝ pali mbarǝm dlǝran cina dǝ Yami na mboshi Yam dabba den am kǝ kogonge gip wur gwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝm Bulus gip Bom kǝ Yam gip Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Nan muri nyingiyi ba ri kǝ patǝno, arni mǝn Yahuda jen kan tli tor gip atl kǝ Asiya gwa ba shin Bulus gip Bom kǝ Yami. Wu tli mbatl kǝ womti mbarǝmi kan wu nǝm ti <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />wu den la'i yar na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila, ne mǝni amra! Mbarǝm kǝn ni ba kulci mbarǝm ko-ako na mǝgǝn shirǝm den mbarǝm gǝmi, na kulci kǝ Musa, na Bom kǝ Yam kǝni. Untu dama, tǝ ɗir na mbarǝm jen kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a gip Bom kǝ Yami kan ba li las kǝnka kan dlǝran gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Wu yari ni muntu domici wu shin Tǝrofimus mǝn Afisa na Bulus gip bǝni, arni wu pǝn'e Bulus te ni nan ti gip Bom kǝ Yami.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Arni kup gip bǝni pika ghiru-ghiru, kan mbarǝm ko tǝp ako ba ɗǝl ɗir na kǝtǝre. Wu nǝm Bulus, wu dǝl ti ter kaar Bom kǝ Yami, kan wu zho wur wu le bǝdlabǝni ka kup. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nan wu den ndu'i ri gǝs ekawo, arni komanda kǝ mǝn bi-utu kǝ Roma zam na kumi shirǝmika den'e bǝn Urushalima kup ra gip tli mbatli. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Tǝ dǝm da'a arni komandiyi yem mir kiri kǝ mǝn bi-utu na mǝn bi-utu jen kan wu zho wur su kar womti mbarǝmika. Nan mǝn tli bǝn mbatli shin komandayi na mǝn bi-utu gǝso, arni wu za ɓe Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Komandayi ri kar Bulus tǝ nǝm ti, kan tǝ bi bi'e dǝ ɓal tǝka na sarsari rop. Kan tǝ ngen momi ko ti woni kan ununu tǝ pi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Jen gip womti mbarǝmi den yari mǝnkǝni, jen ngapo argon esi. Muntu kem komandayi mani momi gam kǝ shirǝmi da'a nan mbatl tli kawi gwa. Arni tǝ wule dǝ te na Bulus las tu mǝn bi-utuyi ba dǝm gwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Nan Bulus ne asǝm den ba ne asǝm kǝ totǝn gip kushiyiwo, arni mǝn tli bǝn mbatli tli den Bulus na naari kan mǝn bi-utuyi ba pǝn tǝka. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Womti mbarǝm kan nde wur kar den la'i yar na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Pi nǝka nan ti!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus shirǝm na womti mbarǝmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Nan mǝn bi-utuyi ba ri kǝ tetǝn las tu mǝn bi-utuyi ba dǝm na Buluso, arni ti ngen momi kar komandayi'e, &lt;&lt;Aa mani shirǝm nan ki ya?&gt;&gt; Komandayi nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mani ni bi kǝ mǝn Hellasa? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ki ni'e mǝn Masar tu kan wokoci gon terka tli gobnati gam na dlan kan kǝ yem mbarǝm zangu wupse (4,000) mǝn dlan na gobnati kan ba ndara gip lǝp gwa diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Bulus nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;O'o, amo mǝn Yahuda ni, gǝri kǝ Tarsus gip Kilikiya, nye mǝn atl kǝ bar ho bǝn ni. Kustu, za'ǝm a shirǝm na mbarǝm ju.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Nan komandayi bi ti biwo, arni Bulus dlǝr to den ba ne asǝm kǝ totǝn gip kushi kǝ yamika kan tǝ pi am womti mbarǝmi den wu yoni. Nan wu sa shotwo, arni tǝ shirǝm na mbarǝm na bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Mir ɓyar mǝn Yahuda na ga ba gǝmi, kum ni shirǝm ho'i gam gǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Nan wu kum ti den shirǝm na bi gǝzǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, arni wu sa shot ra. Kano Bulus ba wule, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Ami mǝn Yahuda ni, gǝrǝm ni gip Tarsus kǝ gip atl kǝ Kilikiya ama a nar ni gip bǝn kǝni. Cina dǝ Gamaliyel ni a zam kulci den kopi kulci kǝ ga ba gǝmi asǝm na gǝs gip bi Yam gam gǝn wule kandatu kup gin kan ra ɗe sekǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />A kumi dli mǝn kopi Tǝp kǝ Yesu kǝn na nǝmi mǝtli na moni kup a kem dǝ la wur gip bom kǝ moni na ɓali. Jen gip wur mǝshka. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami na kup munju kan gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda mom muntu. Kar wur ni a nǝm tǝlankur kan rǝshi mir ɓyar mǝn Yahuda kan gip Dimashka gwa. A te barta kǝ dǝ a nǝm mbarǝm ju a ter nan wur Urushalima na ɓali kǝ dǝ hukunte wuri.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus yari kandatu tǝ pal mǝn kopi Yesu gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ dlom pǝte, nan a mbi kosak na Dimashkawo, arni pǝlǝt bar cirtǝn gon ɗǝl sur yam kan ba cir karǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Arni a nda atlka kan a kum yar gon ba wulǝm'e, &lt;Shawulu, Shawulu! Unun kem kǝ kumim dli rawu?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Arni a ngen momi kar ti a wule, &lt;Ki ni'e wowe, Babomi?&gt; Kan tǝ balim'e, &lt;Ami ni'e Yesu kǝ Nazarat, muntu kan kǝ kumi ti dli gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Mbarǝm ju kan den ɓomi asǝm namǝn shin cirtǝni, ama wu mani momi yar kǝ mǝn shirǝm na mǝni da'a.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />&lt;&lt;Kan a ngen momi kar ti a wule, &lt;Ununu a piwe, Babomi?&gt; Arni Babom Yesu wulǝm'e, &lt;Tlyam kǝ te gip bǝn Dimashka. Barta ni ba yari'i bar ju kup kan nǝm ki te yerka kǝ pi gwa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Mir mǝn ɓomi asǝm na mǝn nǝmim am wu tem gip Dimashka, domici bar cirtǝni kem a'i mani shini bar da'a.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt;Mbarǝm gon mǝn sun'e Hananiya ɗir kǝ shini gǝni. Mbarǝm mǝn bi gam gip kopi kulci kǝ Musa ni kan kup mǝn Yahuda kan gip Dimashka ba shin nartǝn gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Tǝ dlǝr markǝm da'ǝm kan tǝ wule, &lt;Erǝm Shawulu, zam mani shini bar gi!&gt; Nǝm wokoci ta ni mani shini bar gǝn pali kan a shin ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;Kan tǝ wule, &lt;Yam kǝ ga ba gǝmi ni zǝzar ki kǝ dǝ kǝ mom argon tu tǝ ndu gwa, kan kǝ shin mǝn pi argon tu Yam ba ndu gwa, kǝ pa kum shirǝm kǝ bi gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ki dǝm mǝn yari mbarǝm kup shirǝm den ti kǝ argon tu kǝ shin kǝ pa kum gwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Kǝkǝno, unun kǝ ɓutwu? Tlyami, dǝ pi'i batisma kǝ zam dǝ pǝni'i warwat pitǝn gika, tǝp kǝ ba la'i bi den sun gǝsi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />&lt;&lt;Nan a pal su Urushalimaka den shirǝm na Yam gip Bom kǝ Yamo, a shin ruya. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />A shin Babom den shirǝm na wuli gǝn'e, &lt;Za Urushalima na zhotǝne, domici wi nǝm argon tu kǝ yari demǝn gwa da'a.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />&lt;&lt;Arni a nǝmi ti'e, &lt;Babomi, mbarǝm ju mom'e a kop bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na nǝm-nǝm na la'i gǝzǝn gip bom kǝ moni na ɓe munju kan ngǝsh wur den ki gwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Wokoci tu kan ri mǝn yari shirǝm gi Istipanus ekawo, ami ra lasi gip kopi kaari na ne ger den tutul dli kǝ munju kan den ri gǝs eka gwa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Kano tǝ wulǝm'e, &lt;Mbǝri, aa kar ki na dlyami kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Nye Mǝn Atl kǝ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Womti mbarǝmi ne kǝm den shirǝm kǝ Bulus har tǝ yari muntu. Kan wu tli na la'i yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ pika nan ti! Tǝ ndar ci cina na dǝmi da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Nan wu den la'i yaro, arni wu tus lulur gǝzǝn wu byali ka kan wu wi atl to yamka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tusi lulur gǝzǝnka na wi atl to yamkawo kǝ wu gode'e lo ci wur nar ni.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Komanda kǝ Romayi kem dǝ ter na Bulus gip las tu mǝn bi-utuyi ba dǝm gwa. Tǝ kem wu ɓo Bulus kǝ dǝ tǝ mom unun kem mbarǝm ba la'i ti yar gam untu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Nan wu ɓal Bulus ba ri kǝ ɓe gǝso, arni tǝ wul bar mǝn bi-utu kan dlor lasi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Doka bi'i bi den kǝ ɓo nye mǝn atl kǝ Roma tu kan zam ti na wani pitǝn gon gwa da'aya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Nan bar mǝn bi-utuyi kum untuwo, arni tǝ ri kar komandayi tǝ yari ti, kan tǝ ngen momi kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ri kǝ piwu? Mbarǝm tu capo nye mǝn atl kǝ Roma ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kan komandayi ba ri kar Bulus tǝ ngen momi kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, ki nye mǝn atl kǝ Roma na?&gt;&gt; Bulus bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aan, untuni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Kan komandayi ba wule, &lt;&lt;Na ɓatli wurpi na naari ni kan a dǝm nye mǝn atli.&gt;&gt; Bulus bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ama amo tǝp kǝ ba gǝri ni a dǝm nye mǝn atli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Munju kan far ba ri kǝ gadlǝr Bulus gip shirǝm na kumi untuwo arni wu dǝlka na kari. Komandayi na gam gǝs ma ar ghun ti domici tǝ ɓal Bulus, nye mǝn atl kǝ Roma na sarsari.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Komandayi den ndu'i tǝ mom ununu Bulus pi kan mǝn Yahudayi ba ɗir ti cina dǝ mǝn bǝni. Bar tlowo arni tǝ bi bi den dǝ kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kup kan gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayi dom wur cina da ti. Kan tǝ pǝtl Bulus tǝ kem tǝ dlǝr cina da wuri.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bulus wi ger domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayi, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, mbatl gǝn kemǝn kǝ ngeni momi kandatu a dǝm cina dǝ Yam gip kup dǝmi gǝn da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Den yari muntu ni Hananiya, bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam kem munju kan dlor kosak na Bulus gwa wu ɓo bi gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Arni Bulus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yam ba ɓo'i, ki mǝn se mbarǝme! Kǝ dǝm ɗe kǝ tloyi shirǝm mbarǝm den tǝp kǝ doka, ama kǝ cen doka ka na kemi dǝ ɓo mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Arni munju kan ra kosak na Bulus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ pi mǝgǝn shirǝm bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Bulus nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, a mom den ti ni'e bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwada'a, domici shirǝm kǝ Yam wule, &lt;Ba kǝ yari wani shirǝm den bari kǝ bǝn gin da'a.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nan Bulus momka'e jen gip domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayiwo wini gip me gam kǝ mǝn Sadukiya, kan jen ngapo wini gip me gam kǝ mǝn Parisewo, arni tǝ tli yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, ami ma Ba mǝn Parise ni, nya Ba mǝn Parise. Ɗirǝm cina kǝ dǝ kumǝn den bi la'i mbatl gǝn den Yam baa tli mǝshi mbarǝm na rai esi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nan wu kum untuwo, arni mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Pariseyi na mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Sadukiya nǝm pali shirǝm musu gip dlom dawuri. Arni wu tatlka bomi rop. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Me gam kǝ mǝn Sadukiya ba nge den mǝshi mbarǝm ba tli na rai esi, kan mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ko ga dun itǝr ra da'a, ama mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Pariseyi la mbatl den kup myakan ju.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />La'i yari naarka, kan jen gip mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa kan gip me gam kǝ mǝn Parise ba tlyam wu zili gerka den shirǝm tu wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ shin wani bar gon na mbarǝm tu da'a! Woni mom ko ruhu gon ni ko mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ni shirǝm nan ti gwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Arni bali shirǝmi gip dlom da wur palka wule dlanye har komandayi kum bǝrti den ba wu tlyat Bulus gip dlom da'a. Kan tǝ kem mǝn bi-utu gǝs wu ri ɗǝli tika am da wur na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bigul wu pali ti gip las tu ga mǝn bi-utuyi ba dǝm gwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Zut gaso Babom Yesu dlǝr kosak na Bulus kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zam ɓa'i bigule! Kandatu kǝ yar shirǝm demǝn gip Urushalimawo, ki pa yari shirǝm demǝn gip Roma esi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Yahuda ngen tǝp kǝ ri Bulus eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Bar tlowo, mǝn Yahuda ɓal bika na ɓali gam gǝzǝn gip shirǝm den wi ci ko tla argon da'a se wini wu ri Bulus eka. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Mbarǝm kan mo bi den gudlum shirǝm tuwo wu man hauya rop. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Arni wu ri kar kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa na kiri kǝ bǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ɓal gam gǝmi gip shirǝm wi den mi ci ko mǝ tla argon da'a se mǝnni mǝ ri Bulus eka. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Kǝkǝno, mǝ ndu kǝn na domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda kǝ kar ni bar na shirǝm den komanda den dǝ ɗiri Bulus kar kǝne wule kǝ ndu ni kǝ zam ndǝri shirǝm jen ra gip shirǝm gǝsi. Mi ri ti eka den tǝpe kapǝn tǝ mbubar ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ama nye kawu kǝ Bulus kum argon tu wu gudlumi gwa, kan tǝ te gip las tu mǝn bi-utuyi ba dǝm gwa tǝ yari Bulus ka. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Arni Bulus la bi nǝm gip mir kiri kǝ mǝn bi-utuyi kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ri na nye mbarǝm tu kar komanda. Tǝ na ar gon kan tǝ ri kǝ yari ti gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Kan tǝ ri na nyayi kar komandayi. Nye bari kǝ mǝn bi-utuyi wule, &lt;&lt;Bulus, ɓali gip bom kǝ moni tu ni karim bar kan tǝ wulǝm'e a ɗiri nya mbarǝm kǝn kar ki domici tǝ na argon kan ti yari'i gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Arni komandayi nǝm am kǝ nye mbarǝmi, tǝ dǝl ti markǝm kan tǝ ngen momi kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu kǝ yarim we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Nye kawu kǝ Bulusiyi wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Yahuda ne bi den'e gǝniwo wi ndu kǝ za dǝ si wur na Bulus cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda, wule wu ndu ni wu zam ndǝri shirǝm jen ra den ti. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ama ba kǝ nǝmi wur da'a, domici mbarǝm ra kan man hauya rop kan ghun gǝzǝn wu den ɓuti gǝs gwa. Wu pǝni gam gǝzǝn wi den wi ci barkǝci ko wu tla mal da'a se wi ni wu ri Bulus eka. Kǝkǝno wu ra gǝɗǝn, wu den ɓuti kǝ kopi wur kar kǝ argon tu wu ndu gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Arni komandayi wul nye mbarǝm'e tǝ ndara na dǝli ti kǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ yari murgon'e kǝ yarim shirǝm tu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndara na Bulus Kaisariya cina dǝ Gobna Feliks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Arni komandayi la bi rop gip mǝn bi-utu kan atli nan ti gwa, kan tǝ bi wur bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yemni mǝn bi-utu hauya kutl, mǝn totǝn den pǝrsi mbarǝm hauya myakan na kutl, na mǝn bi-utu mǝn dlan na gesh hauya kutl den bi tetǝn Kaisariya bar kǝ gǝlla am ghanum kǝ gas kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Zami Bulus pǝrsi kan ti to dene gwa, kǝ mbubar nan ti kar Gobna Feliks ba dǝ argon zam ti da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Kan komandayi ba rǝsh tǝlankur na shirǝm nan kǝni.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Ar ɗǝl kar Kǝlaudiya Lisiyas. Dǝ si Mǝn Nartǝni, Gobna Feliks: A shirmi ika.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mǝn Yahuda ni nǝm mbarǝm kǝn wu ndu ri gǝs eka ama a ri na mǝn bi-utu a ɗǝli ti, domici a zam na momi'e tǝ nye mǝn atl kǝ Roma ni. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />A ndu a mom den ununu wu ri ti cina ra, kan a su nan ti kar domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm gǝzǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Arni a zam bar ju wu ri ti cina denewo shirǝm ni den kulci gǝzǝni, ama tǝ pi argon muntu kan ndari dǝ ri ti eka ko dǝ ɓal ti gip bom kǝ moni gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Nan yarimka den jen gudlum wani bar gon kan wu ndu wu pi tiwo, a dǝm kǝ argon da'a ama a ture'i ti teka. A yari mǝn ri gǝs cina den wu ri'i bar ju kan wu ri ti cina dene gwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Arni mǝn bi-utuyi pi argon tu wul wur ragwa, kan wu pǝn Bulus gip gasi wu ndara na dlyami har Antipatǝris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Bar tlowo, mǝn bi-utu kan su den asǝm pal gǝzǝn kǝ ba dǝmi gǝzǝn gip Urushalima kan wu za mǝn totǝn den pǝrsi wu su na Bulus Kaisariya. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Nan wu mbubar Kaisariyawo, arni wu bi gobna Feliks tǝlankuri kan wu bi Bulus am da ti. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Gobnayi zhit tǝlankuriyi kan tǝ ngen momi kar Bulus den kǝti kǝ atli kan tǝra gwa. Nan tǝ kum'e Bulus mǝn Kilikiyano, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aa kum shirǝm gi wokoci tu mǝn ri gi cinayi mbira gwa.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ wule dǝ ne ger den Bulus gip bom kǝ gun Hiridus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Bulus cina dǝ Feliks</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Muri nantam den kariwo, arni Hananiya bar mǝn Keri bar ju ɗiri Yam su Kaisariya, nan ti na kiri kǝ bǝn jen na mǝn momi doka kǝ mǝn Roma gon mǝn sun Tatulus. Kan wu ri shirǝm gǝzǝn den Bulus cina dǝ Gobna Feliks. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Nan la bi Bulus ter gipiwo, arni Tatulus yari argon tu kan wu ri Bulus cina dene gwa nan kǝni, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Nartǝni! Mani kopi na mbarǝm gi na bopya ɗiri mi dǝmi zhǝlili kǝ tlyari wokoci, na sanje bar na womti kan ɗiri atl gǝmi mbuni bar gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Mǝn Nartǝn Feliks, gip kogonge las na tǝp ko ako mǝ goode'i naari. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama kǝ dǝ ba a li'i wokoci nar dawo, a lir ki den kǝ kum nye argon tu mǝ ri kǝ yari gwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ zam mbarǝm kǝno mǝn tli bǝn mbatl yam ni, tǝ den tli mbatl mǝn Yahuda gip atl kundǝrǝndlip. Ti ni'e mǝn kopi na me gam kǝ munju kan Naziri ni gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ra eso, tǝ ndu tǝ li bom kǝ Yamka, arni mǝ nǝm ti. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Mǝ ndu mǝ tloyi ti shirǝm den tǝp tu kan kulci gǝmi yari gwa, ama komanda Lisiyas ter na ndǝrtǝn kǝ bigule tǝ pǝn tika kar mi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor tǝlankuri jen ra na aya kǝn da'a.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Kini kǝ ngen momi kar ti na gam giwo, ki zam ge shirǝm den kup bar ju mǝ ri ti cina ra dene gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Kan nami mǝn Yahudayi ba nda gipi na ɗiri shirǝm gǝzǝn, den'e kup bar ju Tatulus yariwo untuni anra.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Nan gobnayi pi am Bulus kǝ dǝ tǝ shirǝmo, arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom kǝ pi ta tloyi shirǝm mǝn atl kǝn kǝ sheti ghon na womti wi. A kum tǝmi kǝ yari shirǝm ho'i gam gǝn cina da'i. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ki mani momi na gamgi den gip mir muri kan man kutl-cet rop da'a ter karo, a su Urushalima kǝ bote Yami. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Mǝn ɗiri gǝn cinayi zamǝn den bali shirǝm na murgon gip bom kǝ Yami, ko tli mbatl kǝ womti mbarǝm kan gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda ko nǝm gip las gon gip bǝni da'a. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Ko nǝm wi mani tabbate'i bar ju wu ɗirim cina dene gwa dak. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ama a yari'i den a bote Yam kǝ ga ba gǝmi kandatu mǝn kopi Tǝp kǝ Yesu kan ba la wur bi'e me gam kǝ mǝn lar gon gwa. A nǝm kup argon tu Kulci kǝ ga ba gǝmi na kup bar ju rǝsh gip tǝlankur kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ami ra na la'i mbatl den Yam kandatu munju nari, den tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm kǝ kup mǝn pitǝn dlat na mǝn ɗasi tu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Den untuni mbatl gǝn kemǝn kǝ ngeni momi kandatu a dǝm cina dǝ Yam gip dǝmi gǝn na cina dǝ mbarǝm kup da'a.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />&lt;&lt;Den kar kǝ sheti ghon na womti kan ami ra dawo, a pal su Urushalimaka na bar kǝ ne am mbarǝm gǝn kan am ri wur kaar dagwa, na kǝ mboshi dabba kan ba bi Yam gip bota gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Nan wu zamǝn gip Bom kǝ Yamo, a pa'i pi bar ju ba pi kǝ pali mbarǝm dlat cina dǝ Yam gwa wi. Womti mbarǝm ra na mǝn dak, kan za mǝn gip guzǝl-guzǝl pitǝn gon dak. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ama mǝn Yahuda jen kan tli tor gip atl kǝ Asiya ra lasi, wu ma ar mbun wu nǝra ɗe cina da'i wu ɗiri shirǝm gǝzǝni wi nǝra na shirǝm gon demǝn gwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ko mbarǝm jǝn kan ɗe ba mani yari wani bar tu wu zamǝn nari nan a dlǝr cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />nan man yar kan a tli nan ami cina da wur kan a wule, &lt;Den shirǝm kǝ tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm na rai kan a la mbatl dene gwani ami cina da in sekǝni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Arni Feliks, kan yari ti shirǝm nar den Tǝp kǝ Yesu wi, ne zut dǝmi kǝ kumi shirǝmi na wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Wokoci tu Lisiyas komanda mbirawo aa mom argon tu a pi den shirǝm gi tu gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kan tǝ wul mǝn bi-utu kan Bulus gip am dati gwa den dǝ ne ger den ti, ama dǝ za ti tǝ mani ɗǝltǝn na tetǝn gip bom kǝ moniyi, kan dǝ pa za ga berǝm gǝs wu shin ti wu bi ti argon tu tǝ ndu gwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus cina dǝ Feliks na nagǝr gǝs Dǝrusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Den kar kǝ muri na womtiwo, Feliks ter na nagǝr gǝs Dǝrusila muntu kan mǝn Yahuda ni gwa. Tǝ kar bar den Bulus kan tǝ kum shirǝm gǝs den ngǝshtǝn gǝs den Almasihu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ama nan Bulus ci cina na shirǝm den pitǝn dlat, nǝmi gami, na pǝt tu kan Yam baa tloyi mbarǝm shirǝmo, arni Feliks kum bǝrti kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar kǝm untuwi! Ki mani ndaratǝni. Ami ni a zam mbul gono, aa la ki bi esi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ti ni den la'i mbatl den dǝ Bulus bi ti ci icine. Ra untuwo, arni tǝ meti la'i bi Bulus kǝ shirǝm nan ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Den kar kǝ sheti-ghon rop den untuwo, kan Porkiyas Festus ba pal gobna den am kǝ Feliks. Nan Feliks den ndu'i dǝ mǝn Yahuda ndu tǝwo, arni tǝ za Bulus gip bom kǝ moni.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Bulus cina dǝ Festus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Nan Festus mbubar gip atl kǝ Kaisariya kǝ nǝmi pi mbap gǝs kǝ gobna na muri myakano, arni tǝ ndara Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri mǝn bǝn kǝ Yahuda mo nan ti lasi kan wu ɗiri ti shirǝm den Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Wu lir Festus den tǝ nǝmi wur kǝ dǝ pali wur na Bulus su Urushalimaka, domici wu gudlumi ni kǝ ri gǝs eka den tǝpe. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festus nǝmi wur'e, &lt;&lt;Buluso le tǝnika nye mǝn bom kǝ moni gip Kaisariya, ami na gam gǝn ma ar baa dlyam da'a aa te barta. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Naa dǝ kiri mǝn bǝn gin te Kaisariya na mǝni kan wu ɗiri shirǝm gǝs in tǝ pi wani bar gon gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festus dǝm kǝ muri wuzupse ko kutl nan wuri, kan tǝ nde ndaratǝn Kaisariya. Bar tlowo, kan tǝ dǝm den dandi tloyi shirǝm gǝs tǝ wule dǝ teri ti Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Nan Bulus ter gipiwo, mǝn Yahuda ju kan tli tor Urushalima la ti te dlom ka. Wu nǝm ɗiri ndǝri shirǝm gǝzǝn na womti den ti. Shirǝm ju kan wi mani tabbate dagwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kano Bulus ba pi shirǝm ho'i gam gǝs nan kǝni, &lt;&lt;A pi argon mǝgǝni na kulci kǝ mǝn Yahuda ko Bom kǝ Yami ko bar gun kǝ Roma da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ama nan Festus den ndu'i tǝ gholi mbatl mǝn Yahudawo, kan tǝ ngen momi kar Bulus tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ndu kǝ to Urushalima dǝ kum shirǝm gi den bar ju ɗiri den ki barta cina da'ǝma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ama Bulus nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni dlor cina dǝ bom tloyi shirǝm kǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma, las tu ar ndari dǝ tloyim shirǝm gwa. A pi wani bar gon mǝn Yahuda da'a, kandatu ki na gam gi mom gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Amin a cen doka gonka kan ndari dǝ rin ewo, a nge a mǝsh da'a. Ama bar ju mǝn Yahuda ju ba yari demǝn in untun anra dawo, murgon ra kan baa mani bi gǝn am dǝ mbarǝm ju gwa da'a. A liri dǝ si shirǝm gǝn cina dǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Arni Festus den kaar kǝ bali na mǝn bali gǝso, kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ liri den dǝ si shirǝm gi cina dǝ Bar gun kǝ Roma, kar Bar Gun kǝ Romayi ni ngap baa si'i!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festus ngen momi ununu ti pi kar Gun Agǝripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mir muri jem den kariwo Gun Agǝripa na nye mǝn gǝpi gǝs gǝr mǝtli mǝn sun'e Banis te Kaisariya kar Festus kǝ pi ti ɗem na cwattǝni. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nan wu mur barta na womtiwo, Festus yari gunyi argon tu Bulus ra gipi gwa. Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm gon ra kan Feliks za im tǝ ɗe gip bom kǝ moni gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Nan a su Urushalimawo, arni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri mǝn bǝn kǝ Yahuda ɗiri shirǝm den ti kan wu lirǝm den a tloyi ti shirǝm'e dǝ hukunte ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />&lt;&lt;A yari wur'e doka kǝ Roma wule dǝ tloyi mbarǝm shirǝm hukuntetǝn bat na me ger na mǝn ri gǝs cinayi da'a. Ar pa wule dǝ za ti tǝ ho gam gǝs den bar ju ne ti te gamka gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nan wu ter ɗe na mǝno, a dǝl den shirǝmi da'a, arni bar tlowo a dǝm den dandi tloyi shirǝm gǝn kan a wule dǝ ter na mbarǝmi gipi. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Nan mǝn ri gǝs cinayi dlǝr kǝ shirǝmo, ko nǝm wani bar gon ra kan tǝ pi wule kandatu a pǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Kup bar ju wu yariwo dǝli shirǝm ni den adini gǝzǝn na den mbarǝm gon mǝn sun'e Yesu, muntu kan mǝshka, ama Bulus wule tǝra na rai gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />A mom argon tu aa pi gwa da'a nan gam gudluminka den kandatu aa kop kar kǝ shirǝm ju gwa. Ra untuwo, arni a ngen momi kar Bulus in ti ndu tǝ su Urushalima dǝ kum shirǝm gǝs barta den bar ju gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ama Bulus liri den Mǝn Nartǝni, Bar Gun kǝ Roma ni ba tloyi ti shirǝmi. Arni a kem dǝ ne ger den ti kǝ dǝ a pi tǝp tu kan ba si ti kar Bar Gun kǝ Romayi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Arni Agǝripa wul Festus'e, &lt;&lt;Aa ndu a kum mbarǝm tu na gam gǝni.&gt;&gt; Festus nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Gǝniwo ki kum ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus cina dǝ Agǝripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Bar tlowo arni mbarǝm na womti dom wur kǝ pi Agǝripa na Banis bar na womti gip shini nartǝn gǝzǝni. Wu te gip bar kushi gon kan mbarǝm ba dom wur lasi gwa na ga kiri mǝn bi-utu na mbarǝm kan mom wur nar gip bǝni gwa. Kan Festus ba bi bi'e dǝ ɗǝli Bulus teri. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festus wule, &lt;&lt;Gun Agǝripa, na kup munju kan ra nan mi ɗegwa, shin ni mbarǝm kǝni! Kup mbarǝm kǝ Yahuda ɗirim shirǝm den ti na gip Urushalima na ɗe gip Kaisariya, wu den la'i yar den ba dǝ za ti den kaar bar atl da'a. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ama a mani zami argon kan tǝ pi nan ndari dǝ ri ti eka gwa da'a. Ama nan tǝ wule dǝ si shirǝm gǝs kar Mǝn Nartǝn Bar Gun kǝ Romawo, arni a pǝn tor gip mbatl gin den dǝ si ti Romayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ama ami na ko argon nǝm kan a rǝshi Bar Gun kǝ Roma tǝlankur den ti gwa da'a. Ra untuwo arni a ɗir ti ɗe cina da in kup, na cina da'i, Gun Agǝripa, den min ni mǝ ngen momi bar jen kar tiwo, a zam argon tu kan a rǝsh gwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />A shino ar den tǝp da'a dǝ kar bar na nye mǝn bom kǝ moni dǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma bat na yari argon tu ba ri mǝri cina dene gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ho gam gǝs cina dǝ Agǝripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Kan Agǝripa ba wul Bulus'e, &lt;&lt;Ki mani yari shirǝm ho'i gam gi.&gt;&gt; Arni Bulus tlyam tǝ pi am kǝ bi nartǝn kiri kan tǝ nǝm shirǝm ho'i gam gǝs nan kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Gun Agǝripa, ar tǝmim bi nan sekǝno ari kǝ pi shirǝm ho'i gam gǝn den bar ju kup mǝn Yahuda ba wule a pi gwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />A yari ni untu bi tu nan kiwo kǝ mom hoyi kandatu mǝn Yahuda ba dǝm na tǝp ju wura bom na ezǝn gwa. Kǝkǝno, kustu, a lir ki den kǝ kumǝn na te mbatl karka.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Mǝn Yahuda kup mom kandatu a dǝm tun a'i nyayi, den dǝmi gǝn gip atl gǝni, na gip Urushalima es gwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wu momǝn terka, kan wi pa mani yari, arni pǝni mbatl gǝzǝn gwa, den a dǝm ni den tǝp kǝ banyi me gam kǝ kopi Yam gǝmi, a pi ni dǝmi kǝ Ba mǝn Parise. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kǝkǝno, domici la'i mbatl tu ami nari den argon tu Yam wule ti pi ga ba gǝmi gwani ami ɗe sekǝn kǝ dǝ tloyim shirǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Muntu ni'e argon tu Yam wule ti pi gǝsgal gǝmi kutl cet rop kan ba la mbatl kǝ shini latǝn gǝs nan wu bote Yam na mbatl nǝm pǝt na gas gwa. Mǝn Nartǝni, den la'i mbatl tuni mǝn Yahuda ɗirǝm cina dǝ mǝn bǝn ra. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Unun kem gon gip kǝn ba shin'e bar mǝn pitǝn ni da'a den'e Yam ba tli mǝshi mbarǝme?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Ami ma faro a pǝn den a mani pi kup argon tu a mani kǝ nge sun kǝ Yesu kǝ Nazarat tu. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Argon tu a pi gip Urushalima gwa utu. Nan a zam bi kǝ ga kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, a kem ɓal mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu na womti gip bom kǝ moni. Nan ba ri wur ekawo, ami ra gip mǝn kopi kaar kǝ dǝ pi wur untuyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Biyi na womti a kop bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na nǝm nǝm den hukunte gǝzǝni, kǝ dǝ a kem wur kǝ paltǝn na kaar gip ngǝshtǝn gǝzǝn den Yesu. Gip kumi lo gǝn den wuro a kop gip kiri bǝn kǝ kari ma kǝ kumi wur dli.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus yari gǝs kǝ paltǝn gǝs mǝn kopi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />&lt;&lt;Bulus ci cina tǝ wule, &lt;Mǝn Nartǝni, gasi gon gip ɓomi asǝm juni a su Dimashka na rǝshi tǝlankur kan yari'e a mani pi na bii bi kǝ kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Gunye, ami den tǝp gǝn nan pǝt to dlom yamo, arni pǝlǝt a shin bar cirtǝn sur yami. Cirtǝn tu kan man kǝ pǝt gwa, kan ba cir karǝm na ga berǝm ɓomi asǝm gǝni. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Arni kup gǝmi mǝ nda atlka, kan a kum yar gon ba wulǝm gip bi kǝ mǝn Yahuda'e, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, unun kem kǝ kumim dli rawu? Kǝdlǝm pitǝn ni kǝ dlan ki namǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Arni a ngen momi a wule, &lt;Wo ni'e ki, Babomi?&gt; Kan Babom ba nǝmim'e, &lt;Ami ni'e Yesu, muntu kǝ kumi ti dli gwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Kǝkǝno tlyami kǝ dlǝr den asǝm gi. A ɗǝl ni kar ki kǝ dǝ a pali'i zher mǝn yari argon tu kǝ shin demǝn kan aa pal a gode'i cina ɗe gwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Aa ɗǝli'i gip am dǝ mbarǝm gin mǝn Isra'ila na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa. Aa kar ki ni kar wur <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />kǝ dǝ kǝ ɓul ger gǝzǝn wu mani shini bari. Wu bali kaar shini bar gip dǝmǝn wu mani shini gip cirtǝni. Wu ɗǝlka gip am dǝ Shetan wu pal kar Yami tǝ dǝm gun gip mbatl gǝzǝni. Untu ni wi zam dǝ pǝni wur warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka kan dǝ Yam bi wur las gip munju kan pali wur dlat tǝp kǝ ba ngǝshtǝn demǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus shirǝm den mbap gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Bulus ci cina na shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;Gun Agǝripa, arni kem a nge kopi ruya tu a shin sur yam gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />A pi munju kan gip Dimashka wazu gǝn kǝ nǝm, kano munju kan gip bǝn Urushalima gwa na gip atl kǝ Yahuda kup, na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da ma. A pi wur wazu den wu ci atl gam wu pal kar Yami, kan wu pi bar ju baa gode'e wu ci atl gam wi tǝp kǝ ba mbap gǝzǝni. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Muntu ni kem mǝn Yahuda nǝmǝn nan ami gip Bom kǝ Yam gwa, wu ndu rigǝn eka. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ama Yam ni pi ta nem am ra ar ba ɗir sekǝn kan a dlǝr ɗe kǝ yari kogonge mbarǝm ko-ako gwa. Argon ni a yari bom na muntu kan ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam na Musa yari den baa pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ar nǝm den dǝ Almasihu kum dli, kan tǝ dǝm kǝ nǝm gip tlitǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝme. Tǝ yari shirǝm den cirtǝn kǝ zami ɗǝltǝn kǝ mbarǝm gǝs mǝn Isra'ila na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Nan ar ɗir den muntuwo, arni Festus la yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bulus gam ɓuli'i kawi! Kulci gi na naari kem kǝ te mǝn zhe'e kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ama Bulus nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn Nartǝn Festus, ami mǝn zhe'e ni da'a! Ge shirǝm ni a yari. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Bar ju pini na ghuuni da'a. A mom'e Gun Agǝripa mom bar ju. Ar ni kem a shirǝm nan ti bat na bǝrti. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Gun Agǝripa, kǝ ngǝsh ki den shirǝm kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝn kǝ Yama? A mom kǝ pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Arni Agǝripa wul Bulus'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin wule gip nye wokoci kǝno ki palim Kǝristaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bulus nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ko kǝ heli ko tlyari wokoci ni ma, shirǝm na Yam gǝn den ki na nami gin kup kan den kumi gǝn sekǝn gwa ni'e kǝ pal ni kandatu ami ra gwa, bat na sarsari jǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Arni gunyi, na gobna, na Banis na kup munju njon nan wur tlyami. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Arni wu za kushiyi, nan wu den shirǝm na ezǝno, arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝn den pi argon tu baa kem dǝ ri ti eka ko dǝ la ti gip bom kǝ moni gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Kan Agǝripa ba wul Festus'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ wule dǝ pǝn shirǝmi tǝ si Bar Gun Kǝ Roma gwani dawo, da za mbarǝm kǝn tǝ ndara wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Bulus to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kǝ ndaratǝn Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Nan wu ne den mi to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal mǝ ndara Italiyawo, arni wu la Bulus na mir mǝn bom kǝ moni jen am dǝ bar mǝn bi-utu kǝ Roma gon mǝn sun'e Yuliyas, muntu kan ra gip Me gam kǝ Mǝn Bi-utu Kǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma gwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Kan mǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal gon kǝ Adǝramitiyum, muntu kan ne den ti dlǝr kǝ ba shu'i na yemi gosgam bi-ɓula na womti gip atl kǝ Asiya gwa, kan mǝ ɓe cina. Aristarkus, mbarǝm kǝ gip bǝn kǝ Tasalonika kan gip atl kǝ Makidoniya ra nan mi.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Bar tlowo arni mǝ mbubar gip Sidon. Yuliyas pi Bulus mbuni bar na za'i gǝs tǝ ri shin ga berǝm gǝs kǝ dǝ wu bi ti bar ju tǝ ndu gwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Mǝ za barta kan mǝ kop den gam mal esi. Mǝ mbubar kosak na atl kǝ Saipǝros nan itǝr za mi mǝ ri las tu mǝ ndu ritǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Nan mǝ jikat bar dlyami ɓula kan kosak na Kilikiya na Pamfiliyawo, kan mǝ ter gip bǝn kǝ Mira gip atl kǝ Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Barta ni bar mǝn bi-utuyi zam kungǝlǝn jikat mal kǝ Alekzandǝriya kan ne gam Italiya gwa, arni tǝ la mi gipi.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Mǝ kop na kungǝlǝn jikat mali ɗem-ɗem kǝ muri na womti, den ta ndotǝn na itǝri kan mǝ mbubar kosak na bǝn kǝ Kǝnidus. Nan itǝr baa za mi mǝ mani ci cina dawo, arni mǝ kop tǝp markǝm atl kǝ Kǝrita kan te dlom bar ɓulaka kosak na bǝn kǝ Salmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Mǝ kop bi mal kǝ Kǝritayi na banyi mǝ mbubar las gon kan ba la ti bi'e Mbuni Badǝmi, kosak na bǝn kǝ Lasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ɓomi asǝm gǝmi dǝl naari, nan ar dǝm'e den kaar Pǝt Guzum Mal ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gas tu kan ba mbosh mar den bi pǝni warwat pitǝn kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila gwa. Ba pi ni gip pa'i muri kǝ kyar ghanum (Satumba) ar te gip kyar kǝ kutl (Oktoba). Wokoci tuwo ba pi itǝr nar gip bar ɓula'i. </char></note>kan ci cina gǝmi den gam mali dǝm bar kǝ bǝrti gwa. Arni Bulus wul wur'e, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, a shin'e ci cina na ɓomi asǝm gǝmi ra gip tli mbatli. Ar ba dǝmi ho bar kungǝlǝnyi da'a na holi zami gosgam kǝ gipi, kan na holi zami dǝmi gǝmi na rai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ama bar mǝn bi utuyi ne kǝm den argon tu Bulus yari gwa da'a, kan tǝ kop shirǝm kǝ mǝn dǝli kungǝlǝn jikat mali na ba-mǝn kungǝlǝnyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nan bane kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan argon baa zam da'ayi mbun hoyi kǝ ci watlǝn gipi dawo, arni na womti gip mǝn mbap kǝ kungǝlǝnyi pǝn gip mbatl gǝzǝn den mǝ ci cina na tetǝn den gam male. La'i mbatli ni'e kǝ dǝ mǝ mbubar Finiks dǝ ci watlǝn barta. Finikswo ho ba ne kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan argon baa zam da'a gwa ni gip atl kǝ Kǝrita, kan ɓuli bar ɓula tǝp kudu kan ba shin Yemma na Arewa kan ba shin Yemma katl gwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zhe'e tlitǝn kǝ mal bar ɓula'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Nan nye itǝr nǝm ɓe tor tǝp kuduwo, arni mǝn dǝli kungǝlǝn jikat mali pǝn'e wi ci cina na argon tu wu ndu pi gwawi. Arni wu dǝl bar gǝlla tu kan ba kem dǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali dlǝr kǝ ba lasi nǝm gwa kan wu kop na kungǝlǝnyi markǝm bi ɓula kosak na atl kǝ Kǝrita. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ko njem arri kǝtǝgon da'a anni bar itǝr gon kan ba la ti bi Arewa kan ba shin Gabas ba ɓe ter den gam mali. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Kan itǝri ba ɓo kungǝlǝn jikat mali ar ba dǝm'e mǝn dǝliyi i'mbu tari tǝp gip itǝri da'a, arni wu za ti katl tǝ nde itǝri kari. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nan mǝ kop den bishidi gon kan ba la bi lasi'e Kaudawo, mǝ mani zami ɗǝli nye heli kungǝlǝn jikat mali kan ɓal den kaar kǝ bar kungǝlǝn jikat mali bǝse ar cenka gwa, ama na banyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Nan wu tli tikawo arni wu ne to den bar kungǝlǝn jikat mali ka. Bǝse dǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali likawo arni wu ngen zap ra kan wu ɓalka. Wu kum bǝrti kǝ dǝ itǝri byal wur den sǝnges kǝ Sirtis kosak na atl kǝ Libǝya, arni wu dǝl gǝlla kan ba la gip mal ar kem kungǝlǝn jikat mali kǝ tetǝn ɗem-ɗem den gam mal gwa, kan wu za kungǝlǝn jikat mali itǝr den dǝli gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Bar tlowo, nan bar itǝri ci cina ar ba dǝm'e ar den pi ta bali kungǝlǝn jikat mali ɗe na bartawo, arni wu nǝm byali gosgam kan gipi gwa gip male. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Den pǝt kǝ myakano, arni mir mǝn mbap den kungǝlǝn jikat mali yem jen gip bar kǝ mbap kǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali wu wika. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mǝ mani shini pǝt na ga zǝnges da'a kǝ muri na womti, kan itǝr den ta zhe'e pitǝno, arni kup mǝ ɗǝli mbatlka den zami ɗǝltǝne.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Gip muri ju kupo murgon ra kan la argon bi gwa da'a. Bulus dlǝr cina da wur tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir moni, dǝ wule kǝ kumǝn far den ba mǝ zani Kǝrita dawo, litǝn kǝ bar na holi bar ju ba ri kǝ zami gǝmi da'a. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ama kǝkǝno a lir kǝn den kǝ ɓa ni mbatl dlom gami. Murgon ra gip mi kan baa hol rai gǝs gwa da'a. Kungǝlǝn jikat mali ni katl mi holi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ghur kǝ gaso mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ɗǝl karǝmi, muntu ami gwas ni, tin es a bote ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Tǝ wulǝm'e, &lt;Bulus, ba dǝ kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, domici ki dlǝr cina dǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma. Yam gip pi'i mbuni bar gǝs bi'i kup munju kan gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kǝn kan nan ki gwawi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ra untuwo, dlǝri ni mbatl gini, domici a ngǝshǝm den Yam'e untuni ar ba pi kandatu tǝ yarim gwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ama itǝr baa byal mi den bar atl kǝ te dlom mal gonka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litǝn kǝ Kungǝlǝn jikat mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Gip dlom gas kǝ muri kutl-cet wupse kǝ zhe'e pitǝn kǝ itǝr kan den ta dǝli gǝmi gip bar ɓula Baharo, mir mǝn dǝli gǝmi gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali kum den mǝ mbi kosak na atlwi. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Arni wu gode dlyamtǝn kǝ mali kan wu zam an ri desi asǝm hauya mukka. Cina njemo wu pa gode kan wu zam dlyamtǝn kǝ mali ri desi asǝm hauya wupse na kutl. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Wu kum bǝrti kǝ dǝ itǝr kar kungǝlǝn jikat mali ar byal mi den tat bi ɓula'i. Ra untuwo arni wu shu giɓǝr bar jen wupse tǝp kaar kungǝlǝn jikat mali kan ba dǝl ti kaar gwa kǝ dǝ ar ci cina na kǝtǝr den gam male. Kan wu ndu nar den dǝ bar tlo bǝle. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Gip ndu'i wu za kungǝlǝn jikat mali wu kǝtǝr gǝzǝno, arni jen gip mǝn dǝliyi si nye heli kungǝlǝn jikat mali gǝs male. Den ba dǝ mbarǝm mom unun wu ndu pi dawo arni wu pi wule wuri ni kǝ la'i bar gǝlla kan ba kem kungǝlǝn jikat mali kǝ dlǝri gwa cina dǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Arni Bulus wul komanda kǝ mǝn bi-utu na mǝn bi-utuyi'e, &lt;&lt;Ga mǝn dǝli kungǝlǝn jikat mali ni dǝm gipi dawo, ki mani zami ɗǝltǝn na rai da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Arni mǝn bi-utuyi tlo zap ju kan ɓal den nye heli kungǝlǝn jikat mali kan wu za ti ar kop male.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Kapǝn dǝ bartlowo, Bulus lir kup gǝzǝn den wu ci fingali, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn den ta damtǝn gip muri kutl-cet wupse ju kǝ ci argon da'a. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />A lir kǝn den kǝ cini fingali. Ki ndu untu, kǝ sa nǝra. Ko nǝm ta gam kǝ gon baa jilka da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nan tǝ pa'i yari muntuwo, arni tǝ pǝn bǝredi, kan ti goode Yam cina da wuri, tǝ cen kan tǝ nǝm ci. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Kano kup gǝzǝn ba zam ɓa'i bigule, kan wu ci fingali. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mbarǝm zangu rop na hauya kutl cet myakan na kutl cet mukka (276) ni'e womtitǝn gǝmi kan gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali gwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Nan kup ci fingal ar kǝm wuro, kan ba ca giɓǝrtǝn kǝ gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali na wi gosgam kǝ alkama kan gipi gwa su malka.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Nan bar tlowo, wu mani momi atli da'a, ama wu shin nye tlorkoko gon na bishidi mǝn singesi, arni wu pǝn wule wi mani kǝtǝr na kungǝlǝn jikat mali den atl wu mbubar den singes bi-ɓula'i. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Arni wu tlo zap ɓali bar gǝlla ju kan ba dǝl kungǝlǝn jikat mali kaar gwa, wu za wur su malka. Kan wu pa pǝtl las tu ba ɓal bar tu kan ba bali kungǝlǝn jikat mali gwa, kan wu tli bibako kǝ kungǝlǝn jikat mali kǝ cina dede den tǝp itǝri kan wu ne gam den bishidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ama nan kungǝlǝn jikat mali den tetǝno, arni an ɓo tu bar atl kǝ ba motǝn kǝ ɓula rop kan ba dlǝr gǝsi. Gam kungǝlǝn jikat mali ba te njuka den bishidi, ba'i jiti ti da'a. Ndǝrtǝn kǝ zap mal bar ɓula'i kem tǝp kaar kungǝlǝn jikat mali ba nǝm roɓǝstǝnka.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Mǝn bi-utuyi gudlumi kǝ ri mir mǝn bom kǝ moniyi kup eka, den ba dǝ wu mani jeti mal kan wi ni wu mbubar bishidiwo wu kǝtǝr gǝzǝn da'a. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ama komanda kǝ mǝn bi-utuyi ba ndu tǝ za Bulus na rai. Arni tǝ za wur wu pi argon tu kan wu gudlumi gwa da'a. Arni ma tǝ bi bi den'e kup munju mani jeti malo, wu nda gip mal wu te den bishidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Nami ba kop kaari na nǝmi katako ko ceni bar jen kǝ dli kungǝlǝn jikat mali. Na untuni kup gǝmi mbubar bishidi argon zam mi da'a.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Bulus den bishidi kǝ Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Nan mǝ zam mǝ mbubar den bishidi argon zam mi dawo, kan mǝ zam na momi den ba la ni bi atl kǝ te dlom bar ɓula'i ka'e Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Mǝn atli nǝm mi na am rop-rop. Nan wokociyi ghon den ndetǝne kan las ra na iɗatǝno, arni wu pi mi ɗem nan kǝn na hori mi utu. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bulus dom gam nyash ɗiri. Nan tǝ den wi gam nyashi te gip utu kawo, arni utu ghughup karndi gon kan tǝ ɗǝl ter tǝ ngas Bulus den ame. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Nan mbarǝm kǝ bǝni shin ici'i den am kǝ Buluso, arni wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ba ni mǝn ri mbarǝm eka ni, domici kup na zhe'e pitǝn kǝ bar ɓula ri ti eka da'a, Fate, yam mǝn tloyi mbarǝm shirǝm kor den argon tu wu pi gwa, baa za ti na rai da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ama Bulus byal ici'i te gip utuka, ko njem argon zam ti da'a. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Mbarǝm kǝ bǝni den ne ger wu shin ko ti nda atl mǝshi ama nan wu shin ar dǝm narwi ama argon zam ti dawo, arni wu sanje mbatl gǝzǝnka kan wu wule, tǝ nye yam gon ni.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Kosak na lasiwo atl kǝ bari kǝ atl kǝ te dlom malika gon ni mǝn sun Pobǝliyas. Tǝ pi mi ɗem na ɗirtǝn rǝn bom da tika, kan tǝ pi mi ho bar kǝ muri myakan. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Basi Pobǝliyas ra ɓom atl den kumi dli zazzaɓi na kǝtǝr lǝpe. Bulus te kǝ shini gǝsi, kan tǝ shirǝm na Yam tǝ ne am den ti, kan tǝ pǝni ti kumi dliyika. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Nan muntu piwo, arni nami mǝn kumi dli kǝ atli kan te dlom malika ɗir kan ba pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝn ka. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Wu bi mi nartǝn den tǝp na womti. Nan mǝ ri kǝ totǝn gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal mǝ ndarawo, arni wu bi mi bar ju kup kan mǝ ndu gwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus mbubar Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Den kaar kǝ kyar myakan na litǝn kǝ kungǝlǝn jikat maliwo, arni mǝ jikat mali gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali gon kǝ atl kǝ Alekzandǝriya kan ci watlǝn lasi gwa. Ba la ni bi kungǝlǝn jikat mali'e, Mir Ngumci yam Kasto na Poluks. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Mǝ mbubar bǝn kǝ Sirakusa kan mǝ dǝm lasi kǝ muri myakan. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Mǝ za barta kan mǝ ci cina na ɓomi asǝm den gam mal mǝ mbubar gip bǝn kǝ Rigiyom. Bar tlowo, arni itǝr ɓe tor tǝp kudu, kan mǝ mbubar Putiyoli den pǝt kǝ rop. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Lasi ni mǝ zam mir ɓyar jen kan lir mi den mǝ dǝm nan wur kǝ muri nyingi gwa. Na untu ni mǝ mbubar Roma.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Nan mir ɓyar kǝ gip Roma kum den mǝn den tǝpo, arni wu ɓom asǝm har wu mbubar Bar Pǝt kǝ Abiyus, jen eso wu mbubar las tu kan ba la ti bi'e Ba Ci Fingal Myakan gwa gip mbori gǝmi. Nan Bulus shin wuro ar ɓa'i ti bigule kan tǝ goode Yami. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nan mǝ te gip Romawo, kan ba za Bulus tǝ dǝm gip kushi kǝ gam gǝsi, na mǝn bi-utu gon mǝn ne ger den ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus pi wazu gip Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Nan mǝ mbubar na muri myakano, arni Bulus la bi domtǝn kǝ kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Nan wu dom wuro, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mir ɓyari, a pi mbarǝm gǝmi wani bar gon da'a ko argon mǝgǝni na bar ju mǝ zam kar ga kori gǝmi gwa. Ama wu nǝmǝn gip Urushalima kan ba la'ǝm am dǝ mǝn Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Den kaar kǝ ngeni momi karǝm den unun a piwo, mǝn Romayi ndu wu za'ǝm a ndara, domici wu zam den a pi argon kan ndari dǝ rim eka da'a. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ama nan mǝn Yahudayi ngewo, muntuni kem a pǝn shirǝm gǝnka a ri cina dǝ Bar Gun kǝ Roma. Ba'e den ami na shirǝm kan aa ri mbarǝm gǝn cina dene gwa ni da'a. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Muntu ni kem a liri kǝ dǝ a shin kǝn kan a pa shirǝm nan kǝne. Amin kǝn ɓali na sarsari domici a momwi den'e muntu kan mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila ba la mbatl den ti mbirawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Kan wu nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ zam rǝshi tǝlankur gon tor Yahuda den ki da'a. Gon ra es gip mir ɓyar kan tor na pel shirǝm kǝ wani bar gon ko yari argon den ki da'a. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Mǝ mom den'e ko-ako mbarǝm den shirǝm nge me gam gin tu, ama mi ndu mǝ kum argon tu kǝ shin den tǝp gin tu gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Arni wu ne pǝt gon kǝ metǝn na Bulus, kan mbarǝm na womti ba dom wur las tu Bulus ba dǝm gwa. Tun kǝ cigǝni ar ba ri gasi tǝ ceti wur gamka na yari wur den dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝme. Ndu'i gǝs ni'e tǝ dǝl mbatl gǝzǝn den Yesu na yari wur gip Kulci kǝ Musa na rǝshi tǝlankur kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Jen gip wur nǝm argon tu tǝ yari gwa, ama jeno wu nge nǝmika. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Wu nge gǝzǝn kan wu nǝm ndaratǝn nan Bulus pa'i yari shirǝm kǝn gwa, &lt;&lt;Ruhu kǝ Yam yari dlat nan tǝ wul ga kori gin tǝp bi dǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya gwa'e,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;Rǝ kar mbarǝm ju kǝ yari wur'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ki pi ta kumi ama ki mom da'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ki pi ta zhuwi ama ki mani gane dak.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Domici mbatl kǝ mbarǝm ju ba'i pǝn bar da'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Wi mani kumi bar na kǝm gǝzǝn da'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Wu mbǝsh ger gǝzǝn kawi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Untuni dawo, wi mani shini bar na ger gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Wu kum bar na kǝm gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">dǝ mbatl gǝzǝn mani momi bari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kan wu pal karǝm, kǝ dǝ a pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />&lt;&lt;Ra untuwo, a ndu kǝ mom'e, shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ zami ɗǝltǝn gip warwat pitǝn tuwo an ri kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwawi, eso wi kumi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />(Nan tǝ yar muntuwo, arni mǝn Yahudayi tlyam wu pi ta nge shirǝm kǝ ezǝni.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip kor tǝlankur jeno aya tu ra da'a.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bulus dǝm kǝ sheti ghon rop gip bom tu kan tǝ ɓatl kǝ nye dǝmi gǝsi gwa. Tǝ pi ta nǝmi kup munju ɗir kǝ shini gǝs gwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Tǝ shirǝm na mbarǝm den dǝmi kǝ Yam Gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝme. Tǝ kulci wur den Babom Yesu Almasihu. Tǝ shirǝm bat na bǝrti kan ko nǝm murgon ngen tǝ wul ti'e tǝ za da'a.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>